<?xml version="1.0" encoding="UTF-8"?>
<usx version="3.0">
  <book code="LUK" style="id">- ZARAMO Bible Version</book>
  <para style="h">LUKA</para>
  <para style="toc1">USENGA UNOGILE WA YESU KILISTO KAMBA VIWANDIKIGWE NA LUKA</para>
  <para style="toc2">LUKA</para>
  <para style="toc3">Luk.</para>
  <para style="mt2">USENGA UNOGILE WA YESU KILISTO KAMBA VIWANDIKIGWE NA</para>
  <para style="mt1">LUKA</para>
  <para style="imt">ULONGOZI</para>
  <para style="ip">Usenga Unogile wa Yesu Kilisto Kamba Viwandikigwe na Luka uwo usenga umwe kulawa m'vitabu vine va Lagano da Isambi usimulila ugima wa Yesu Kilisto. Vitabu vose vino vine vokemigwa, “Injili,” nhegulo yake, “Usenga Unogile.” Vitabu vino vandikigwa na Matayo, Maluko, Luka, na Yohana kipigiti Yesu viyeshile kudanganhika. Luka handike vitabu va mbuli za Yesu ziiyeka, ila vivija kandika mbuli zawatendile wanahina wa Yesu kipigiti viyeshile kudanganhika na kuzuka, kitabu kikemigwa Sang'hano za Watumigwa. Haduhu munhu yakitangile kipigiti chenyego hasa Usenga Unogile wa Yesu Kilisto Kamba Viwandikigwe na Luka viwandikigwe ama hanhu hawandikigwe, ila wasomi bwando wotogola kamba siku wandikigwa muna imilao ya 70 songela kuvumbuka kwa Yesu Kilisto.</para>
  <para style="ip">Luka iyo yandike, yakalile mganga wa usipitali, vija vayandike na vija vayawikile goya uulonzi volagusa kamba kakala munhu yasomile. Luka kalonda kwandika mbuli za Yesu zili kweli, yosimulila vinhu kamba vivija vuvilawilile, giladi wanhu wavitange goya (<char style="xt"><ref loc="LUK 1:1-3">1:1-3</ref></char>). Heyo hakalile Muyahudi (Kol 4:10-14), na vija viyandike, kandika mnzila ya kuwatenda wanhu hawali Wayahudi wadahe kuvimanya. Ino yolagusa vinogile kabisa vija viyasimulile mbuli za Wayahudi ziwatendaga (1:8).</para>
  <para style="ip">Usenga Unogile wa Yesu Kilisto Kamba Viwandikigwe na Luka uilinga ng'hani na vitabu va Matayo na Maluko, kwavija vosimulila kinhu kimwe mnzila imwe. M'vitabu vino vidatu, Luka kasambula ng'hani mvumbuka ya Yohana M'batiza. Vivija Luka kagong'ondeza kugela kumgongo mbuli muisula ya <char style="xt"><ref loc="LUK 3:3">3:3</ref></char>, 11:4, 23:34, 24:47, na nhambiko muisula ya 3:21, 5:16, 6:12, 11:1-12, na 22:32.</para>
  <para style="iot">Gali Mgati ya Ikitabu</para>
  <para style="io1">1. Muisula ya <char style="ior"><ref loc="LUK 1:1-4">1:1-4</ref></char>, Luka koutambuza usenga wake na kulonga kilamso cha kwandika ikitabu.</para>
  <para style="io1">2. Muisula ya <char style="ior"><ref loc="LUK 1:5-4:13">1:5—4:13</ref></char>, Luka kosimulila mvumbuka ya Yesu na vija viyasasaligwe sama ya sang'hano.</para>
  <para style="io1">3. Hanhu hakulu hasigale mkitabu cha Usenga Unogile wandikigwe na Luka muisula ya <char style="ior"><ref loc="LUK 4:14-21:38">4:14—21:38</ref></char>, kolonga sang'hano yaasang'hane Yesu, hasa mizonza yaatendile na mbuli zayafundize.</para>
  <para style="io1">4. Muna zisula ndatu za ikimambukizo, <char style="ior"><ref loc="LUK 22-24">22—24</ref></char>, kosimulila vija Yesu viyadanganhike, viyazikigwe, na kuzuka kulawa mkudanganhika.</para>
  <chapter number="1" style="c" sid="LUK 1"/>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="LUK 1:1"/>Mkulu Teofilo, wanhu bwando waiyoha kwandika mumnhongo mbuli zija zivikizwe mmwetu. <verse eid="LUK 1:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="LUK 1:2"/>Wandika kamba vija vuzikalile zisimulilwa na waja wazonile na meso gao songela haichanduso, awo wakalile wozipeta. <verse eid="LUK 1:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="LUK 1:3"/>Avo na nie, Mkulu, avija vunizilolile goya mbuli zino zose songela ichanduso chake, nivigesa vinoga nikwandikile vinogile. <verse eid="LUK 1:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="LUK 1:4"/>Notenda vino giladi na gweye uitange ikweli ya mbuli zija zuufundizigwe.<verse eid="LUK 1:4"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Mvumbuka ya Yohana M'batiza Yohokoligwa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="LUK 1:5"/>Kipigiti Helode Mkulu vayakalile mndewa wa Yudea,<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">1:5 </char><char style="fk" closed="false">Yudea </char><char style="ft" closed="false">nhegulo yake </char><char style="fqa" closed="false">isi yose ya Palestina.</char></note> kukala na mkulu wa nhambiko imwe twaga jake Zakalia, yakalile wa dale da watambika dikemigwa Abiya. Mtwanzi wake kakala yokemigwa Elizabeti, na heyo kakala wa lukolo lwa mtambika Haloni. <verse eid="LUK 1:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="LUK 1:6"/>Wose wabili wakala womnogela Mulungu na wawinza ndagizi zose za Mndewa bila kusigaza. <verse eid="LUK 1:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="LUK 1:7"/>Zakalia na Elizabeti wakala wabule wana, kwavija Elizabeti kakala bule sambo, na hewo wose wabili wakala wavyele ng'hani.<verse eid="LUK 1:7"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="LUK 1:8"/>Zua dimwe Zakalia kakala yosang'hana sang'hano za watambika Mng'anda ya Mulungu, kwavija dale jake da watambika dikala mzamu. <verse eid="LUK 1:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="LUK 1:9"/>Kamba viwazoele kutenda watambika, kula imgwila Zakalia yachole kufusha ubane kuna ikilingo cha kulavila nhosa. Avo kengila Mng'anda ya Mndewa, <verse eid="LUK 1:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="LUK 1:10"/>wanhu wose wakala wakiilundize hanze wotambika kipigiti hicho cha kufusha ubane.<verse eid="LUK 1:10"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="LUK 1:11"/>Msenga wa Mndewa wa kuulanga kamulawilila, kema ng'ambu ya ukulume ya ikilingo cha kufushila ubane. <verse eid="LUK 1:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="LUK 1:12"/>Zakalia viyamuwene, kasinhuka, bwembwe dimwingila. <verse eid="LUK 1:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="LUK 1:13"/>Msenga wa Mulungu wa kuulanga kamulongela, “Zakalia, sambiudumbe kwavija Mulungu kazihulika nhambiko zako, avo Elizabeti mtwanzi wako kokulelela mwana mbigalo, na gweye umgwelele twaga dikemigwa Yohana. <verse eid="LUK 1:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="LUK 1:14"/>Kosekelela na kudeng'ha ng'hani, na wanhu bwando woitoela ng'henze mvumbuka yake! <verse eid="LUK 1:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="LUK 1:15"/>Kowa mkulu hameso ga Mndewa. Hang'wa ugimbi ama kinhu chochose cha kukola. Komemezigwa Loho wa Mulungu songela mmunda mwa mamaake. <verse eid="LUK 1:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="LUK 1:16"/>Kowabweza wanhu bwando wa Islaeli kuli Mndewa Mulungu wao. <verse eid="LUK 1:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="LUK 1:17"/>Kochola haulongozi wa Mndewa na mhiko na loho ya Eliya, kowaduganyiza tena watata na wana zao, kowatenda wanhu wadulu wawe wende avo yamtandile Mndewa wanhu zake.”<verse eid="LUK 1:17"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="LUK 1:18"/>Zakalia kamuuza msenga wa Mulungu wa kuulanga, “Novitangaze kamba mbuli zino zowa avo? Kwavija nie na mtwanzi wangu tose twa wavyele.”<verse eid="LUK 1:18"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="LUK 1:19"/>Msenga wa Mulungu wa kuulanga kamwidika, “Nie iyo Gabulieli, mtumigwa nimaga haulongozi wa Mulungu, nitumigwa nikugalile usenga uno unogile. <verse eid="LUK 1:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="LUK 1:20"/>Ila kwavija huzitogole mbuli zangu zondazivikile mumsimu wake, kowa bubui, hudaha kulonga mbaka zua dija gano gose ganikulongele vondagalawilile.”<verse eid="LUK 1:20"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="LUK 1:21"/>Kipigiti hicho wanhu wakala wom'beta Zakalia kuno wokanganya habali kokawa muja Mng'anda ya Mulungu. <verse eid="LUK 1:21"/><verse number="22" style="v" sid="LUK 1:22"/>Viyalawile hanze, kakala hadaha kulonga nao, avo wavitanga kamba kakala yonile nzozi Mng'anda ya Mulungu. Kakala hadaha kulonga, kakala yolonga mkulagusa na makono.<verse eid="LUK 1:22"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="LUK 1:23"/>Kipigiti chake cha kusang'hanika Muing'anda ya Mulungu vukimalile, kabwela ukae. <verse eid="LUK 1:23"/><verse number="24" style="v" sid="LUK 1:24"/>Mkipigiti kiguhi mtwanzi wake kapata inda, avo kakala hakae yake milenge mitano. <verse eid="LUK 1:24"/><verse number="25" style="v" sid="LUK 1:25"/>Kalonga, “Hakimambukizo, Mndewa kanyonela bazi, kanisegezela kinyala changu mwa wanhu.”<verse eid="LUK 1:25"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Mvumbuka ya Yesu Yohokoligwa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="LUK 1:26"/>Muna umulenge wa sita wa inda ya Elizabeti, Mulungu kamulagiza msenga wake wa kuulanga, yokemigwa Gabulieli, hakiwambo cha Galilaya, kikemigwa Nazaleti. <verse eid="LUK 1:26"/><verse number="27" style="v" sid="LUK 1:27"/>Kakala na usenga wa mndele imwe mhambe, mkasano wa munhu imwe twaga jake Usufu kulawa mulukolo lwa Mndewa Daudi. Twaga jake Maliamu. <verse eid="LUK 1:27"/><verse number="28" style="v" sid="LUK 1:28"/>Msenga wa Mulungu wa kuulanga kamcholela kamulongela, “Nokulamsa! Mndewa ka hamoja nagwe na kakumoteza ng'hani!” <figure style="fig" alt="Angel visits Mary" file="AngelVisitsMary_Luke1.26-38_DN00401.jpg" size="col" copy="Illustrations by Darwin Dunham © United Bible Societies, 1989, Nairobi, Kenya." ref="1:28">Msenga wa Mulungu wa kuulanga komulawilila Maliamu.</figure><verse eid="LUK 1:28"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="LUK 1:29"/>Maliamu kazanywa ng'hani sama ya mbuli zija za msenga wa Mulungu wa kuulanga na kugelegeza choni nhegulo ya mbuli zija. <verse eid="LUK 1:29"/><verse number="30" style="v" sid="LUK 1:30"/>Msenga wa Mulungu wa kuulanga kamulongela, “Sambiudumbe, Maliamu, kwavija Mulungu kanogelwa nagwe. <verse eid="LUK 1:30"/><verse number="31" style="v" sid="LUK 1:31"/>Kopata inda, komulela mwana mbigalo, na gweye kolondigwa umgwelele twaga dikemigwa Yesu. <verse eid="LUK 1:31"/><verse number="32" style="v" sid="LUK 1:32"/>Heyo kowa mkulu na kokemigwa Mwana wa Mulungu Mkulu Ng'hani. Mndewa Mulungu komgwelela kigoda cha undewa kamba tataake Daudi. <verse eid="LUK 1:32"/><verse number="33" style="v" sid="LUK 1:33"/>Avo kowa Mndewa wa lukolo lwa Yakobo milongo yose, Undewa wake hauziga!”<verse eid="LUK 1:33"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="LUK 1:34"/>Maliamu kedika kalonga, “Nie na mhambe. Yodahikaze mbuli ino?”<verse eid="LUK 1:34"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="LUK 1:35"/>Msenga wa Mulungu wa kuulanga kedika kalonga, “Loho wa Mulungu kokuhumulukila, na mhiko za Mulungu Mkulu Ng'hani zokugubika. Avo mwana yondayavumbuke kowa mwana yang'alile, kokemigwa Mwana wa Mulungu. <verse eid="LUK 1:35"/><verse number="36" style="v" sid="LUK 1:36"/>Mgelegeze lumbu jako Elizabeti wamulongile kabule sambo, ila sambi kana inda ya milenge sita hamoja na uvyele wake. <verse eid="LUK 1:36"/><verse number="37" style="v" sid="LUK 1:37"/>Kwavija haduhu mbuli haidahika ha Mulungu.”<verse eid="LUK 1:37"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="38" style="v" sid="LUK 1:38"/>Maliamu kedika kalonga, “Nie na mtumigwa wa Mndewa, na nhendelwe kamba vuulongile.” Abaho, ija msenga wa Mulungu wa kuulanga kahalawa.<verse eid="LUK 1:38"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Maliamu Komtembelela Elizabeti</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" sid="LUK 1:39"/>Kipigiti kidodo hamwande Maliamu kaisasala, hima kachola kuna ikiwambo kili muisi ya vigongovigongo ya Yudea. <verse eid="LUK 1:39"/><verse number="40" style="v" sid="LUK 1:40"/>Kengila muna ing'anda ya Zakalia, kamulamsa Elizabeti. <verse eid="LUK 1:40"/><verse number="41" style="v" sid="LUK 1:41"/>Elizabeti viyahulike ndamsa ya Maliamu, chana king'hele kizumha mkudeng'ha muinda ya Elizabeti. Na Elizabeti kamemezigwa<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">1:41 </char><char style="fk" closed="false">Kamemezigwa Loho wa Mulungu </char><char style="ft" closed="false">nhegulo yake </char><char style="fqa" closed="false">kagweleligwa Loho wa Mulungu.</char></note> Loho wa Mulungu, <verse eid="LUK 1:41"/><verse number="42" style="v" sid="LUK 1:42"/>na kenula dizwi kalonga, “Kumota gweye kubanza watwanzi wose, na imwana yondaumulele kamota! <verse eid="LUK 1:42"/><verse number="43" style="v" sid="LUK 1:43"/>Vilihi mbuli zino ng'hulu zindawilile nie, hata mama wa Mndewa wangu yeze kumwangu? <verse eid="LUK 1:43"/><verse number="44" style="v" sid="LUK 1:44"/>Mhunde vinihulike ndamsa yako, chana king'hele muinda yangu kizumha mkudeng'ha. <verse eid="LUK 1:44"/><verse number="45" style="v" sid="LUK 1:45"/>Kumota gweye utogole kamba gaja gayalongile Mndewa kumwako golawilila!”<verse eid="LUK 1:45"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Maliamu Komtogola Mulungu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="46" style="v" sid="LUK 1:46"/>Na Maliamu kalonga,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="LUK 1:46">“Moyo wangu womuyenzi Mulungu.<verse eid="LUK 1:46"/></para>
  <para style="q2">
    <verse number="47" style="v" sid="LUK 1:47"/>Loho yangu yomdeng'helela Mulungu Mkombola wangu.<verse eid="LUK 1:47"/></para>
  <para style="q2">
    <verse number="48" style="v" sid="LUK 1:48"/>Kwavija kamgelegeza nyakadala wake imwende!</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="LUK 1:48">Avo kusongela lelo wanhu wa milelo yose wong'hema yamotile,<verse eid="LUK 1:48"/></para>
  <para style="q2">
    <verse number="49" style="v" sid="LUK 1:49"/>mmbuli zija ng'hulu Mulungu Mkulu zayanitendele.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="LUK 1:49">Twaga jake ding'ala.<verse eid="LUK 1:49"/></para>
  <para style="q2">
    <verse number="50" style="v" sid="LUK 1:50"/>Kulawa wanhu wa mulelo umwe mbaka mulelo uyagwe</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="LUK 1:50">kowonela bazi awo womdumba heyo.<verse eid="LUK 1:50"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="51" style="v" sid="LUK 1:51"/>Kaugolosa mkono wake mkulu</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="LUK 1:51">na kawapwililisa awo woitopela ngelegeza zao.<verse eid="LUK 1:51"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="52" style="v" sid="LUK 1:52"/>Kawahumulusa wandewa wali na mhiko walawe muna ivigoda vao va undewa,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="LUK 1:52">na kawenula iwakumbulu.<verse eid="LUK 1:52"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="53" style="v" sid="LUK 1:53"/>Wali nzala kawegutiza vinhu vinogile,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="LUK 1:53">na wagoli kawaleka wachole bila kinhu.<verse eid="LUK 1:53"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="54" style="v" sid="LUK 1:54"/>Kakigoga kilagano chayailagane na wahenga zetu,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="LUK 1:54">avo keza kumtaza mtumigwa wake Islaeli.<verse eid="LUK 1:54"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="55" style="v" sid="LUK 1:55"/>Kakumbukila kumonela bazi Ablaham</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="LUK 1:55">na lukolo lake lose milongo yose kamba viwailagane na wahenga zetu!”<verse eid="LUK 1:55"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="56" style="v" sid="LUK 1:56"/>Maliamu kakala na Elizabeti kamba milenge midatu vino, abaho, kabwela ukae yake.<verse eid="LUK 1:56"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Mvumbuka ya Yohana M'batiza</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="57" style="v" sid="LUK 1:57"/>Kipigiti cha Elizabeti kulela kivika, kamulela mwana mbigalo. <verse eid="LUK 1:57"/><verse number="58" style="v" sid="LUK 1:58"/>Wanhu wa mmambwegambwega na walawile mulukolo lwake viwahulike mbuli zija zinogile za mkanganyo Mndewa ziyamtendele, wose wadeng'helela hamoja na heyo.<verse eid="LUK 1:58"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="59" style="v" sid="LUK 1:59"/>Zua da nane weza kumwingiza kumbi imwana, walonda kumgwaa twaga da tataake, Zakalia. <verse eid="LUK 1:59"/><verse number="60" style="v" sid="LUK 1:60"/>Mamaake kalonga, “Ndema! Twaga jake dokemigwa Yohana.”<verse eid="LUK 1:60"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="61" style="v" sid="LUK 1:61"/>Wanhu wamulongela, “Ila mulukolo lwenu haduhu munhu yali na twaga hijo.” <verse eid="LUK 1:61"/><verse number="62" style="v" sid="LUK 1:62"/>Abaho, wamuuza tataake mkumulagusila na makono, womuuza kamba twaga dilihi doyolonda yagweleligwe mwanage.<verse eid="LUK 1:62"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="63" style="v" sid="LUK 1:63"/>Kawapula kibanzi cha kwandikila, kandika vino, “Twaga jake Yohana.” Wanhu wose wakanganya. <verse eid="LUK 1:63"/><verse number="64" style="v" sid="LUK 1:64"/>Baho mulomo na lulimi lwake Zakalia vifunguligwa, kasonga kulonga, kamuyenzi Mulungu. <verse eid="LUK 1:64"/><verse number="65" style="v" sid="LUK 1:65"/>Bwembwe diwengila wanhu wose wa mmambwegambwega na mbuli hizo zisimulilwa ng'ambu zose za isi ya vigongovigongo ya Yudea. <verse eid="LUK 1:65"/><verse number="66" style="v" sid="LUK 1:66"/>Wose wahulike mbuli hizo wagelegeza mmioyo yao, wolonga, “Mwana ino kowa munhu wa vilihi? Kwavija mhiko za Mndewa za hamoja na heyo.”<verse eid="LUK 1:66"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Zakalia Kohokola</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="67" style="v" sid="LUK 1:67"/>Zakalia tataake imwana kamemezwa Loho wa Mulungu, na kulonga usenga uno wa Mulungu,<verse eid="LUK 1:67"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="68" style="v" sid="LUK 1:68"/>“Yayenzigwe Mndewa, Mulungu wa Islaeli!</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="LUK 1:68">Kwavija keza kuwataza wanhu zake na kuwakombola.<verse eid="LUK 1:68"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="69" style="v" sid="LUK 1:69"/>Katugwelela Mkombola mkulu,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="LUK 1:69">wa lukolo lwa mtumigwa wake Daudi,<verse eid="LUK 1:69"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="70" style="v" sid="LUK 1:70"/>kamba vija vayailagane na wahokozi zake wang'alile umwaka,<verse eid="LUK 1:70"/></para>
  <para style="q2">
    <verse number="71" style="v" sid="LUK 1:71"/>kamba kotukombola tulawe mmakono ga wadumuka,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="LUK 1:71">na kulawa mmakono ga wose watwihile.<verse eid="LUK 1:71"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="72" style="v" sid="LUK 1:72"/>Kalonga kowonela bazi wahenga zetu</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="LUK 1:72">na kudikumbukila lagano jake ding'alile.<verse eid="LUK 1:72"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="73" style="v" sid="LUK 1:73"/>Kamduilila Ablaham tata wetu,<verse eid="LUK 1:73"/></para>
  <para style="q2">
    <verse number="74" style="v" sid="LUK 1:74"/>kailagana na heyo kamba kotukombola kulawa mmakono ga wadumuka,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="LUK 1:74">na kututenda tweye tumsang'hanikile heyo bila bwembwe,<verse eid="LUK 1:74"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="75" style="v" sid="LUK 1:75"/>giladi tuwe wanhu wang'alile na tulibule uzenzeleganye haulongozi wake,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="LUK 1:75">mazua gose ga ugima wetu.<verse eid="LUK 1:75"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="76" style="v" sid="LUK 1:76"/>“Na gweye, mwanangu, kokwiza kukemigwa muhokozi wa Mulungu Mkulu Ng'hani.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="LUK 1:76">Kolongola haulongozi wa Mndewa</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="LUK 1:76">kumtandila nzila yake,<verse eid="LUK 1:76"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="77" style="v" sid="LUK 1:77"/>kowalongela wanhu zake avija vondawakomboligwe</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="LUK 1:77">mkusegezelwa vilozo vao.<verse eid="LUK 1:77"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="78" style="v" sid="LUK 1:78"/>Mulungu wetu kogatenda higo sama ya bazi jake kulu,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="LUK 1:78">na ukombola wake kulawa kuulanga wotuhumulukila kamba zua da imitondo<verse eid="LUK 1:78"/></para>
  <para style="q2">
    <verse number="79" style="v" sid="LUK 1:79"/>na kuwamulikila wose wokala mdiziza na awo wakala mdisisila da kudanganhika,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="LUK 1:79">na kugalongoza magulu getu muna inzila ya tindiwalo.”<verse eid="LUK 1:79"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="80" style="v" sid="LUK 1:80"/>Mwana ija kakula na kuwa na mhiko muloho. Kakala muluwala mbaka zua dija viyalawilile mwa wanhu wose wa Islaeli.<verse eid="LUK 1:80"/></para>
  <chapter eid="LUK 1"/>
  <chapter number="2" style="c" sid="LUK 2"/>
  <para style="s1">Mvumbuka ya Yesu</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 1:18-25">Mat. 1:18-25</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="LUK 2:1"/>Mazua gaja mkulu wa undewa wa Loma, yakalile yokemigwa Augusto, kalagiza wanhu wakalile muundewa wose wa Loma matwaga gao gandikigwe mkitabu. <verse eid="LUK 2:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="LUK 2:2"/>Nyandikisha ino ikala ya ichanduso, kipigiti kija Kulenio viyakalile mkulu wa isi ya Silia. <verse eid="LUK 2:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="LUK 2:3"/>Avo wose wachola kwandikigwa kila munhu mkiwambo chake mwenyego.<verse eid="LUK 2:3"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="LUK 2:4"/>Usufu na heyo kasegela kulawa hakiwambo cha Nazaleti muisi ya Galilaya, kakwela kachola kukiwambo cha Betelehemu muisi ya Yudea, kwaaleligwe Mndewa Daudi kwavija kakala yolawa mulukolo lwa Daudi. <verse eid="LUK 2:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="LUK 2:5"/>Kachola kwandikigwa hamoja na mkasano wake Maliamu, ayo yakalile na inda. <verse eid="LUK 2:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="LUK 2:6"/>Viwakalile hiko, kipigiti chake cha kulela kivika. <verse eid="LUK 2:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="LUK 2:7"/>Kamulela chaudele mbigalo, kam'vaza vivalo vowowavazaga wana ving'hele, kamtambalika mkia kiwadilaga ng'ombe, kwavija hawapatile gati muna ing'anda ya wahenza.<verse eid="LUK 2:7"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Wachunga na Wasenga wa Mulungu wa Kuulanga</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="LUK 2:8"/>Ng'ambu ija kukala na wachunga wokwimiliza madale gao ga ng'hondolo ikilo mmigunda. <verse eid="LUK 2:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="LUK 2:9"/>Msenga wa Mndewa wa kuulanga kawalawilila, na yenzi ya Mndewa Mulungu iwamulika ng'ambu zose, wadumba ng'hani. <verse eid="LUK 2:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="LUK 2:10"/>Msenga wa Mulungu wa kuulanga kawalongela, “Sambimdumbe! Niwagalila mbuli inogile yondaiwatende wanhu wose wadeng'he ng'hani. <verse eid="LUK 2:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="LUK 2:11"/>Kwavija lelo ino muna ikiwambo cha Daudi kavumbuka Mkombola wenu, iyo Kilisto Mndewa. <verse eid="LUK 2:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="LUK 2:12"/>Na vino vivo vondamumtambule, mom'vika mwana king'hele yavazigwe vivalo vowowavazaga wana ving'hele katambalikwa mkia kiwadilaga ng'ombe.”<verse eid="LUK 2:12"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="LUK 2:13"/>Baho dale kulu da wasenga wa Mulungu wa kuulanga diza kuilumba hamoja na miyao wa ichanduso, womuyenzi Mulungu, wolonga,<verse eid="LUK 2:13"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="LUK 2:14"/>“Yenzi ha Mulungu yali uchana ng'hani kuulanga,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="LUK 2:14">na tindiwalo muisi, ha wanhu wanogelwe na heyo!”<verse eid="LUK 2:14"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="LUK 2:15"/>Waja iwasenga wa Mulungu wa kuulanga viwabweleganye kuulanga, waja iwachunga wakiilongela, “Tucholeni Betelehemu tukalole mbuli ino ilawilile, Mndewa yaatulongele.”<verse eid="LUK 2:15"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="LUK 2:16"/>Avo wachola hima wam'vika Maliamu na Usufu na wamona ija imwana king'hele katambalikwa mkia kiwadilaga ng'ombe. <verse eid="LUK 2:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="LUK 2:17"/>Wachunga viwamonile ija imwana, wawalongela wanhu mbuli za mwana ija ziwahulike kulawa ha msenga wa Mulungu wa kuulanga. <verse eid="LUK 2:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="LUK 2:18"/>Wanhu wose wakanganya viwahulike mbuli ziwalongeligwe na wachunga. <verse eid="LUK 2:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="LUK 2:19"/>Maliamu kazika mbuli zija zose mmoyo wake kuno yozigelegeza. <verse eid="LUK 2:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="LUK 2:20"/>Waja iwachunga wabwela kuno womuyenzi na kumtogola Mulungu, kwavija gaja gawahulike na kugona gawa kamba vija msenga wa Mulungu wa kuulanga viyawalongele.<verse eid="LUK 2:20"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Mwana Kogweleligwa Twaga</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="LUK 2:21"/>Vigabitile mazua manane, kipigiti cha kumwingiza kumbi vikivikile, wamgwaa twaga Yesu, twaga dayagweleligwe na msenga wa Mulungu wa kuulanga kipigiti mamaake hanapata inda.<verse eid="LUK 2:21"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Yesu Kokwikigwa Mmakono ga Mndewa Mulungu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="LUK 2:22"/>Kipigiti cha Usufu na Maliamu kutaulwa vikivikile kamba Malagizo ga Musa vigalagize, Usufu na Maliamu wamsola imwana wachola na heyo Yelusalemu wamwike mmakono ga Mndewa. <verse eid="LUK 2:22"/><verse number="23" style="v" sid="LUK 2:23"/>Muna Gamalagizo ga Mndewa yandikigwa, “Wana mbigalo wose wa udele wobagulwa na kwikigwa sama ya Mulungu.” <verse eid="LUK 2:23"/><verse number="24" style="v" sid="LUK 2:24"/>Vivija wachola kulava nhosa kamba viilagizwe Mmalagizo ga Mndewa, hua wabili ama makinda mabili ga njiwa.<verse eid="LUK 2:24"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="LUK 2:25"/>Kipigiti kija kukala na munhu imwe twaga jake Simioni yakalile yokala Yelusalemu. Kakala yomdumba Mulungu, yotenda gamnogele Mulungu na kakala yololela kukombolwa kwa Islaeli. Na Loho wa Mulungu kakala na heyo. <verse eid="LUK 2:25"/><verse number="26" style="v" sid="LUK 2:26"/>Loho wa Mulungu kamgubulila kamba heza kudanganhika mbaka yamone Kilisto Mndewa. <verse eid="LUK 2:26"/><verse number="27" style="v" sid="LUK 2:27"/>Kuno yolongozwa na Loho wa Mulungu, Simioni kachola Kuing'anda ya Mulungu. Usufu na Maliamu viwamgalile Yesu Kung'anda ya Mulungu wamtendele kamba viilagizigwe muna Gamalagizo ga Musa, <verse eid="LUK 2:27"/><verse number="28" style="v" sid="LUK 2:28"/>Simioni kamsola Yesu mmakono gake kuno yomuyenzi Mulungu yolonga,<verse eid="LUK 2:28"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="LUK 2:29"/>“Avino, Mndewa, kugavikiza gaja gautulongele,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="LUK 2:29">avo muleke nyakadala wako yachole mditindiwalo.<verse eid="LUK 2:29"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="LUK 2:30"/>Kwavija nyona ukombola wako na meso gangu mwenyego,<verse eid="LUK 2:30"/></para>
  <para style="q2">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="LUK 2:31"/>awo uugalile sama ya wanhu wa isi zose.<verse eid="LUK 2:31"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="LUK 2:32"/>Mulenge wondauwagubulile Wamhazi gaja gaulonda,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="LUK 2:32">na kugala yenzi mwa wanhu zako wa Islaeli.”<verse eid="LUK 2:32"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="LUK 2:33"/>Tata na mama wa imwana wakala wokanganya mbuli ziyalongile Simioni yomulonga Yesu. <verse eid="LUK 2:33"/><verse number="34" style="v" sid="LUK 2:34"/>Simioni kawamoteza, kamulongela Maliamu mamaake imwana, “Tegeleza, mwana ino kavumbuka giladi yawe kilamso cha kuhumuluswa kwa wanhu bwando na kwinuligwa kwa wanhu bwando muna iisi ya Islaeli. Kowa kilaguso kilawa ha Mulungu chondakilemigwe na wanhu, <verse eid="LUK 2:34"/><verse number="35" style="v" sid="LUK 2:35"/>avo ngelegeza za wanhu bwando zili mgati zokoneka. Na gweye mwenyego usungu uli kamba zele wokuhoma mmoyo wako.”<verse eid="LUK 2:35"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" sid="LUK 2:36"/>Vivija kukala na muhokozi imwe mtwanzi m'vyele ng'hani twaga jake Ana, mndele wa Fanueli wa mtala wa Asheli. Kakala yakalile na mbigalo milao saba songela viyasoligwe, <verse eid="LUK 2:36"/><verse number="37" style="v" sid="LUK 2:37"/>songela aho kakala kizuka mbaka viyakalile m'vyele wa milao malongo manane na mine. Kipigiti hicho chose kakala Kung'anda ya Mulungu yomtambikila Mulungu misi na kilo, yofunga na kutambika. <verse eid="LUK 2:37"/><verse number="38" style="v" sid="LUK 2:38"/>Kipigiti kikija keza, na kusonga kamuyenzi Mulungu na kulonga mbuli za ija imwana mmagwiti ga wanhu wose wakalile wololela kukomboligwa kwa Yelusalemu.<verse eid="LUK 2:38"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Kubwela Nazaleti</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" sid="LUK 2:39"/>Usufu na Maliamu viweshile kutenda gose galagizwe muna Gamalagizo ga Mndewa, wabwela ukae yao kukiwambo cha Nazaleti muisi ya Galilaya. <verse eid="LUK 2:39"/><verse number="40" style="v" sid="LUK 2:40"/>Mwana ija kakula, kongezeka mhiko na ng'hungwe, na Mulungu kammoteza.<verse eid="LUK 2:40"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Yesu Kung'anda ya Mulungu Viyakalile Mmhale</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="41" style="v" sid="LUK 2:41"/>Milao yose Usufu na Maliamu wokwelaga wochola Yelusalemu mkipigiti cha lusona lwa Wayahudi lukemigwa Pasaka. <verse eid="LUK 2:41"/><verse number="42" style="v" sid="LUK 2:42"/>Yesu viyakalile mmhale wa milao longo dimwe na mibili, wachola kuna ulusona kamba vowotendaga milao yose. <verse eid="LUK 2:42"/><verse number="43" style="v" sid="LUK 2:43"/>Ulusona vulwishile, wasonga mwanza wa kubwela kumwao, ila Yesu kasigala Yelusalemu. Usufu na Maliamu hawavitangile. <verse eid="LUK 2:43"/><verse number="44" style="v" sid="LUK 2:44"/>Wagiza kakala mdale da wanhu mnzila, wachola mwanza wa zua dimwe, abaho, wasonga kumzahila mwa wandugu na wambwiga zao. <verse eid="LUK 2:44"/><verse number="45" style="v" sid="LUK 2:45"/>Hawamonile, avo wabwela Yelusalemu kumzahila. <verse eid="LUK 2:45"/><verse number="46" style="v" sid="LUK 2:46"/>Zua da ikadatu wam'vika Kung'anda ya Mulungu, kakala na wafundiza Malagizo ga Musa, yowategeleza na kuwauza. <verse eid="LUK 2:46"/><verse number="47" style="v" sid="LUK 2:47"/>Wose wahulike mbuli zake wakanganya ubala na nyidikilo zake. <verse eid="LUK 2:47"/><verse number="48" style="v" sid="LUK 2:48"/>Usufu na Maliamu viwamonile wakanganya ng'hani, Maliamu mamaake kamuuza, “Habali ututendele vino, mwanangu? Tataako na nie tugaya tukuzahila kuno tugudema.”<verse eid="LUK 2:48"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="49" style="v" sid="LUK 2:49"/>Ila heyo kawedika yolonga, “Habali munizahila? Ham'vitangile avija vinilondigwa nikale mng'anda ya Tataangu?” <verse eid="LUK 2:49"/><verse number="50" style="v" sid="LUK 2:50"/>Tataake na mamaake hawaitangile nhegulo ya mbuli ino.<verse eid="LUK 2:50"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="51" style="v" sid="LUK 2:51"/>Avo Yesu kahumuluka kabwela Nazaleti na hewo, kakala mwende ha tataake na mamaake. Mamaake kazika mbuli zija zose mmoyo wake. <verse eid="LUK 2:51"/><verse number="52" style="v" sid="LUK 2:52"/>Yesu kakula mulukuli na mng'hungwe. Kadeng'helwa na Mulungu na wanhu.<verse eid="LUK 2:52"/></para>
  <chapter eid="LUK 2"/>
  <chapter number="3" style="c" sid="LUK 3"/>
  <para style="s1">Yohana M'batiza Kowapetela Wanhu</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 3:1-12">Mat. 3:1-12</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 1:1-8">Mlk. 1:1-8</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 1:19-28">Yoh. 1:19-28</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="LUK 3:1"/>Mulongo umwe na milao mitano ya undewa wa Mndewa Tibelio, Pontio Pilato kakala mtawala wa isi ya Yudea. Helode Antipa<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">3:1 </char><char style="fk" closed="false">Helode Antipa </char><char style="ft" closed="false">kakala mwana wa Mndewa Helode Mkulu.</char></note> kakala mtawala wa isi ya Galilaya, na mkulu wake Filipo kakala mndewa wa isi ya Itulea na Tulakoniti. Lisania kakala mndewa wa isi ya Abilene, <verse eid="LUK 3:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="LUK 3:2"/>na Anasi na Kayafa wakala wakulu wa wakulu wose wa nhambiko. Kipigiti kikija mbuli za Mulungu zim'vikila Yohana, mwanage Zakalia, kuja kuluwala. <verse eid="LUK 3:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="LUK 3:3"/>Avo Yohana kachola muisi zose zizunguluke Ulwanda lwa Yolodani, kawapetela, yolonga, “Lekeni vilozo venu mkabatizigwe, na Mulungu kovigela kumgongo vilozo venu.”<verse eid="LUK 3:3"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="LUK 3:4"/>Kamba vija viyandikigwe muna ikitabu cha muhokozi Isaya,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="LUK 3:4">“Munhu kenula dizwi muluwala, yolonga,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="LUK 3:4">‘Itandeni nzila ya Mndewa,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="LUK 3:4">mgoloseleni nzila zake.<verse eid="LUK 3:4"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="LUK 3:5"/>Migea yose yokusiligwa,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="LUK 3:5">vigongo na visugulu vose vohimbuligwa.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="LUK 3:5">Nzila ziveduke zogolosigwa,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="LUK 3:5">hali na mikolongokolongo hatelebuswe.<verse eid="LUK 3:5"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="LUK 3:6"/>Na wanhu wose wowona ukombola kulawa ha Mulungu.’ ”<verse eid="LUK 3:6"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="LUK 3:7"/>Yohana kawalongela wanhu bwando wamwizile wabatizigwe, “Mweye wana wa nyoka! Iyo yalihi yawazumile kulukimbila lusango lwa Mulungu londalwize? <verse eid="LUK 3:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="LUK 3:8"/>Tendeni mbuli zilagusa kamba muleka vilozo venu. Sambimsonge kuilongela kamba ‘Ablaham iyo tata wetu.’ Kwavija nie nowalongela Mulungu kodaha kumwinulila Ablaham wana kulawa mgamabwe gano. <verse eid="LUK 3:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="LUK 3:9"/>Avo nhemo ikigwa goya kuikanha mibiki mmisina, avo biki jojose dondadileke kulela mujo unogile dokanhigwa na kwasigwa hamoto.”<verse eid="LUK 3:9"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="LUK 3:10"/>Dale da wanhu dimuuza, “Avo, tutendeze?”<verse eid="LUK 3:10"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="LUK 3:11"/>Kawalongela, “Yali na vivalo vibili yam'bagulile yalibule, na yali na mandia yatende vivo.”<verse eid="LUK 3:11"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="LUK 3:12"/>Wawila kodi na hewo weza kubatizigwa, wamuuza, “Mkulufunzi, na tweye tutendeze?”<verse eid="LUK 3:12"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="LUK 3:13"/>Na heyo kawalongela, “Sambimuwile kodi ng'hulu kubanza vumulagizwe.”<verse eid="LUK 3:13"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="LUK 3:14"/>Asikali na hewo weza kumuuza, “Na tweye tutende choni?”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="LUK 3:14">Na heyo kawalongela, “Sambim'bokonye hela za munhu yoyose ama sambimum'vwizile mbuli munhu yoyose, mwenelwe na maliho genu.”<verse eid="LUK 3:14"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="LUK 3:15"/>Wanhu wose wakala wamemile nhamanila ha Yohana, wakala wokiiuza mmioyo yao kamba siku Yohana iyo Kilisto. <verse eid="LUK 3:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="LUK 3:16"/>Avo Yohana kawalongela wanhu wose, “Nie nowabatiza mweye na mazi, ila kokwiza yali na mhiko kubanza nie, nie sidaha hata kufungula nzabi za ng'hwabasa zake. Heyo kowabatiza na Loho wa Mulungu na moto. <verse eid="LUK 3:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="LUK 3:17"/>Heyo kana kia chake cha kubetela ngano yake, yakunzanye ingano kukano, na imikumvi yaisome na moto hauzimikaga.”<verse eid="LUK 3:17"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="LUK 3:18"/>Yohana kaupeta Usenga Unogile mwa wanhu yowazuma mkuwagong'ondeza na mbuli bwando waleke gehile. <verse eid="LUK 3:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="LUK 3:19"/>Ila Yohana kamkomhokela Helode Antipa,<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">3:19 </char><char style="fk" closed="false">Helode Antipa </char><char style="ft" closed="false">kakala mwana wa Mndewa Helode Mkulu.</char></note> mndewa, kwavija kakala yamsolile Helodia, mtwanzi wa ndugu yake, na gehile gose goyokala yotenda. <verse eid="LUK 3:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="LUK 3:20"/>Avo Helode kabanziliza udumuka wake ha Yohana, na kamgela mkifungo.<verse eid="LUK 3:20"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Yesu Kobatizigwa</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 3:13-17">Mat. 3:13-17</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 1:9-11">Mlk. 1:9-11</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="LUK 3:21"/>Wanhu wose viweshile kubatizigwa, Yesu na heyo kabatizigwa. Na viyakalile yotambika, ulanga uvuguka, <verse eid="LUK 3:21"/><verse number="22" style="v" sid="LUK 3:22"/>na Loho wa Mulungu kamuhumulukila yalumbile kamba hua. Dizwi dihulikwa kulawa kuulanga, “Gweye iyo Mwanangu uninogele, ninogelwa nagwe.” <figure style="fig" alt="Baptism of Jesus" file="WA03810b.jpg" size="col" loc="Luke 3:21-22" copy="Graham Wade © United Bible Societies, 1989." ref="Luk. 3:22">Yesu Kobatizigwa.</figure><verse eid="LUK 3:22"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Wahenga wa Yesu</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 1:1-17">Mat. 1:1-17</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="LUK 3:23"/>Yesu viyasongile sang'hano yake, kakala na milao malongo madatu. Na wanhu wamgesa iyo mwana wa Usufu, mwanage Heli. <verse eid="LUK 3:23"/><verse number="24" style="v" sid="LUK 3:24"/>Heli kakala mwanage Matati, Matati kakala mwanage Lawi, Lawi kakala mwanage Meliki, Meliki kakala mwanage Yanai, na Yanai kakala mwanage Usufu, <verse eid="LUK 3:24"/><verse number="25" style="v" sid="LUK 3:25"/>Usufu kakala mwanage Matatia, Matatia kakala mwanage Amosi, Amosi kakala mwanage Nahumu, Nahumu kakala mwanage Hesili, Hesili kakala mwanage Nagai, <verse eid="LUK 3:25"/><verse number="26" style="v" sid="LUK 3:26"/>Nagai kakala mwanage Maati, Maati kakala mwanage Matatia, Matatia kakala mwanage Shemeni, Shemeni kakala mwanage Yoseki, Yoseki kakala mwanage Yoda, <verse eid="LUK 3:26"/><verse number="27" style="v" sid="LUK 3:27"/>Yoda kakala mwanage Yohanani, Yohanani kakala mwanage Lesa, Lesa kakala mwanage Zelubabeli, Zelubabeli kakala mwanage Shelitieli, Shelitieli kakala mwanage Neli, <verse eid="LUK 3:27"/><verse number="28" style="v" sid="LUK 3:28"/>Neli kakala mwanage Meliki, Meliki kakala mwanage Adi, Adi kakala mwanage Kosamu, Kosamu kakala mwanage Elimadamu, Elimadamu kakala mwanage Eli, <verse eid="LUK 3:28"/><verse number="29" style="v" sid="LUK 3:29"/>Eli kakala mwanage Yoshua, Yoshua kakala mwanage Eliezeli, Eliezeli kakala mwanage Yolimu, Yolimu kakala mwanage Matati, Matati kakala mwanage Lawi, <verse eid="LUK 3:29"/><verse number="30" style="v" sid="LUK 3:30"/>Lawi kakala mwanage Simioni, Simioni kakala mwanage Yuda, Yuda kakala mwanage Usufu, Usufu kakala mwanage Yonamu, Yonamu kakala mwanage Eliakimu, <verse eid="LUK 3:30"/><verse number="31" style="v" sid="LUK 3:31"/>Eliakimu kakala mwanage Melea, Melea kakala mwanage Mena, Mena kakala mwanage Matata, Matata kakala mwanage Natani, Natani kakala mwanage Daudi, <verse eid="LUK 3:31"/><verse number="32" style="v" sid="LUK 3:32"/>Daudi kakala mwanage Yese, Yese kakala mwanage Obedi, Obedi kakala mwanage Boazi, Boazi kakala mwanage Salimoni, Salimoni kakala mwanage Nashoni, <verse eid="LUK 3:32"/><verse number="33" style="v" sid="LUK 3:33"/>Nashoni kakala mwanage Aminadabu, Aminadabu kakala mwanage Adimini, Adimini kakala mwanage Ani, Ani kakala mwanage Heziloni, Heziloni kakala mwanage Pelesi, Pelesi kakala mwanage Yuda, <verse eid="LUK 3:33"/><verse number="34" style="v" sid="LUK 3:34"/>Yuda kakala mwanage Yakobo, Yakobo kakala mwanage Isaka, Isaka kakala mwanage Ablaham, Ablaham kakala mwanage Tela, Tela kakala mwanage Naholi, <verse eid="LUK 3:34"/><verse number="35" style="v" sid="LUK 3:35"/>Naholi kakala mwanage Selugi, Selugi kakala mwanage Leu, Leu kakala mwanage Pelegi, Pelegi kakala mwanage Ebeli, Ebeli kakala mwanage Shela, <verse eid="LUK 3:35"/><verse number="36" style="v" sid="LUK 3:36"/>Shela kakala mwanage Kainamu, Kainamu kakala mwanage Alufaksadi, Alufaksadi kakala mwanage Shemu, Shemu kakala mwanage Nuhu, Nuhu kakala mwanage Lameki, <verse eid="LUK 3:36"/><verse number="37" style="v" sid="LUK 3:37"/>Lameki kakala mwanage Metusela, Metusela kakala mwanage Henoko, Henoko kakala mwanage Yaledi, Yaledi kakala mwanage Mahalaleli, Mahalaleli kakala mwanage Kainamu, <verse eid="LUK 3:37"/><verse number="38" style="v" sid="LUK 3:38"/>Kainamu kakala mwanage Enoshi, Enoshi kakala mwanage Seti, Seti kakala mwanage Adamu, Adamu kakala mwanage Mulungu.<verse eid="LUK 3:38"/></para>
  <chapter eid="LUK 3"/>
  <chapter number="4" style="c" sid="LUK 4"/>
  <para style="s1">Yesu Kogezigwa</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 4:1-11">Mat. 4:1-11</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 1:12-13">Mlk. 1:12-13</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="LUK 4:1"/>Yesu kalawa Mulwanda lwa Yolodani kuno yamemile Loho wa Mulungu, kalongozwa na Loho wa Mulungu mbaka muluwala. <verse eid="LUK 4:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="LUK 4:2"/>Ako kagezigwa na Mwenembago mkipigiti cha mazua malongo mane. Kipigiti hicho chose hadile kinhu chochose, kipigiti hicho vikimalile, kona nzala.<verse eid="LUK 4:2"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="LUK 4:3"/>Mwenembago kamulongela, “Uhawa gweye iyo Mwana wa Mulungu, dilongele dibwe dino digaluke mkate.”<verse eid="LUK 4:3"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="LUK 4:4"/>Yesu kedika kalonga, “Yandikigwa Mzinyandiko Zing'alile, ‘Munhu hawa mgima sama ya mkate wiyeka.’ ”<verse eid="LUK 4:4"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="LUK 4:5"/>Mwenembago kamsola kamgala uchana ng'hani, mkipigiti kiguhi kamulagusila ndewa zose za ulumwengu. <verse eid="LUK 4:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="LUK 4:6"/>Mwenembago kamulongela, “Nokugwelela mhiko zino zose na mali gano gose, kwavija nigweleligwa na nodaha kumgwaa yoyose inimulonda. <verse eid="LUK 4:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="LUK 4:7"/>Uhanitambikila, vino vose vowa vako gweye.”<verse eid="LUK 4:7"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="LUK 4:8"/>Yesu kamwidika, “Yandikigwa Mzinyandiko Zing'alile, ‘Mtambikile Mndewa Mulungu wako na umsang'hanikile heyo yeiyeka!’ ”<verse eid="LUK 4:8"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="LUK 4:9"/>Mwenembago kamsola kamgala Yelusalemu kuna inhembeti ya Ing'anda ya Mulungu, kamulongela, “Uhawa gweye iyo Mwana wa Mulungu, ibwanhe hasi kulawa hano. <verse eid="LUK 4:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="LUK 4:10"/>Kwavija yandikigwa Mzinyandiko Zing'alile, ‘Mulungu kokulagizila wasenga zake wa kuulanga wakwimilize.’ <verse eid="LUK 4:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="LUK 4:11"/>Kabili yandikigwa, ‘Wokudang'ha mmakono gao, sambiuikwale mgulu wako muna idibwe.’ ”<verse eid="LUK 4:11"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="LUK 4:12"/>Ila Yesu kamwidika, “Yandikigwa Mzinyandiko Zing'alile, ‘Sambiumgeze Mndewa Mulungu wako.’ ” <figure style="fig" alt="Jesus on highest point of temple" file="JesusOnHighestPointOfTemple_DN00405.jpg" size="col" copy="Illustrations by Darwin Dunham © United Bible Societies, 1989, Nairobi, Kenya." ref="4:9-12">Yesu kogezigwa.</figure><verse eid="LUK 4:12"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="LUK 4:13"/>Mwenembago viyeshile kumgeza mmbuli zose, kamuleka mkipigiti kidodo.<verse eid="LUK 4:13"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Yesu Kosonga Sang'hano Zake Muisi ya Galilaya</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 4:12-17">Mat. 4:12-17</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 1:14-15">Mlk. 1:14-15</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="LUK 4:14"/>Yesu kabwela muisi ya Galilaya yamemile mhiko za Loho wa Mulungu, na singilimo zake zenela isi zose za mmambwegambwega. <verse eid="LUK 4:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="LUK 4:15"/>Na heyo kakala yowafundiza wanhu muna zing'anda zao za nhambiko, na wanhu wose wamtogola.<verse eid="LUK 4:15"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Yesu Kolemigwa Mkiwambo cha Nazaleti</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 13:53-58">Mat. 13:53-58</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 6:1-6">Mlk. 6:1-6</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="LUK 4:16"/>Abaho, Yesu kachola Nazaleti kiwambo chayakulile, na muna Idizua da Mhumulo, kengila mng'anda ya nhambiko kamba vayazoele. Kema giladi yasome Nyandiko Zing'alile. <verse eid="LUK 4:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="LUK 4:17"/>Kagweleligwa ikitabu cha muhokozi Isaya. Kakigubula kavika hanhu handikigwe vino,<verse eid="LUK 4:17"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="LUK 4:18"/>“Loho wa Mndewa ka hamoja na nie,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="LUK 4:18">kwavija kanisagula niwagalile wakumbulu Usenga Unogile.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="LUK 4:18">Kanilagiza niipete ndekesa mwa awo wagogigwe,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="LUK 4:18">na vimbugumbugu wadahe kulola,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="LUK 4:18">niwadohole waja wogazigwa.<verse eid="LUK 4:18"/></para>
  <para style="q2">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="LUK 4:19"/>Na kupeta kamba kipigiti kivika</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="LUK 4:19">cha mndewa kuwakombola wanhu zake.”<verse eid="LUK 4:19"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="LUK 4:20"/>Abaho, Yesu kakigubika ikitabu kam'bwezela mwimilizi wa ing'anda ya nhambiko, abaho, kakala hasi. Wanhu wose wakalile muja mng'anda ya nhambiko wamulola ng'hani. <verse eid="LUK 4:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="LUK 4:21"/>Na heyo kawalongela “Lelo Nyandiko zino Zing'alile zivikila, kamba vumuhulike.”<verse eid="LUK 4:21"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="LUK 4:22"/>Wanhu wose wanogelwa ng'hani, wakanganya mbuli zinogile zayalongile. Walonga, “Ino sio mwanage Usufu?”<verse eid="LUK 4:22"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="LUK 4:23"/>Yesu kawalongela, “Nivitanga kamba monilongela ulonzi uno, ‘Mganga, ihonye mwenyego! Gaja gatuhulike ugatendile Kapenaumu ugatende hano hakiwambo chako mwenyego.’ ” <verse eid="LUK 4:23"/><verse number="24" style="v" sid="LUK 4:24"/>Kagendelela kulonga, “Nowalongeleni ikweli, muhokozi hatogoligwa hakae yake mwenyego.<verse eid="LUK 4:24"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="LUK 4:25"/>“Kweli, kukala na vizuka bwando muna iisi ya Islaeli kipigiti chayakalile Eliya, kipigiti mvula vuilekile kutoa milao midatu na milenge sita, nzala ikala mpamanho muna iisi yose. <verse eid="LUK 4:25"/><verse number="26" style="v" sid="LUK 4:26"/>Ila Eliya hatumigwe ha kizuka yoyose, ila ha kizuka imwe yakalile Salepta muna iisi ya Sidoni. <verse eid="LUK 4:26"/><verse number="27" style="v" sid="LUK 4:27"/>Na kukala wanhu bwando wakalile na dikulu muna iisi ya Islaeli kipigiti chayakalile muhokozi Elisha, na haduhu mtamu yoyose wa dikulu yahonyigwe, ila Naamani yeiyeka yakalile yokala muisi ya Silia.”<verse eid="LUK 4:27"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="LUK 4:28"/>Wanhu wose wakalile muja mng'anda ya nhambiko viwahulike mbuli zija wona lusango. <verse eid="LUK 4:28"/><verse number="29" style="v" sid="LUK 4:29"/>Wema, wamkwekwesa Yesu, wamulava hanze ya ikiwambo. Wamsola wamgala uchana ya ikigongo, haja idiwambo jao hadizengigwe, walonda kumsung'hizila mdigema. <verse eid="LUK 4:29"/><verse number="30" style="v" sid="LUK 4:30"/>Ila Yesu kabita hagatigati yao, kachola na zake.<verse eid="LUK 4:30"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Munhu Yali na Kinyamkela</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 1:21-28">Mlk. 1:21-28</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="LUK 4:31"/>Abaho, Yesu kachola kukiwambo cha Kapenaumu muisi ya Galilaya, kawafundiza wanhu muna Dizua da Mhumulo. <verse eid="LUK 4:31"/><verse number="32" style="v" sid="LUK 4:32"/>Wakanganya avija voyokala yofundiza kwavija mbuli zake zikala na udaho. <verse eid="LUK 4:32"/><verse number="33" style="v" sid="LUK 4:33"/>Muja muna ing'anda ya nhambiko kukala na munhu yakalile na kinyamkela, katoa nyangi yolonga, <verse eid="LUK 4:33"/><verse number="34" style="v" sid="LUK 4:34"/>“Ka! Kotulonda choni gweye, Yesu wa Nazaleti? Kwiza kutubananga? Nokutanga, gweye iyo Ung'alile wa Mulungu!”<verse eid="LUK 4:34"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="LUK 4:35"/>Yesu kamkomhokela ija kinyamkela, yolonga, “Nyamala, mulawe munhu ino.” Kinyamkela kam'bwanha hasi ija imunhu hameso gao, kamulawa bila kumulumiza hanhu.<verse eid="LUK 4:35"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" sid="LUK 4:36"/>Wanhu wose wakanganya, wailongela, “Mbuli zaki zino? Munhu ino kana mhiko na udaho wa kuwakomhokela vinyamkela, nao wolawa!” <verse eid="LUK 4:36"/><verse number="37" style="v" sid="LUK 4:37"/>Mbuli za Yesu zenela ng'ambu zose za isi ija.<verse eid="LUK 4:37"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Yesu Kowahonya Wanhu Bwando</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 8:14-17">Mat. 8:14-17</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 1:29-34">Mlk. 1:29-34</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="38" style="v" sid="LUK 4:38"/>Yesu kalawa muna ing'anda ya nhambiko, kachola hakae ya Simoni. Mama mkwe yake Simoni kakala yolumwa homa ng'hali, avo wamulongela Yesu yamuhonye. <verse eid="LUK 4:38"/><verse number="39" style="v" sid="LUK 4:39"/>Yesu keza kema behi na heyo, kaikomhokela ija ihoma, imulawa, kenuka na kuwasang'hanikila.<verse eid="LUK 4:39"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="40" style="v" sid="LUK 4:40"/>Viivikile ichungulo, wanhu wose wawagala ha Yesu wanhu zao wakalile wolumwa vitamu va namna zose, kawekila makono gake kawahonya. <verse eid="LUK 4:40"/><verse number="41" style="v" sid="LUK 4:41"/>Vinyamkela wawalawa wanhu bwando, watoa nyangi wolonga, “Gweye iyo Mwana wa Mulungu.”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="LUK 4:41">Yesu kawakomhokela hawalekile walonge, kwavija wamtanga heyo iyo Kilisto.<verse eid="LUK 4:41"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Yesu Koupeta Usenga Unogile Mzing'anda za Nhambiko</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 1:35-39">Mlk. 1:35-39</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="42" style="v" sid="LUK 4:42"/>Ulukwili, Yesu kasegela kachola hanhu halibule wanhu. Wanhu wasonga kumzahila, viwamonile, wageza kumzuila sambiyasegele hamwao. <verse eid="LUK 4:42"/><verse number="43" style="v" sid="LUK 4:43"/>Ila heyo kawalongela, “Nolondigwa niupete Usenga Unogile wa Undewa wa Mulungu m'viwambo viyagwe, kwavija nhumigwa nhende vino.”<verse eid="LUK 4:43"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="44" style="v" sid="LUK 4:44"/>Kakala yowapetela wanhu Usenga Unogile wa Undewa wa Mulungu muna zing'anda za nhambiko muisi yose ya Yudea.<verse eid="LUK 4:44"/></para>
  <chapter eid="LUK 4"/>
  <chapter number="5" style="c" sid="LUK 5"/>
  <para style="s1">Yesu Kowakema Wanahina wa Ichanduso</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 4:18-22">Mat. 4:18-22</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 1:16-20">Mlk. 1:16-20</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="LUK 5:1"/>Zua dimwe Yesu kakala yemile hamgwazo wa Idilamba da Genesaleti. Wanhu wakala wokiibabanika wokwenhuka behi na heyo kutegeleza mbuli za Mulungu. <verse eid="LUK 5:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="LUK 5:2"/>Kazona ngalawa mbili mulugigo lwa idilamba, zikigwe haja na waloa somba, wakalile wosuluza nhando zao. <verse eid="LUK 5:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="LUK 5:3"/>Yesu kengila mngalawa imwe ikalile ya Simoni, kamulongela Simoni yaikwenhuse hamwande, hatalitali na ulugigo lwa idilamba. Yesu kakala mngalawa yowafundiza wanhu bwando.<verse eid="LUK 5:3"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="LUK 5:4"/>Viyeshile kulonga kamulongela Simoni, “Kwenhusa ingalawa hamwande hana ididindi da idilamba, na gweye na wayago tandeni nhando zenu muloe somba.”<verse eid="LUK 5:4"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="LUK 5:5"/>Simoni kamulongela, “Mndewa, tugonelela tuloa somba hatupatile kinhu, ila kwavija gweye kulonga, nozitanda nhando.” <verse eid="LUK 5:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="LUK 5:6"/>Viwazitandile izinhando, wonza somba bwando, na nhando zao zisonga kukanhika. <verse eid="LUK 5:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="LUK 5:7"/>Wawakema wayao wakalile mngalawa iyagwe weze kuwataza. Weza wamemeza somba ngalawa zose mbili, avo ngalawa zikala mmabehi kudidimila mmazi. <verse eid="LUK 5:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="LUK 5:8"/>Simoni Petulo viyagonile gaja, kafugama mavindi haulongozi wa Yesu, yolonga, “Mndewa, sambiung'hwenhukile kwavija nie nna vilozo!”<verse eid="LUK 5:8"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="LUK 5:9"/>Simoni na wayage wose wakanganya avija viwonzile somba bwando kamba vija. <verse eid="LUK 5:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="LUK 5:10"/>Yakobo na Yohana wanage Zebedayo, wakalile waloa somba wayage Simoni, vivija wakanganya. Yesu kamulongela Simoni, “Sambiudumbe, kusongela lelo kowa muloa wanhu.”<verse eid="LUK 5:10"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="LUK 5:11"/>Wazikwekwesa zingalawa wazika mumgwazo wa idilamba, waleka gose wamkweleleza Yesu.<verse eid="LUK 5:11"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Yesu Komuhonya Mtamu wa Dikulu</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 8:1-4">Mat. 8:1-4</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 1:40-45">Mlk. 1:40-45</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="LUK 5:12"/>Yesu viyakalile mdiwambo dimwe da hiko, kaiting'hana na mbigalo imwe yakalile na dikulu lukuli lugima. Viyamonile Yesu, kafugama mavindi, kamulongela mkuiyalala, “Mndewa, uhalonda, kodaha kunihonya.”<verse eid="LUK 5:12"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="LUK 5:13"/>Yesu kagolosa mkono wake kamkwasa yolonga, “Nolonda, hona!” Kipigiti kikija kahona utamu wa dikulu. <verse eid="LUK 5:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="LUK 5:14"/>Abaho, Yesu kamulagiza yolonga, “Sambiumulongele munhu yoyose, ila genda dimwe kwa dimwe ha mkulu wa nhambiko yakulole goya, abaho, ukalave nhosa kamba Musa vayalagize, giladi iwe usindila mwa wanhu wose kamba kuhona.”<verse eid="LUK 5:14"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="LUK 5:15"/>Ila mbuli za Yesu zibanza kwenela muisi yose, wanhu bwando weza kumtegeleza na kuhonyigwa vitamu vao. <verse eid="LUK 5:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="LUK 5:16"/>Ila Yesu mianza bwando kakala yonyelenhuka yochola hanhu halibule wanhu kutambika.<verse eid="LUK 5:16"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Yesu Komuhonya Munhu Yaholole</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 9:1-8">Mat. 9:1-8</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 2:1-12">Mlk. 2:1-12</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="LUK 5:17"/>Zua dimwe Yesu kakala yofundiza. Mafalisayo na wafundiza Malagizo ga Musa, walawile m'viwambo vose va Galilaya, Yudea na kulawa Yelusalemu, wakala baho. Mhiko za Mndewa zikala na heyo, avo kawahonya watamu. <verse eid="LUK 5:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="LUK 5:18"/>Baho weza wanhu wampapile munhu yaholole mulusazi, wageza kumwingiza mng'anda wamwike haulongozi wa Yesu. <verse eid="LUK 5:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="LUK 5:19"/>Avija wanhu viwakalile wamemile hawadahile kumwingiza mng'anda. Avo wampapa, wamgala uchana mkiswili, wafumula usoti, wamuhumulusa hamoja na lusazi lwake, na kumwika hagatigati ya ididale da wanhu haulongozi wa Yesu. <figure style="fig" alt="Paralytic lowered through roof" file="NT-17 Lowering Man Through the Roof.jpg" size="col" loc="Luke 5:18-20" copy="Jonathan McDaniel" ref="Luk. 5:19"/> <verse eid="LUK 5:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="LUK 5:20"/>Yesu viyonile avija viwakalile na nhamanila ng'hulu, kamulongela ija imunhu, “Mbwiga, vilozo vako vigeligwa kumgongo.”<verse eid="LUK 5:20"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="LUK 5:21"/>Wafundiza Malagizo ga Musa na Mafalisayo wasonga kukiiuza, “Iyo yalihi yofukula? Mulungu yeiyeka yodaha kugela kumgongo vilozo va wanhu!”<verse eid="LUK 5:21"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="LUK 5:22"/>Ila Yesu kazitanga ngelegeza zao, kawauza, “Habali mgelegeza mbuli kamba azo? <verse eid="LUK 5:22"/><verse number="23" style="v" sid="LUK 5:23"/>Dilihi dibuhile ng'hani, kulonga, ‘Vilozo vako vigeligwa kumgongo,’ ama kulonga, ‘Ima wima utembele’? <verse eid="LUK 5:23"/><verse number="24" style="v" sid="LUK 5:24"/>Nolonda m'vitange kamba, nie, Mwana wa Munhu, nna udaho wa kuvigela kumgongo vilozo va wanhu muisi.” Abaho kamulongela ija imunhu yaholole, “Ima wima, papa lusazi lwako, uchole ukae yako.”<verse eid="LUK 5:24"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="LUK 5:25"/>Baho ija imunhu kema wima hameso gao wose, kasola lusazi lwake lwayakalile yaluwasile, kachola ukae yake kuno yomuyenzi Mulungu. <verse eid="LUK 5:25"/><verse number="26" style="v" sid="LUK 5:26"/>Wanhu wose wakanganya, kuno wona bwembwe, wamuyenzi Mulungu, wolonga, “Lelo tona mbuli za mkanganyo!”<verse eid="LUK 5:26"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Yesu Komkema Lawi</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 9:9-13">Mat. 9:9-13</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 2:13-17">Mlk. 2:13-17</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="LUK 5:27"/>Viyeshile kutenda higo, Yesu kalawa hanze, kamona muwila kodi imwe yokemigwa Lawi, yakalile muna ing'anda yake ya kulihila kodi. Yesu kamulongela, “Ng'holeleza.” <verse eid="LUK 5:27"/><verse number="28" style="v" sid="LUK 5:28"/>Na heyo kenuka, kaleka gose, kamkoleleza.<verse eid="LUK 5:28"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="LUK 5:29"/>Abaho, Lawi kamtendela lusona lukulu ng'hani Yesu mng'anda yake, na dale kulu da wawila kodi na wanhu wayagwe wakala woja na heyo. <verse eid="LUK 5:29"/><verse number="30" style="v" sid="LUK 5:30"/>Mafalisayo na wafundiza Malagizo ga Musa wakalile mdidale jao wawatwanganikila wanahina wa Yesu, wouza, “Habali moja na kung'wa na wawila kodi na watenda vilozo wayagwe?”<verse eid="LUK 5:30"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="LUK 5:31"/>Yesu kedika kalonga, “Wanhu wagima hawamulonda mganga, ila waja wali watamu wawo womulonda. <verse eid="LUK 5:31"/><verse number="32" style="v" sid="LUK 5:32"/>Sizile kuwakema wanhu walibule vilozo, ila wanhu wali na vilozo waleke vilozo vao.”<verse eid="LUK 5:32"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Mbuza ya Kufunga</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 9:14-17">Mat. 9:14-17</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 2:18-22">Mlk. 2:18-22</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="LUK 5:33"/>Wanhu wamulongela Yesu, “Wanahina wa Yohana M'batiza wofunga mianza bwando na kutambika, na wanahina wa Mafalisayo wotenda vivo. Ila wanahina zako woja na kung'wa.”<verse eid="LUK 5:33"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="LUK 5:34"/>Yesu kawalongela, “Mokwagiza modaha kuwatenda wambwiga za mulawilamhambe wafunge kipigiti mulawilamhambe yang'hali hamoja nawo? <verse eid="LUK 5:34"/><verse number="35" style="v" sid="LUK 5:35"/>Ila kipigiti chovika avija mulawilamhambe vondayasegezigwe hamwao, aho baho vondawafunge.”<verse eid="LUK 5:35"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" sid="LUK 5:36"/>Vivija Yesu kawalongela hala dino. “Haduhu munhu yokanha kidanga cha kivalo cha sambi na kukigela mkivalo cha mwaka. Kamba yahatenda avo, kokidega ikivalo cha sambi, na acho ikidanga cha ikivalo cha sambi hakilumba mkivalo cha mwaka. <verse eid="LUK 5:36"/><verse number="37" style="v" sid="LUK 5:37"/>Vivija wanhu hawagela divai ya sambi muna vibuyu va umwaka vitendigwe na kwembe, kwavija ija idivai ya sambi yovitula ivibuyu vitendigwe na kwembe, avo idivai yokwitika na vibuyu vitendigwe na kwembe vobanangika. <verse eid="LUK 5:37"/><verse number="38" style="v" sid="LUK 5:38"/>Vilumbaga, divai ya sambi igeligwe muna vibuyu va sambi vitendigwe na kwembe. <verse eid="LUK 5:38"/><verse number="39" style="v" sid="LUK 5:39"/>Na haduhu munhu yolondaga divai ya sambi kuno yeshile kung'wa divai ya mwaka, mana kolonga, ‘Ya mwaka ibanza kunoga.’ ”<verse eid="LUK 5:39"/></para>
  <chapter eid="LUK 5"/>
  <chapter number="6" style="c" sid="LUK 6"/>
  <para style="s1">Mbuza ya Zua da Mhumulo</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 12:1-8">Mat. 12:1-8</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 2:23-28">Mlk. 2:23-28</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="LUK 6:1"/>Yesu kakala yotembela muna imigunda ya ngano Mdizua dimwe da Mhumulo. Wanahina zake wasonga kufyola zisota za gamakungwi ga ngano, wagafigisa mmakono gao, ikwisha waja zinzele. <verse eid="LUK 6:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="LUK 6:2"/>Mafalisayo wayagwe wamuuza, “Habali motenda gagomeswe kutendigwa Mdizua da Mhumulo?”<verse eid="LUK 6:2"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="LUK 6:3"/>Yesu kawedika kawalongela, “Hamsomile kija chayatendile Daudi kipigiti heyo na wayage viwakalile na nzala? <verse eid="LUK 6:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="LUK 6:4"/>Kengila mdihema da Mulungu, kaija imikate ilavigwe nhosa ha Mulungu, na iyagwe kawagwelela wayage. Vinhu vikalile vigomeswe Mmalagizo getu kudigwa na munhu yoyose ila wakulu wa nhambiko weiyeka.”<verse eid="LUK 6:4"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="LUK 6:5"/>Yesu kamambukiza mkulonga, “Nie, Mwana wa Munhu, nene Mndewa wa Zua da Mhumulo.”<verse eid="LUK 6:5"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Munhu Yali na Mkono Uholole</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 12:9-14">Mat. 12:9-14</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 3:1-6">Mlk. 3:1-6</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="LUK 6:6"/>Zua diyagwe da Mhumulo Yesu kengila mng'anda ya nhambiko na kufundiza. Kukala na munhu yaholole mkono wake wa ukulume. <verse eid="LUK 6:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="LUK 6:7"/>Mafalisayo na wafundiza Malagizo ga Musa wakala wozahila kilamso cha kumtagusila Yesu, avo wamulola ng'hani wone kamba kohonya Mdizua da Mhumulo. <verse eid="LUK 6:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="LUK 6:8"/>Yesu kazitanga ngelegeza zao avo kamulongela ija imunhu, “Ima wima, wize hano haulongozi.” Ija imunhu kema wima, abaho, kachola haulongozi. <verse eid="LUK 6:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="LUK 6:9"/>Abaho, Yesu kawalongela, “Nowauza, Malagizo getu golonga tutende choni Mdizua da Mhumulo? Tutende ganogile ama gehile? Kumuhonya munhu ama kumkoma?” <verse eid="LUK 6:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="LUK 6:10"/>Kawalola wanhu wose, abaho, kamulongela ija imunhu, “Golosa mkono wako.” Na heyo kaugolosa, na mkono wake ubwela goya.<verse eid="LUK 6:10"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="LUK 6:11"/>Wona lusango wasonga kuiuza vija vondawamtende Yesu.<verse eid="LUK 6:11"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Yesu Kosagula Watumigwa Longo Dimwe na Wabili</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 10:1-4">Mat. 10:1-4</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 3:13-19">Mlk. 3:13-19</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="LUK 6:12"/>Zua dimwe mkipigiti kija, Yesu kachola kukigongo kutambika, kagonelela yomtambikila Mulungu. <verse eid="LUK 6:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="LUK 6:13"/>Viivikile imitondo, kawakema wanahina zake na kawasagula longo dimwe na wabili, awo yawakemile watumigwa zake, <verse eid="LUK 6:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="LUK 6:14"/>Simoni, yagweleligwe twaga da Petulo, na ndugu yake Endelea, na Yakobo na Yohana, na Filipo na Batolomayo, <verse eid="LUK 6:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="LUK 6:15"/>na Matayo na Tomaso, na Yakobo mwanage Alufayo, na Simoni yakalile yokemigwa Mgombeleza Isi ya Islaeli, <verse eid="LUK 6:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="LUK 6:16"/>na Yuda mwanage Yakobo, na Yuda Isikalioti, yamuhonzile Yesu.<verse eid="LUK 6:16"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Yesu Kofundiza na Kuhonya</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 4:23-25">Mat. 4:23-25</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="LUK 6:17"/>Yesu viyahumuluke kulawa hakigongo na watumigwa zake, kema hanhu hatambalale na wanahina zake bwando. Na wanhu bwando weza kulawa isi yose ya Yudea na kulawa Yelusalemu na kulawa viwambo vose va mhwani ya Tilo na Sidoni. <verse eid="LUK 6:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="LUK 6:18"/>Weza kumtegeleza na kuhonyigwa vitamu vao. Waja wakalile wogazigwa na vinyamkela vivija na hewo weza na wahonyigwa. <verse eid="LUK 6:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="LUK 6:19"/>Wanhu wose walonda kumkwasa kwavija mhiko za uhonya zikala zimulawa na kuwahonya wanhu wose.<verse eid="LUK 6:19"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Kudeng'ha na Giogio</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 5:1-12">Mat. 5:1-12</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="LUK 6:20"/>Yesu kawalola wanahina zake na kulonga,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="LUK 6:20">“Mmota mweye iwakumbulu wa gamali,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="LUK 6:20">kwavija Undewa wa Mulungu uli wenu!<verse eid="LUK 6:20"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="LUK 6:21"/>Mmota mweye muli nzala sambi,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="LUK 6:21">kwavija kwiza mokwiguta!</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="LUK 6:21">Mmota mweye mulila sambi,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="LUK 6:21">kwavija kwiza moseka!<verse eid="LUK 6:21"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="LUK 6:22"/>“Mmota mweye avija wanhu wahawehila, na kuwalema, na kuwaliga, na kuwabanangila matwaga genu sama ya nie, Mwana wa Munhu! <verse eid="LUK 6:22"/><verse number="23" style="v" sid="LUK 6:23"/>Deng'heni mmazua higo na zumheni mkudeng'ha kwavija maliho genu makulu mwikiligwa kuulanga. Kwavija wahenga zao wawatendela wahokozi gano gowotenda.<verse eid="LUK 6:23"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="LUK 6:24"/>“Ila mojona mweye muli wagoli sambi,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="LUK 6:24">kwavija mwisha kubokela uhondo wenu.<verse eid="LUK 6:24"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="LUK 6:25"/>Mojona mweye mwigute sambi,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="LUK 6:25">kwavija mochola na nzala.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="LUK 6:25">Mojona mweye mseka sambi,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="LUK 6:25">kwavija mokwiza kuiyalala na kulila.<verse eid="LUK 6:25"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="LUK 6:26"/>“Mojona, avija wanhu wose vondawawatogole, kwavija wahenga zao wakala wowatogola kamba avo wahokozi wa uvwizi.<verse eid="LUK 6:26"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Kuwanogela Wadumuka</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 5:38-48">Mat. 5:38-48</ref>; <ref loc="MAT 7:12a">7:12a</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="LUK 6:27"/>“Ila nowalongeleni mweye munitegeleza, wanogeleni wadumuka zenu, watendeleni ganogile awo wawehile. <verse eid="LUK 6:27"/><verse number="28" style="v" sid="LUK 6:28"/>Wamotezeni awo wowadukumiza, na watambikileni awo wowatendela gehile. <verse eid="LUK 6:28"/><verse number="29" style="v" sid="LUK 6:29"/>Munhu yahakutoa mkanza dimwe, muhindusile na diyagwe, na munhu yahakuboka koti jako, muleke yasole na kanzu yako. <verse eid="LUK 6:29"/><verse number="30" style="v" sid="LUK 6:30"/>Munhu yoyose yondayakupule kinhu mgwelele, na munhu yahasola kinhu chako, sambiumulongele yakubwezele. <verse eid="LUK 6:30"/><verse number="31" style="v" sid="LUK 6:31"/>Watendeleni wanhu kamba vija vumulonda wanhu wawatendele mweye.<verse eid="LUK 6:31"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="LUK 6:32"/>“Kamba muhawanogela wanhu wowanogela mweye, maliho galihi gondam'bokele? Kwavija hata wali na vilozo na hewo wowanogela awo wawanogele! <verse eid="LUK 6:32"/><verse number="33" style="v" sid="LUK 6:33"/>Muhawatendela ganogile awo wowatendela mweye ganogile, maliho galihi gondam'bokele? Kwavija wali na vilozo nawo wotenda vivo. <verse eid="LUK 6:33"/><verse number="34" style="v" sid="LUK 6:34"/>Avo muhawakalizi mali genu ha awo mtamanila wodaha kuliha, maliho galihi gondam'bokele? Kwavija wali na vilozo wowakalizi wali na vilozo wayao wabwezeligwe kikija chawakalizigwe. <verse eid="LUK 6:34"/><verse number="35" style="v" sid="LUK 6:35"/>Viha! Ila wanogeleni wadumuka zenu na watendeleni ganogile, wakalizini wanhu mali genu, sambimtamanile kubwezelwa na kinhu. Avo kwiza mogweleligwa maliho makulu, avo mowa wana wa Mulungu Mkulu Ng'hani, kwavija heyo kotenda ganogile mwa wanhu wabezi na wotenda gehile. <verse eid="LUK 6:35"/><verse number="36" style="v" sid="LUK 6:36"/>Muwe na bazi kamba Tata wenu viyali na bazi.<verse eid="LUK 6:36"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Kuwatagusa Wayagwe</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 7:1-5">Mat. 7:1-5</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" sid="LUK 6:37"/>“Sambimuwataguse wayagwe, na Mulungu hawatagusa mweye. Sambimuwadununze wayagwe, na Mulungu hawadununza mweye. Geleni kumgongo vilozo va wanhu wayagwe, na Mulungu kovigela kumgongo vilozo venu. <verse eid="LUK 6:37"/><verse number="38" style="v" sid="LUK 6:38"/>Wagweleleni wanhu vinhu, na Mulungu kowagwelela mweye. Mhima imemile, isindiligwe na kutigiswa na kwitika iyo yondamgweleligwe m'vipepelo venu. Kwavija mhima yondamuwapimile wayagwe iyo mhima yondampimilwe mweye.”<verse eid="LUK 6:38"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" sid="LUK 6:39"/>Avo Yesu kawalongela hala dino, “Kimbugumbugu hadaha kumulongoza kimbugumbugu miyage, kamba yahatenda avo, wose wabili wogwila mdikolongo. <verse eid="LUK 6:39"/><verse number="40" style="v" sid="LUK 6:40"/>Mwanahina hamuhuma mkulufunzi wake, ila mwanahina yeheshiliza kufundizigwa kowa kamba mkulufunzi wake.<verse eid="LUK 6:40"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="41" style="v" sid="LUK 6:41"/>“Habali ukilola kikupi msiso da ndugu yako, na huchona kibanzi kili msiso jako mwenyego? <verse eid="LUK 6:41"/><verse number="42" style="v" sid="LUK 6:42"/>Kodahaze kumulongela ndugu yako, ‘Ndugu yangu, beta nikilave kikupi mdisiso jako,’ kuno hudaha hata kuchona kibanzi kili msiso jako mwenyego? Kidelenya gweye! Tanhu kilave ikibanzi kili msiso jako mwenyego, abaho, kodaha kulola goya kukilava kikupi kili mdisiso da ndugu yako.<verse eid="LUK 6:42"/></para>
  <para style="s1">M'biki na Mujo Wake</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 7:16-20">Mat. 7:16-20</ref>; <ref loc="MAT 12:33-35">12:33-35</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="43" style="v" sid="LUK 6:43"/>“M'biki unogile haulela mujo wihile, vivija m'biki wihile haulela mujo unogile. <verse eid="LUK 6:43"/><verse number="44" style="v" sid="LUK 6:44"/>Kila m'biki wotambulwa sama ya mujo wake uulela. Hudaha kubawa tini muna imizomola, ama zabibu muna zimbigili. <verse eid="LUK 6:44"/><verse number="45" style="v" sid="LUK 6:45"/>Munhu yanogile kolava ganogile kulawa mngama ya vinhu vinogile vili mmoyo wake. Munhu yehile kolava gehile kulawa mngama ya vinhu vihile. Kwavija mulomo wolonga kimemile mmoyo.<verse eid="LUK 6:45"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Wazenga Ng'anda Wabili</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 7:24-27">Mat. 7:24-27</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="46" style="v" sid="LUK 6:46"/>“Habali mong'hema, ‘Mndewa, Mndewa,’ abaho, hamtenda gaja ganiwalongela? <verse eid="LUK 6:46"/><verse number="47" style="v" sid="LUK 6:47"/>Kila munhu yokwiza kumwangu na kutegeleza mbuli zangu na kuzitogola, nowalagusila kilihi kilingile na heyo. <verse eid="LUK 6:47"/><verse number="48" style="v" sid="LUK 6:48"/>Kalinga na munhu yozenga ng'anda, kahimba lukwambaza hasi ng'hani mbaka kavika dibwe, avo kazenga msingi mdibwe. Lwanda lutula na kugeza kuikulula ng'anda ija, ila haludahile kuitigisa kwavija izengigwa goya. <verse eid="LUK 6:48"/><verse number="49" style="v" sid="LUK 6:49"/>Ila munhu yoyose yohulika mbuli zangu na kuzileka baho, ayo kalinga na munhu yazengile ng'anda yake bila kuhimba ng'hani lukwambaza na kwika msingi. Mkipigiti kidodo lwanda lutula na kuikulula ng'anda ija, igwa mkipigiti kiguhi. Na igwa yake ikala ihile ng'hani.”<verse eid="LUK 6:49"/></para>
  <chapter eid="LUK 6"/>
  <chapter number="7" style="c" sid="LUK 7"/>
  <para style="s1">Yesu Komuhonya Nyakadala wa Mkulu wa Asikali Mia wa Loma</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 8:5-13">Mat. 8:5-13</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="LUK 7:1"/>Yesu viyeshile kulonga mbuli zino zose mwa wanhu, kachola kukiwambo cha Kapenaumu. <verse eid="LUK 7:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="LUK 7:2"/>Mkulu wa asikali mia wa Loma kakala na nyakadala yakalile yamnogele ng'hani, ija inyakadala kakala mtamu ng'hani behi na kudanganhika. <verse eid="LUK 7:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="LUK 7:3"/>Ija imkulu wa iwaasikali mia wa Loma viyahulike singilimo za Yesu, kawatuma wakulu wa Wayahudi wakamulongele yeze yamuhonye nyakadala wake. <verse eid="LUK 7:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="LUK 7:4"/>Viwavikile ha Yesu, wamuyalalila, wolonga, “Munhu ino kalumba kutendeligwa mbuli ino, <verse eid="LUK 7:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="LUK 7:5"/>kwavija kawanogela wanhu zetu, na heyo iyo yatuzengele ng'anda yetu ya nhambiko.”<verse eid="LUK 7:5"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="LUK 7:6"/>Avo Yesu kachola na hewo, viwavikile behi na ing'anda, ija imkulu wa iwaasikali mia wa Loma kawalagiza wambwiga zake wamulongele Yesu vino, “Mndewa, sambiugaye, nie silumbile gweye wize wingile mng'anda yangu, <verse eid="LUK 7:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="LUK 7:7"/>kileka nivigesile kamba silumbile kwiza hamwako nene mwenyego, ila longa mbuli! Na nyakadala wangu kohona. <verse eid="LUK 7:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="LUK 7:8"/>Nie vivija na munhu nikigwe hasi ya udaho wa wakulu zangu wa uchana yangu, na nna asikali hasi yangu. Nihamulongela ino, ‘Genda!’ kochola, nihamulongela ija, ‘Izo!’ kokwiza, na nihamulongela nyakadala wangu, ‘Tenda vino!’ kotenda.”<verse eid="LUK 7:8"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="LUK 7:9"/>Yesu viyahulike gano, kamkanganya munhu ija, kahinduka kuchugu na kudilongela dale da wanhu dikalile dimsondolela, “Nowalongela, sinakona nhamanila ng'hulu kamba ino, hata mwa wanhu wa Islaeli!”<verse eid="LUK 7:9"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="LUK 7:10"/>Waja watumigwe wabwela kung'anda ya ija imkulu, wam'vika nyakadala wake kahona.<verse eid="LUK 7:10"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Yesu Komzusa Mwana wa Kizuka</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="LUK 7:11"/>Mkipigiti kiguhi Yesu kachola hakiwambo kikemigwa Naini, kailongoza na wanahina zake na dale kulu da wanhu. <verse eid="LUK 7:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="LUK 7:12"/>Viwavikile halwivi lwa ikiwambo, wanhu wakalile wapapile munhu yadanganhike wakala wolawa hanze ya ikiwambo. Mmhale yakalile yaleligwe yeiyeka na mtwanzi imwe yakalile kizuka, na dale kulu da wanhu kulawa mkiwambo dikala hamoja na ija imtwanzi. <verse eid="LUK 7:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="LUK 7:13"/>Mndewa Yesu viyamuwene, kamonela bazi, kamulongela, “Sambiulile.” <verse eid="LUK 7:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="LUK 7:14"/>Abaho, kachola haulongozi na kulukwasa ulusazi, avo wanhu waupapile wema. Yesu kalonga, “Mmhale, nokulongela, lamuka!” <verse eid="LUK 7:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="LUK 7:15"/>Ija immhale yadanganhike kenuka, kakala ukala, kasonga kulonga. Yesu kamgwelela mamaake.<verse eid="LUK 7:15"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="LUK 7:16"/>Wanhu wose wona bwembwe wamuyenzi Mulungu, walonga, “Muhokozi mkulu koneka hamwetu, Mulungu keza kuwakombola wanhu zake.”<verse eid="LUK 7:16"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="LUK 7:17"/>Mbuli zino za Yesu zenela muisi yose ya Yudea na isi za mmambwegambwega.<verse eid="LUK 7:17"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Wasenga Kulawa ha Yohana M'batiza</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 11:2-19">Mat. 11:2-19</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="LUK 7:18"/>Wanahina wa Yohana viwamulongele mbuli zino zose, kawakema wabili mmwanza wao, <verse eid="LUK 7:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="LUK 7:19"/>na kuwalagiza wachole ha Mndewa wakamuuze vino, “Yohana kalonga, gweye iyo mkombola yondayeze? Ama tumtamanile iyagwe?”<verse eid="LUK 7:19"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="LUK 7:20"/>Wanhu waja viwavikile ha Yesu, walonga, “Yohana M'batiza katulagiza yolonga tukuuze, ‘Gweye iyo yondayeze, ama tumtamanile iyagwe?’ ”<verse eid="LUK 7:20"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="LUK 7:21"/>Kipigiti kikija Yesu kawahonya wanhu bwando wakalile na vitamu na utamu, na awo wakalile na vinyamkela, na kuwatenda vimbugumbugu bwando wadahe kulola. <verse eid="LUK 7:21"/><verse number="22" style="v" sid="LUK 7:22"/>Kawalongela waja wasenga wa Yohana, “Gendeni mkamulongele Yohana gaja gamonile na kugahulika, vimbugumbugu wolola, mbetembete wotembela, wali na dikulu wohonyigwa, vinziwi wohulika, wadanganhike wowa wagima kabili, na Usenga Unogile wopetigwa mwa wakumbulu. <verse eid="LUK 7:22"/><verse number="23" style="v" sid="LUK 7:23"/>Wamota wanhu awo walibule ving'hwaso na sang'hano zangu.”<verse eid="LUK 7:23"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="LUK 7:24"/>Wasenga wa Yohana viwacholile, Yesu kasonga kumulonga Yohana haulongozi wa dale da wanhu, yolonga, “Vumcholile ha Yohana kuluwala, mtamanila kona choni? Ludete lutigiswa na beho? <verse eid="LUK 7:24"/><verse number="25" style="v" sid="LUK 7:25"/>Mchola kulola choni? Munhu yavalile vivalo vinogile ng'hani? Wanhu wovala kamba avo na kukala vinogile wa mming'anda ya kindewa! <verse eid="LUK 7:25"/><verse number="26" style="v" sid="LUK 7:26"/>Nongeleni, mchola kulola choni? Muhokozi? Ona, ila nowalongela, yummonile kana ukulu kubanza muhokozi. <verse eid="LUK 7:26"/><verse number="27" style="v" sid="LUK 7:27"/>Yohana iyo munhu Nyandiko Zing'alile zimulonga, ‘Mulungu kalonga, nomulagiza msenga wangu yakulongole, yondayaitande nzila yako.’ ” <verse eid="LUK 7:27"/><verse number="28" style="v" sid="LUK 7:28"/>Yesu kongeza kulonga “Nowalongela, wanhu wose waleligwe na watwanzi, haduhu yali mkulu kum'banza Yohana. Ila yali mdodo ng'hani muna Uundewa wa Mulungu iyo mkulu kum'banza Yohana.”<verse eid="LUK 7:28"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="LUK 7:29"/>Wanhu wose, hata wawila kodi, viwazihulike mbuli za Yesu, watogola kamba nzila ya Mulungu igoloka, kwavija wakala wabatizigwe na Yohana. <verse eid="LUK 7:29"/><verse number="30" style="v" sid="LUK 7:30"/>Ila Mafalisayo na wafundiza Malagizo ga Musa wagalema gaja gayalondile kutenda Mulungu kumwao kwavija walema kubatizigwa na Yohana.<verse eid="LUK 7:30"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="LUK 7:31"/>Yesu kagendelela kulonga, “Vino niwalinganyize na choni wanhu wa mazua gano? Walinga na wanhu walihi? <verse eid="LUK 7:31"/><verse number="32" style="v" sid="LUK 7:32"/>Walinga na wana wakalile hadibugano da soko. Dale dimwe dowalongela dale diyagwe, ‘Tuwatoela ngoma ya lusona lwa zengele, ila mweye ham'vinile! Twimba vawembaga hauzisi, ila mweye hamulilile!’ <verse eid="LUK 7:32"/><verse number="33" style="v" sid="LUK 7:33"/>Yohana M'batiza keza kafunga na hang'wile divai, na mulonga, ‘Kana kinyamkela!’ <verse eid="LUK 7:33"/><verse number="34" style="v" sid="LUK 7:34"/>Nie, Mwana wa Munhu, niza, noja na kung'wa, mulonga, ‘Loleni munhu ino, mmelo na mng'waji, mbwiga wa wawila kodi na wene vilozo wayagwe!’ <verse eid="LUK 7:34"/><verse number="35" style="v" sid="LUK 7:35"/>Kwa vovose vija ng'hungwe ya Mulungu yonekaga mmeso ga awo wose waitogole.”<verse eid="LUK 7:35"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Yesu Hakae ya Simoni Mfalisayo</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" sid="LUK 7:36"/>Mfalisayo imwe kamulonda Yesu yeze kuja na heyo mandia ga ikilo, avo Yesu kachola hang'anda ya ija Mfalisayo, kakala hasi yaje. <verse eid="LUK 7:36"/><verse number="37" style="v" sid="LUK 7:37"/>Mkiwambo kija kukala na mtwanzi imwe yakalile yotenda vilozo mazua gose. Kahulika Yesu kakala yoja mng'anda ya Mfalisayo, avo kagala nyhupa ya alabasta ikalile na mavuta ga kunung'hila. <verse eid="LUK 7:37"/><verse number="38" style="v" sid="LUK 7:38"/>Kema hachugu cha Yesu, behi na magulu gake, yolila na kumdodeza magulu gake na mahozi gake. Abaho, kamuhangusa magulu gake na mvili zake, kaganonela na kugetila mavuta ga kunung'hila.<figure style="fig" alt="Lady wipes Jesus' feet with her tears" file="WA03839b.jpg" size="col" loc="Luke 7:36-38" copy="Graham Wade © United Bible Societies 1989" ref="Luk. 7:38"/> <verse eid="LUK 7:38"/><verse number="39" style="v" sid="LUK 7:39"/>Ija Imfalisayo yamgoneke viyonile gaja, kalonga munda kwa munda, “Kamba munhu ino yahawile muhokozi, yahamtangile mtwanzi ino yomkwasa yali munhu wa vilihi, yahavitangile vija voyokala ukazi wa vilozo.”<verse eid="LUK 7:39"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="40" style="v" sid="LUK 7:40"/>Yesu kamulongela ija Imfalisayo, “Simoni, nna mbuli nolonda kukulongela.”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="LUK 7:40">Kalonga “Ona, mkulufunzi, nongela.”<verse eid="LUK 7:40"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="41" style="v" sid="LUK 7:41"/>Yesu kasonga kulonga, “Kukala na wanhu wabili wowilwa hela na mkalizi hela imwe. Imwe kakala yowilwa hela zilinganye maliho ga milenge longo dimwe, na iyagwe kakala yowilwa hela zilinganye maliho ga mulenge umwe. <verse eid="LUK 7:41"/><verse number="42" style="v" sid="LUK 7:42"/>Wose wabili hawadahile kuliha, avo kawagela kumgongo wose wabili. Vino yalihi hana iwanhu wano wabili yondayamnogele heyo ng'hani?”<verse eid="LUK 7:42"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="43" style="v" sid="LUK 7:43"/>Simoni kamulongela, “Nokona ija imunhu yageligwe kumgongo hela bwando.”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="LUK 7:43">Yesu kalonga, “Kulonga goya.” <verse eid="LUK 7:43"/><verse number="44" style="v" sid="LUK 7:44"/>Abaho, kamuhindukila ija imtwanzi, kamulongela Simoni, “Komona mtwanzi ino? Ningila mng'anda yako, hungwelele mazi ngele magulu gangu, ila heyo kagadodeza magulu gangu na mahozi gake na kugahangusa na mvili zake. <verse eid="LUK 7:44"/><verse number="45" style="v" sid="LUK 7:45"/>Hunibokele mkuninonela, ila mtwanzi ino songela hanizile halekile kuganonela magulu gangu. <verse eid="LUK 7:45"/><verse number="46" style="v" sid="LUK 7:46"/>Gweye hunibakile mavuta mpala jangu, ila mtwanzi ino kagetila mavuta ga kunung'hila magulu gangu. <verse eid="LUK 7:46"/><verse number="47" style="v" sid="LUK 7:47"/>Avo nokulongela, noge kulu diyalaguse mtwanzi ino dolagusa avija vilozo vake bwando vuvigeligwe kumgongo. Ila munhu yoyose yageligwe kumgongo hadodo kolagusa noge dodo.”<verse eid="LUK 7:47"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="48" style="v" sid="LUK 7:48"/>Abaho, Yesu kamulongela ija mtwanzi, “Vilozo vako vigeligwa kumgongo.”<verse eid="LUK 7:48"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="49" style="v" sid="LUK 7:49"/>Wanhu wayagwe wakalile hameza wasonga kulonga hasihasi, “Iyo yalihi munhu ino, yogela kumgongo hata vilozo?”<verse eid="LUK 7:49"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="50" style="v" sid="LUK 7:50"/>Ila Yesu kamulongela ija imtwanzi, “Nhamanila yako ikukombola, genda mditindiwalo.”<verse eid="LUK 7:50"/></para>
  <chapter eid="LUK 7"/>
  <chapter number="8" style="c" sid="LUK 8"/>
  <para style="s1">Watwanzi Wamkweleleze Yesu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="LUK 8:1"/>Kipigiti kiguhi hamwande, Yesu kagendelela kuupeta Usenga Unogile wa Undewa wa Mulungu mmiwambo na m'viwambo. Wanahina zake longo dimwe na wabili wachola hamoja na heyo, <verse eid="LUK 8:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="LUK 8:2"/>hamoja na watwanzi wakalile wahonyigwe vinyamkela na vitamu viyagwe, Maliamu yakalile yokemigwa munhu wa Magidala ayo wamulavile vinyamkela saba, <verse eid="LUK 8:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="LUK 8:3"/>Yoana, mwehe wa Kuza yakalile mkulu wa ng'anda ya Helode Antipa, Suzana, na watwanzi wayagwe bwando wasolile vinhu vao na kumgwaa Yesu na wanahina zake.<verse eid="LUK 8:3"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Hala da Muhanda</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 13:1-9">Mat. 13:1-9</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 4:1-9">Mlk. 4:1-9</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="LUK 8:4"/>Wanhu wakala wogendelela kwiza ha Yesu kulawa m'viwambo vose, na viwamemile, Yesu kawalongela hala dino.<verse eid="LUK 8:4"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="LUK 8:5"/>“Mulimi kachola kuhanda mbeyu. Viyakalile yozihanda, ziyagwe zilagalila mnzila, wanhu wazibojaga na ndege weza wazija. <verse eid="LUK 8:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="LUK 8:6"/>Ziyagwe zigwila muisi ili na mabwe, avo viisongile kukula inyala, kwavija kukala haduhu mnyefu muisi. <verse eid="LUK 8:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="LUK 8:7"/>Ziyagwe zigwila mmizomola, imizomola ikula hamoja na umche na kuuzingiliza. <verse eid="LUK 8:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="LUK 8:8"/>Na mbeyu ziyagwe zigwila haulongo unogile, zikula na zilela masuke gali na nzele mia kila dimwe.”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="LUK 8:8">Yesu kamambukiza mkwinula dizwi, yolonga, “Yali na magwiti na yahulike.”<verse eid="LUK 8:8"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Nhegulo ya Igamahala</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 13:10-17">Mat. 13:10-17</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 4:10-12">Mlk. 4:10-12</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="LUK 8:9"/>Wanahina zake wamuuza Yesu nhegulo ya hala dino. <verse eid="LUK 8:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="LUK 8:10"/>Na heyo kawalongela, “Mweye mgweleligwa mhome ya kuzitanga nyong'onyo za Undewa wa Mulungu, ila wayagwe wolongelwa muna gamahala, giladi walole ila sambiwone, na wategeleze ila sambiwahulike.”<verse eid="LUK 8:10"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Yesu Kopeta Lumosilumosi Hala da Muhanda</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 13:18-23">Mat. 13:18-23</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 4:13-20">Mlk. 4:13-20</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="LUK 8:11"/>Ino iyo nhegulo ya hala dino. Zimbeyu zizo mbuli ya Mulungu. <verse eid="LUK 8:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="LUK 8:12"/>Mbeyu zigwile mnzila zizo wanhu wahulike imbuli ya Mulungu, abaho, Mwenembago keza kaisegeza kulawa mmioyo yao, giladi sambiwaitogole, abaho, wakomboligwe. <verse eid="LUK 8:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="LUK 8:13"/>Mbeyu zigwile muisi ili na mabwe zizo wanhu wahulike mbuli ya Mulungu na kuibokela mkudeng'ha. Ila hawakalile na mizizi, woitogola mkipigiti kiguhi, wahabitilwa na kipigiti kidala, wobweleganya kuchugu. <verse eid="LUK 8:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="LUK 8:14"/>Mbeyu zigwile mmizomola zizo wanhu wahulike mbuli ya Mulungu, ila viwakalile wogendelela kuitogola, mholemhole wazingilizwa na bwembwe da ugima, usu da kuwa na mali bwando, na usu da kuwa na vinhu vinogile, avo mujo wao hawipa. <verse eid="LUK 8:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="LUK 8:15"/>Mbeyu zija zigwile haulongo unogile zizo wanhu wahulike mbuli ya Mulungu waika mmioyo, avo waitogola, wazaganya, hakimambukizo walela mujo unogile.<verse eid="LUK 8:15"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Kiwenge Kigubikwe na Kiteleko</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 4:21-25">Mlk. 4:21-25</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="LUK 8:16"/>“Haduhu munhu yobwinha kiwenge, abaho, yakigubike na kiteleko ama yakike haluvungu. Ila kokika uchana hakingolobweda avo wanhu wehengila mng'anda wone mulangaza.<verse eid="LUK 8:16"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="LUK 8:17"/>“Kwavija haduhu kinhu chochose kifisigwe chondakileke kuvumbulwa na kwikigwa hakimwagaia, na haduhu kinhu chochose kigubikwe chondakileke kugubulwa na kwikigwa hamulangaza.<verse eid="LUK 8:17"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="LUK 8:18"/>“Avo teganyeni vija vumtegeleza, kwavija awo wali na kinhu wogweleligwa na viyagwe, ila awo walibule kinhu, na vidodo vija vowogesa wanavo wobokonywa.”<verse eid="LUK 8:18"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Mamaake na Wandugu wa Yesu</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 12:46-50">Mat. 12:46-50</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 3:31-35">Mlk. 3:31-35</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="LUK 8:19"/>Mamaake Yesu na wandugu zake wamwizila, ila hawadahile kumkwenhukila avija wanhu viwakalile bwando. <verse eid="LUK 8:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="LUK 8:20"/>Munhu imwe kamulongela, “Mamaako na wandugu zako wahanze wonda wakone.”<verse eid="LUK 8:20"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="LUK 8:21"/>Ila Yesu kawalongela, “Mamaangu na ndugu zangu iwo wano wotegeleza mbuli ya Mulungu na kuitenda.”<verse eid="LUK 8:21"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Yesu Kodikomhokela Beho Mdilamba</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 8:23-27">Mat. 8:23-27</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 4:35-41">Mlk. 4:35-41</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="LUK 8:22"/>Zua dimwe Yesu kawalongela wanahina zake, “Natuloke mwambu wa ikabili wa idilamba.” Avo wengila mngalawa wasonga kuloka. <verse eid="LUK 8:22"/><verse number="23" style="v" sid="LUK 8:23"/>Viwakalile woloka, Yesu kawasa utulo. Wedukila kukuzumbi dikwiza mdilamba, na ingalawa isonga kumema mazi, avo wose wakala mmwangalo. <verse eid="LUK 8:23"/><verse number="24" style="v" sid="LUK 8:24"/>Wanahina wachola ha Yesu wamulamusa, wolonga, “Mndewa, Mndewa! Todanganhika!” <figure style="fig" alt="Boat in a storm, before Jesus calms the wind" file="NT-09 Boat in Storm.jpg" size="col" loc="Luke 8:23-25" copy="Jonathan McDaniel" ref="Luk. 8:23">Yesu kodikomhokela beho mdilamba.</figure></para>
  <para style="p" vid="LUK 8:24">Yesu kalamuka kadikomhokela dikukuzumbi na umnyukwamnyukwa wa igamazi, vose vihola, hakala hapozike. <verse eid="LUK 8:24"/><verse number="25" style="v" sid="LUK 8:25"/>Abaho, kawalongela wanahina zake, “Nhamanila yenu ili kwahi?”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="LUK 8:25">Wakanganya ng'hani, kuno wona bwembwe, wakiilongela, “Ino munhu waki? Kodikomhokela beho na igamawimbi, na vose vomtegeleza!”<verse eid="LUK 8:25"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Yesu Komuhonya Munhu Yali na Vinyamkela</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 8:28-34">Mat. 8:28-34</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 5:1-20">Mlk. 5:1-20</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="LUK 8:26"/>Yesu na wanahina zake wagendelela kuloka, wavika mhwani ya isi ya Gelasi ili mwambu wa ikabili wa Idilamba da Galilaya. <verse eid="LUK 8:26"/><verse number="27" style="v" sid="LUK 8:27"/>Yesu viyahumuluke muingalawa, munhu imwe wa kiwambo kija yakalile na vinyamkela kamwizila. Mazua bwando munhu ija kakala yotembela bila mvaza na kakala hakala muna ing'anda, ila kakala yokala muna zimhango ziwazikilaga wanhu. <verse eid="LUK 8:27"/><verse number="28" style="v" sid="LUK 8:28"/>Viyamuwene Yesu, kaguta lwangi, kafugama mavindi hamagulu ga Yesu, kenula dizwi yolonga, “Yesu, Mwana wa Mulungu Mkulu Ng'hani, konilonda choni? Nokuyalalila, sambiungaze!” <verse eid="LUK 8:28"/><verse number="29" style="v" sid="LUK 8:29"/>Kalonga vino kwavija Yesu kamkomhokela ikinyamkela yamulawe. Mianza bwando kakala yovagaligwa na ikinyamkela, hata kamba kakala yafungigwe makono na magulu na minyolo na kwimilizwa, ila kaikanha iminyolo na kakala yowingigwa na ikinyamkela muluwala.<verse eid="LUK 8:29"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="LUK 8:30"/>Yesu kamuuza, “Twaga jako dijo dilihi?”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="LUK 8:30">Kedika kalonga, “Twaga jangu ‘Dale,’ ” kwavija kakala yavagaligwe na vinyamkela bwando. <verse eid="LUK 8:30"/><verse number="31" style="v" sid="LUK 8:31"/>Vinyamkela wamuyalalila Yesu sambiyawagale mdikolongo dilibule nziga.<verse eid="LUK 8:31"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="LUK 8:32"/>Kukala na dale kulu da mitumbi behi na hewo, wakala woja hakigongo. Avo vinyamkela wamuyalalila Yesu yawaleke wachole wakaingile ija imitumbi, Yesu kawaleka wachole kuiingila. <verse eid="LUK 8:32"/><verse number="33" style="v" sid="LUK 8:33"/>Vinyamkela viwamulawile ija imunhu, waiingila ija imitumbi, na dale jose dihumuluka kubonde mdigema, dingila mdilamba na kufa mazi.<verse eid="LUK 8:33"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="LUK 8:34"/>Wanhu wakalile woichunga imitumbi wagona gaja galawilile, avo wakimbila na wabwililisa mbuli zija mkiwambo na mmigunda. <verse eid="LUK 8:34"/><verse number="35" style="v" sid="LUK 8:35"/>Wanhu wachola kulola gaja galawilile, na viwavikile ha Yesu, wam'vika ija imunhu yalavigwe vinyamkela kakala hamagulu ga Yesu, kavala vivalo, yali na nzonzi zake. Wanhu wose wona bwembwe. <verse eid="LUK 8:35"/><verse number="36" style="v" sid="LUK 8:36"/>Waja wagonile gaja wawalongela wanhu avija munhu ija vayahonyigwe. <verse eid="LUK 8:36"/><verse number="37" style="v" sid="LUK 8:37"/>Abaho, wanhu wose wa isi ya Gelasi wamulongela Yesu yasegele hamwao, kwavija wadumba ng'hani. Avo kengila mngalawa kasegela. <verse eid="LUK 8:37"/><verse number="38" style="v" sid="LUK 8:38"/>Munhu ija yalavigwe vinyamkela kamuyalalila Yesu yachole na heyo.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="LUK 8:38">Ila Yesu kamtuma, yolonga, <verse eid="LUK 8:38"/><verse number="39" style="v" sid="LUK 8:39"/>“Bwela ukae yako ukapete gaja Mulungu gayakutendele.”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="LUK 8:39">Ija imunhu kabitabita kila hanhu mkiwambo, yolonga gaja Yesu gayamtendele.<verse eid="LUK 8:39"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Mndele wa Yailo na Mtwanzi Yakwasile Lugigo lwa Guo da Yesu</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 9:18-26">Mat. 9:18-26</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 5:21-43">Mlk. 5:21-43</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="40" style="v" sid="LUK 8:40"/>Yesu viyabwelile mwambu wa ikabili wa idilamba, wanhu wam'bokela, kwavija wanhu wose wakala wom'beta. <verse eid="LUK 8:40"/><verse number="41" style="v" sid="LUK 8:41"/>Abaho, keza munhu yokemigwa Yailo, kakala munhu mkulu muing'anda ya nhambiko. Kafugama mavindi haulongozi wa Yesu, kamuyalalila yachole kung'anda yake, <verse eid="LUK 8:41"/><verse number="42" style="v" sid="LUK 8:42"/>kwavija mndele wake yavumbuke yeiyeka, yakalile wa ukulu wa milao longo dimwe na mibili, kakala mtamu, behi na kudanganhika.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="LUK 8:42">Yesu viyakalile mnzila, wanhu wammemela ng'ambu zose. <verse eid="LUK 8:42"/><verse number="43" style="v" sid="LUK 8:43"/>Mdidale dija da wanhu kukala na mtwanzi imwe yakalile na utamu wa kutumika mkipigiti cha milao longo dimwe na mibili, kasa vinhu vake vose ha mafundi, ila haduhu yadahile kumuhonya. <verse eid="LUK 8:43"/><verse number="44" style="v" sid="LUK 8:44"/>Kaibabanika mdidale da wanhu hachugu cha Yesu na kukwasa ulugigo lwa guo da Yesu, na bahaja kahona. <verse eid="LUK 8:44"/><verse number="45" style="v" sid="LUK 8:45"/>Yesu kauza, “Yalihi yang'hwasile?”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="LUK 8:45">Wanhu wose wabela, Petulo kalonga, “Mndewa, wanhu wamema woikunhizila kumwako.”<verse eid="LUK 8:45"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="46" style="v" sid="LUK 8:46"/>Ila Yesu kalonga, “Hana munhu kang'hwasa kwavija nokona mhiko zinilawa.” <verse eid="LUK 8:46"/><verse number="47" style="v" sid="LUK 8:47"/>Ija mtwanzi viyawene gayatendile gatangigwa, keza yogudema, kafugama mavindi haulongozi wa Yesu. Bahaja hameso ga wanhu wose, kamulongela kimtendile yamkwase na vija vayahonyigwe mkipigiti kiguhi. <verse eid="LUK 8:47"/><verse number="48" style="v" sid="LUK 8:48"/>Yesu kamulongela, “Mwanangu, nhamanila yako ikuhonya. Genda mditindiwalo.”<verse eid="LUK 8:48"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="49" style="v" sid="LUK 8:49"/>Yesu viyakalile yang'hali yolonga gano, keza munhu imwe kulawa kung'anda ya Yailo. Kamulongela Yailo, “Mndele wako kadanganhika, sambiumgaze Mkulufunzi.”<verse eid="LUK 8:49"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="50" style="v" sid="LUK 8:50"/>Yesu kahulika kamulongela Yailo, “Sambiudumbe, tamanila, na mndele wako kohona.”<verse eid="LUK 8:50"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="51" style="v" sid="LUK 8:51"/>Viyavikile hang'anda ya Yailo, hamulondile munhu yoyose kwingila na heyo mng'anda, ila Petulo, Yohana, Yakobo, na tata na mama wa imndele. <verse eid="LUK 8:51"/><verse number="52" style="v" sid="LUK 8:52"/>Wanhu wose walila na kona giogio sama ya ija imndele, Yesu kawalongela, “Sambimulile, mwana mgima, kawasa tu!”<verse eid="LUK 8:52"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="53" style="v" sid="LUK 8:53"/>Wanhu wose wamseka, kwavija wavitanga kamba kakala yeshile kudanganhika. <verse eid="LUK 8:53"/><verse number="54" style="v" sid="LUK 8:54"/>Ila Yesu kamgoga mkono na kwinula dizwi yolonga, “Mwanangu, lamuka.” <verse eid="LUK 8:54"/><verse number="55" style="v" sid="LUK 8:55"/>Loho yake ibwela, kipigiti kikija kalamuka, Yesu kalagiza wamgwelele kinhu yaje. <verse eid="LUK 8:55"/><verse number="56" style="v" sid="LUK 8:56"/>Tataake na mamaake wakanganya ng'hani, ila Yesu kawagong'ondeza sambiwamulongele munhu yoyose gaja galawilile.<verse eid="LUK 8:56"/></para>
  <chapter eid="LUK 8"/>
  <chapter number="9" style="c" sid="LUK 9"/>
  <para style="s1">Yesu Kowatuma Watumigwa Longo Dimwe na Wabili</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 10:5-15">Mat. 10:5-15</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 6:7-13">Mlk. 6:7-13</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="LUK 9:1"/>Yesu kawakema watumigwa zake longo dimwe na wabili hamoja, kawagwelela mhiko na udaho wa kuwinga vinyamkela wose na kuhonya vitamu. <verse eid="LUK 9:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="LUK 9:2"/>Abaho, kawalagiza wachole kuupeta Undewa wa Mulungu na kuwahonya watamu. <verse eid="LUK 9:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="LUK 9:3"/>Kawalongela, “Sambimsole kinhu chochose mmwanza wenu, fimbo ama mkoba ama mandia ama hela ama kanzu ya ikabili. <verse eid="LUK 9:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="LUK 9:4"/>Ng'anda yoyose yondamwingile, kaleni baho mbaka vondamsegele hakiwambo hicho. <verse eid="LUK 9:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="LUK 9:5"/>Wanhu wahalema kuwabokela, segeleni hakiwambo kija, kung'unheni timbwisi dili mmagulu genu kamba usindila ulagusa hewo wenyego waulema Undewa wa Mulungu.”<verse eid="LUK 9:5"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="LUK 9:6"/>Avo wasegela, wabita m'viwambo vose wopeta Usenga Unogile na kuhonya wanhu kila hanhu.<verse eid="LUK 9:6"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Helode Kodungwadungwa Sama ya Yesu</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 14:1-12">Mat. 14:1-12</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 6:14-29">Mlk. 6:14-29</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="LUK 9:7"/>Helode Antipa, mtawala wa Galilaya, kagahulika gose gakalile gotendeka. Avo kadungwadungwa ng'hani, kwavija wanhu wayagwe wakala wolonga, “Yohana M'batiza kazuka.” <verse eid="LUK 9:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="LUK 9:8"/>Wayagwe walonga, “Eliya kalawilila,” na wayagwe walonga, “Imwe wa wahokozi wa umwaka kazuka.” <verse eid="LUK 9:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="LUK 9:9"/>Helode kalonga, “Yohana nimdumula pala jake, avo yalihi munhu ino inihulika mbuli zake?” Avo mazua gose kakala yozahila kumona Yesu.<verse eid="LUK 9:9"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Yesu Kowegutiza Wanhu Bwando</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 14:13-21">Mat. 14:13-21</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 6:30-44">Mlk. 6:30-44</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 6:1-14">Yoh. 6:1-14</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="LUK 9:10"/>Watumigwa wa Kilisto viwabwelile, wamulongela Yesu vinhu vose vawatendile. Kawasola, wasegela wachola kukiwambo kikemigwa Betisaida. <verse eid="LUK 9:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="LUK 9:11"/>Dale da wanhu diitanga mbuli ija, wamsondolela. Kawabokela, kawalongela mbuli za Undewa wa Mulungu, na kawahonya waja walondigwe kuhonyigwa.<verse eid="LUK 9:11"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="LUK 9:12"/>Zua vidisongile kuhonga, wanahina longo dimwe na wabili wamwizila wolonga, “Walongele wanhu wachole kuviwambo na kumigunda ili behi wakazahile mandia na uwaso, kwavija hano hatuli twa muluwala.”<verse eid="LUK 9:12"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="LUK 9:13"/>Ila Yesu kawalongela, “Wagweleleni mweye wenyego kinhu cha kuja.”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="LUK 9:13">Wamulongela, “Vitulinavo tweye mikate mitano na somba wabili. Kolonda tuchole kuwagulila mandia wanhu wano wose?” <verse eid="LUK 9:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="LUK 9:14"/>Haja wakala wanhu wambigalo kamba alufu tano vino.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="LUK 9:14">Yesu kawalongela wanahina zake, “Walongeleni wanhu wakale hasi mmadale ga wanhu malongo matanomatano.”<verse eid="LUK 9:14"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="LUK 9:15"/>Wanahina watenda vija, na wanhu wose wakala hasi. <verse eid="LUK 9:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="LUK 9:16"/>Yesu kasola imikate mitano na iwasomba wabili, kalola uchana kuulanga, kamgwaa hewela Mulungu, kavimogola kawagwelela wanahina zake wawagolele iwanhu. <verse eid="LUK 9:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="LUK 9:17"/>Wanhu wose waja weguta, wanahina wadondola vidanga va vakuja visigale migelo longo dimwe na mibili.<verse eid="LUK 9:17"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Petulo Komulonga Yesu Iyo Yalihi</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 16:13-19">Mat. 16:13-19</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 8:27-29">Mlk. 8:27-29</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="LUK 9:18"/>Zua dimwe Yesu kakala yotambika yeiyeka. Wanahina zake wakala hamoja na heyo, kawauza, “Wanhu wolonga nie iyo yalihi?”<verse eid="LUK 9:18"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="LUK 9:19"/>Wamulongela, “Wayagwe wolonga gweye iyo Yohana M'batiza, wayagwe wolonga gweye iyo Eliya, na wayagwe wolonga gweye iyo imwe wa wahokozi wa umwaka kuzuka kabili.”<verse eid="LUK 9:19"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="LUK 9:20"/>Yesu kawauza, “Na mweye, molonga nie iyo yalihi?”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="LUK 9:20">Petulo kalonga, “Gweye iyo Kilisto Mkombola ulawile ha Mulungu.”<verse eid="LUK 9:20"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Yesu Kohokola Avija Vondayagazigwe na Vondayadanganhike</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 16:20-28">Mat. 16:20-28</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 8:30-9:1">Mlk. 8:30—9:1</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="LUK 9:21"/>Abaho, Yesu kawazuma na kuwagomesa ng'hani sambiwamulongele munhu yoyose mbuli ino. <verse eid="LUK 9:21"/><verse number="22" style="v" sid="LUK 9:22"/>Vivija kawalongela, “Nie, Mwana wa Munhu, nolondigwa nigaye ng'hani, na nilemigwe na wakulu hamoja na wakulu wa wakulu wa nhambiko na wafundiza Malagizo ga Musa. Nokomigwa, ila mdizua da ikadatu nozuka, nowa mgima kabili.”<verse eid="LUK 9:22"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="LUK 9:23"/>Avo kawalongela wanhu wose, “Kamba munhu yahalonda kuwa mwanahina wangu, yaibele mwenyego, yaidikwe msalaba wake mazua gose, yanikoleleze. <verse eid="LUK 9:23"/><verse number="24" style="v" sid="LUK 9:24"/>Munhu yoyose yahalonda kuukombola ugima wake, kowagiza, na munhu yoyose yowagiza ugima wake sama yangu nie, koukombola. <verse eid="LUK 9:24"/><verse number="25" style="v" sid="LUK 9:25"/>Wanhu kamba wahapata vinhu vose va muisi na hewo wenyego wopotela ama wokwangama, kuna unozi waki? Nokona haduhu! <verse eid="LUK 9:25"/><verse number="26" style="v" sid="LUK 9:26"/>Kwavija munhu yoyose yahanyonela kinyala nie na mafundo gangu, nie, Mwana wa Munhu, nomonela kinyala heyo vondanize muyenzi yangu na muyenzi ya Tata na muyenzi ya wasenga wa Mulungu wang'alile wa kuulanga. <verse eid="LUK 9:26"/><verse number="27" style="v" sid="LUK 9:27"/>Nowalongeleni ikweli, hana wanhu wayagwe hano hawadanganhika mbaka wawone Undewa wa Mulungu.”<verse eid="LUK 9:27"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Yesu Kogaluka</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 17:1-8">Mat. 17:1-8</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 9:2-8">Mlk. 9:2-8</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="LUK 9:28"/>Mazua manane songela hayalongile mbuli zija, Yesu kawasola Petulo, Yohana, na Yakobo wachola kukigongo kutambika. <verse eid="LUK 9:28"/><verse number="29" style="v" sid="LUK 9:29"/>Yesu viyakalile yotambika, kihanga chake kigaluka, na vivalo vake vigaluka vizelu nang'hanang'ha. <verse eid="LUK 9:29"/><verse number="30" style="v" sid="LUK 9:30"/>Bahaja wanhu wabili wakala wolongelela na heyo. Wakala Musa na Eliya. <verse eid="LUK 9:30"/><verse number="31" style="v" sid="LUK 9:31"/>Wakalile woneke muyenzi ya kuulanga na walongelela na Yesu avija ndagizi za Mulungu vondazivikile hima na vija vondayadanganhikile Yelusalemu. <verse eid="LUK 9:31"/><verse number="32" style="v" sid="LUK 9:32"/>Petulo na wayage wakala wawasile, ila viwalamuke, wayona yenzi ya Yesu na wanhu wabili wakalile wemile na heyo. <verse eid="LUK 9:32"/><verse number="33" style="v" sid="LUK 9:33"/>Waja iwanhu wabili viwakalile wosonga kuchola, Petulo kamulongela Yesu, “Mndewa, vinoga tweye tukale hano, tuzenge vizewe vidatu, kimwe chako, kimwe cha Musa, na kimwe cha Eliya.” Kalonga avo kuno hakitangile choyolonga.<verse eid="LUK 9:33"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="LUK 9:34"/>Petulo viyakalile hanamambukiza kulonga, wingu dilawilila diwagubika, wanahina zake wadumba ng'hani avija diwingu vidiwagubike. <verse eid="LUK 9:34"/><verse number="35" style="v" sid="LUK 9:35"/>Dihulikwa dizwi kulawa mdiwingu, dilonga, “Ino iyo Mwanangu inimsagule, mtegelezeni heyo!”<verse eid="LUK 9:35"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" sid="LUK 9:36"/>Dizwi dija vudipozike, kasigala Yesu yeiyeka. Wanahina zake wanyamala tulu mmbuli zose zino na hawamulongele munhu yoyose mmazua gaja gose mbuli ziwonile.<verse eid="LUK 9:36"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Yesu Komuhonya Mmhale Yali na Kinyamkela</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 17:14-18">Mat. 17:14-18</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 9:14-27">Mlk. 9:14-27</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" sid="LUK 9:37"/>Imitondo iyagwe Yesu na waja wanahina zake wadatu wahumuluka hakigongo, na dale da wanhu dimwizila Yesu. <verse eid="LUK 9:37"/><verse number="38" style="v" sid="LUK 9:38"/>Munhu imwe kulawa muja mdidale da wanhu kenula dizwi yolonga, “Mkulufunzi, chonde, chonde, mulole mmhale wangu, iyo mwanangu yeiyeka! <verse eid="LUK 9:38"/><verse number="39" style="v" sid="LUK 9:39"/>Kinyamkela kam'vagalaga mkumsinhukiza na kumtenda yatoe nyangi chaka, komgela kisango baho holovu domulawa mmulomo, kogendelela kumulumiza, hamulekesa hima. <verse eid="LUK 9:39"/><verse number="40" style="v" sid="LUK 9:40"/>Niwayalalila wanahina zako wamuwinge ikinyamkela, ila hawadahile.”<verse eid="LUK 9:40"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="41" style="v" sid="LUK 9:41"/>Yesu kawalongela, “Mweye wanhu mpotele, mulibule nhamanila, nokala na mweye mbaka zua jaki? Nowapapa mbaka kwahi?” Abaho, kamulongela ija imunhu, “Mgale hano mwanago.” <verse eid="LUK 9:41"/><verse number="42" style="v" sid="LUK 9:42"/>Ija mmhale vayakalile yomkwenhukila Yesu, kinyamkela kam'bwanha hasi na kumgela kisango. Yesu kamkomhokela ija kinyamkela, kamuhonya ija immhale, kam'bweza ha tataake. <verse eid="LUK 9:42"/><verse number="43" style="v" sid="LUK 9:43"/>Wanhu wose wakanganya mhiko ng'hulu za Mulungu.</para>
  <para style="s1" vid="LUK 9:43">Yesu Kolonga Kabili Avija Vondayadanganhike</para>
  <para style="r" vid="LUK 9:43">(<ref loc="MAT 17:22-23">Mat. 17:22-23</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 9:30-32">Mlk. 9:30-32</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p" vid="LUK 9:43">Wanhu vawakalile wogendelela kukanganya mbuli zose zayatendile Yesu, kawalongela wanahina zake, <verse eid="LUK 9:43"/><verse number="44" style="v" sid="LUK 9:44"/>“Tegelezeni goya kinhu kinilonda kuwalongela! Nie, Mwana wa Munhu, nochola kugeligwa mmakono ga wanhu.” <verse eid="LUK 9:44"/><verse number="45" style="v" sid="LUK 9:45"/>Ila wanahina zake hawaitangile nhegulo ya mbuli ija. Mbuli ija ikala ifisigwe kumwao, avo hawaitangile nhegulo yake, na wadumba kumuuza.<verse eid="LUK 9:45"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Yalihi Yali Mkulu?</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 18:1-5">Mat. 18:1-5</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 9:33-37">Mlk. 9:33-37</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="46" style="v" sid="LUK 9:46"/>Wanahina wa Yesu wasonga kuibamilila wolonga yalihi yondayawe mkulu kubanza wose. <verse eid="LUK 9:46"/><verse number="47" style="v" sid="LUK 9:47"/>Yesu kazitanga ngelegeza zao, avo kamsola mwana mdodo kamwika behi na heyo, <verse eid="LUK 9:47"/><verse number="48" style="v" sid="LUK 9:48"/>kawalongela, “Munhu yoyose yondayam'bokele mwana ino sama ya twaga jangu, konibokela nie, na munhu yoyose yondayanibokele nie, kom'bokela ayo yanhumile nie. Avo yali mdodo kubanza mweye mose iyo mkulu kubanza wose.”<verse eid="LUK 9:48"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Munhu Yoyose Yoleka Kuibamilila Namwe Ka Hamoja Namwe</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 9:38-40">Mlk. 9:38-40</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="49" style="v" sid="LUK 9:49"/>Yohana kalonga, “Mndewa, tumona munhu yowinga vinyamkela mtwaga jako, tumgomesa, kwavija hali hamoja na tweye.”<verse eid="LUK 9:49"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="50" style="v" sid="LUK 9:50"/>Yesu kawalongela, “Sambimumgomese, kwavija munhu yoyose yoleka kuibamilila namwe, ka hamoja namwe.”<verse eid="LUK 9:50"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Wanhu wa Kiwambo Kimwe cha Samalia Wolema Kum'bokela Yesu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="51" style="v" sid="LUK 9:51"/>Kipigiti chake vikikwenhuke cha kusoligwa uchana kuulanga, Yesu kalamula yagoge nzila yachole Yelusalemu. <verse eid="LUK 9:51"/><verse number="52" style="v" sid="LUK 9:52"/>Kawagala wasenga wamulongole, avo wengila mkiwambo kimwe cha Samalia kumsasalila. <verse eid="LUK 9:52"/><verse number="53" style="v" sid="LUK 9:53"/>Ila wanhu wa haja hawam'bokele, kwavija kakala mnzila yochola Yelusalemu. <verse eid="LUK 9:53"/><verse number="54" style="v" sid="LUK 9:54"/>Wanahina zake wokemigwa Yakobo na Yohana viwawene vino, wamuuza, “Mndewa, kolonda tweye tuukeme moto uhumuluke kulawa kuulanga wize kuwalukuza kabisa?”<verse eid="LUK 9:54"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="55" style="v" sid="LUK 9:55"/>Yesu kawahindukila na kuwakomhokela yolonga, “Hamuimanyile loho imulinayo, kwavija nie, Mwana wa Munhu, sizile kubananga ugima wa wanhu, ila kuukombola.”<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">9:55 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Nyandiko ziyagwe za umwaka zabule mnhongo uno ulonga </char><char style="fk" closed="false">hamuimanyile loho imulinayo, kwavija nie, Mwana wa Munhu, sizile kubananga ugima wa wanhu, ila kuukombola.</char></note> <verse eid="LUK 9:55"/><verse number="56" style="v" sid="LUK 9:56"/>Abaho, Yesu na wanahina zake wachola hakiwambo kiyagwe.<verse eid="LUK 9:56"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Waja Hawalumbile Kuwa Wanahina wa Yesu</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 8:19-22">Mat. 8:19-22</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="57" style="v" sid="LUK 9:57"/>Viwakalile wochola mnzila, munhu imwe kamulongela Yesu, “Nokusondolela kokose kondauchole.”<verse eid="LUK 9:57"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="58" style="v" sid="LUK 9:58"/>Yesu kamulongela, “Mbweha wana mhango, ndege wana mvulu, ila nie, Mwana wa Munhu, nabule hanhu ha kutambalika pala jangu.”<verse eid="LUK 9:58"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="59" style="v" sid="LUK 9:59"/>Yesu kamulongela munhu iyagwe, “Nisondolele.”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="LUK 9:59">Ija munhu kamwidika, “Mndewa, nileke tanhu nyhole hazike tataangu.”<verse eid="LUK 9:59"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="60" style="v" sid="LUK 9:60"/>Yesu kamulongela, “Waleke wanhu wadanganhike wazike wadanganhike wayao. Ila gweye genda ukaupete Undewa wa Mulungu.”<verse eid="LUK 9:60"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="61" style="v" sid="LUK 9:61"/>Munhu iyagwe kamulongela, “Mndewa, nokusondolela, ila tanhu beta nyhole nikalage wanhu wa hakae yangu.”<verse eid="LUK 9:61"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="62" style="v" sid="LUK 9:62"/>Ila Yesu kamwidika, “Munhu yoyose yosonga kulima, abaho, kolola kuchugu, halumba Muundewa wa Mulungu.”<verse eid="LUK 9:62"/></para>
  <chapter eid="LUK 9"/>
  <chapter number="10" style="c" sid="LUK 10"/>
  <para style="s1">Yesu Kowatuma Wanhu Malongo Saba na Wabili</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="LUK 10:1"/>Abaho, Mndewa kawasagula wanhu wayagwe malongo saba na wabili,<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">10:1 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Nyandiko ziyagwe za umwaka zolonga </char><char style="fk" closed="false">malongo saba.</char></note> kawatuma wabiliwabili, wamulongole wachole m'viwambo vose na kila hanhu hayalondile kuchola mwenyego. <verse eid="LUK 10:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="LUK 10:2"/>Kawalongela, “Va kuhuna vimema, ila wahunaji wadodo. Avo mpuleni mwene mgunda yawagale wahunaji wahune vakuja vake. <verse eid="LUK 10:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="LUK 10:3"/>Gendeni! Nowalagiza mweye kamba wana ng'hondolo mdidale da mbwizi. <verse eid="LUK 10:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="LUK 10:4"/>Sambimsole mkwiji ama mkoba ama ng'hwabasa, sambimmulamse munhu yoyose mnzila. <verse eid="LUK 10:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="LUK 10:5"/>Muhengila mng'anda yoyose, longeni, ‘Tindiwalo dingile mng'anda ino.’ <verse eid="LUK 10:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="LUK 10:6"/>Kamba munhu yokala mng'anda ija yahawa mnogela tindiwalo, tindiwalo dosigala na heyo, na kamba sio, tindiwalo jenu dowabwelela. <verse eid="LUK 10:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="LUK 10:7"/>Kaleni mng'anda hiyo muja na kung'wa chochose chondamgweleligwe, kwavija wasang'hana wolondigwa wagweleligwe kitumetume chao. Sambimuhamehame mulawa ng'anda ino mwingila ng'anda iyagwe. <verse eid="LUK 10:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="LUK 10:8"/>Muhengila mkiwambo chochose na wanhu wa kiwambo kija wahawabokela, dieni chochose chondawawagweleleni. <verse eid="LUK 10:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="LUK 10:9"/>Wahonyeni watamu wa mkiwambo kija na muwalongele wanhu wa kiwambo kija, ‘Undewa wa Mulungu uwakwenhukila.’ <verse eid="LUK 10:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="LUK 10:10"/>Ila muhengila mkiwambo, na wanhu wa kiwambo kija hawawabokele, laweni gendeni mnzila za mkiwambo kija mulonge, <verse eid="LUK 10:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="LUK 10:11"/>‘Timbwisi da kiwambo chenu dinanahile mmagulu getu todihangusa diwabwelele. Ila vimanyeni Undewa wa Mulungu uwakwenhukila.’ <verse eid="LUK 10:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="LUK 10:12"/>Nowalongela, mdizua da inhaguso vobuha wanhu wa kiwambo cha Sodoma kwazaganya nhaguso yake kubanza wanhu wa kiwambo kija.”<verse eid="LUK 10:12"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Viwambo Vilemile Kutogola Mbuli za Mulungu</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 11:20-24">Mat. 11:20-24</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="LUK 10:13"/>“Kojona, Kolazini! Kojona, Betisaida! Mizonza itendigwe kumwenu ihatendigwe Tilo na Sidoni, wanhu wa haja mwaka wahakalile hasi na kuvala magunia na kuitila mitozi kulagusa kamba waleka vilozo vao. <verse eid="LUK 10:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="LUK 10:14"/>Mdizua da inhaguso, Mulungu kozonela bazi isi za Tilo na Sidoni kubanza mweye. <verse eid="LUK 10:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="LUK 10:15"/>Na gweye, Kapenaumu! Kolonda kukiinula mwenyego uchana kuulanga? Kokwasigwa hasi kuzimu!”<verse eid="LUK 10:15"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="LUK 10:16"/>Abaho, Yesu kawalongela wanahina zake, “Munhu yoyose yahawategeleza mweye konitegeleza nie. Na munhu yoyose yahawalema mweye konilema nie. Na munhu yoyose yahanilema nie komulema ija yanhumile.”<verse eid="LUK 10:16"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Wanahina Malongo Saba na Wabili Wobwela</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="LUK 10:17"/>Waja iwanahina malongo saba na wabili<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">10:17 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Nyandiko ziyagwe za umwaka zolonga </char><char style="fk" closed="false">malongo saba.</char></note> wabwela wodeng'ha ng'hani, wolonga, “Mndewa, hata vinyamkela wotuhulika vituwakomhokele mditwaga jako!”<verse eid="LUK 10:17"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="LUK 10:18"/>Yesu kawalongela, “Nimona Mwenembago yolagala kamba mwemwe kulawa kuulanga. <verse eid="LUK 10:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="LUK 10:19"/>Tegelezeni! Niwagweleleni udaho wa kuwabojaga nyoka na inge na kuzihuma mhiko zose za Mwenembago, na haduhu kinhu chochose chondakiwalumize. <verse eid="LUK 10:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="LUK 10:20"/>Ila sambimdeng'he kwavija vinyamkela vowowafugamila mavindi, ila mdeng'he kwavija matwaga genu gandikwa kuulanga.”<verse eid="LUK 10:20"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Yesu Kodeng'helela</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 11:25-27">Mat. 11:25-27</ref>; <ref loc="MAT 13:16-17">13:16-17</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="LUK 10:21"/>Kipigiti kija Yesu kuno yamemile deng'ho da Loho wa Mulungu kalonga, “Nokuheweza, Tata, Mndewa wa kuulanga na muisi! Kwavija mbuli zino kuwafisa wabala na wasomile na kuwagubulila wana wadodo. Ona, Tata, vino vivo vikunogele.”<verse eid="LUK 10:21"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="LUK 10:22"/>Abaho, kalonga, “Tataangu kangwelela nie vinhu vose. Haduhu munhu yomtanga Mwana, ila Tata, na haduhu munhu yomtanga Tata, ila Mwana, na ayo Mwana yaasagule kumgubula Tata kumwake.”<verse eid="LUK 10:22"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="LUK 10:23"/>Abaho, Yesu kawahindukila wanahina zake na kuwalongela kinyele, “Muna mhome ng'hani mweye kuzona mbuli zino zimzona! <verse eid="LUK 10:23"/><verse number="24" style="v" sid="LUK 10:24"/>Nowalongeleni, wahokozi bwando na wandewa wasulukila kugona gano gomgona mweye, ila hawagonile, na wasulukila kugahulika gano gomuhulika mweye, ila hawagahulike.”<verse eid="LUK 10:24"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Hala da Msamalia Yali na Moyo Unogile</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="LUK 10:25"/>Abaho, mfundiza Malagizo ga Musa kakwenhuka behi na Yesu, kageza kumwikila kitega, kamuuza, “Mkulufunzi, nhende choni kileka ningile muugima wa digunge?”<verse eid="LUK 10:25"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="LUK 10:26"/>Yesu kamulongela, “Nyandiko Zing'alile zolongaze? Gweye kozisomaze?”<verse eid="LUK 10:26"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="LUK 10:27"/>Ija imunhu kedika, “Mnogele Mndewa Mulungu wako na moyo wako wose, na loho yako yose, na mhiko zako zose, na nzonzi zako zose, na mnogele munhu wa habehi nagwe kamba vuukiinogela mwenyego.”<verse eid="LUK 10:27"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="LUK 10:28"/>Yesu kamulongela, “Kulonga goya, tenda vino avo kokwingila muugima wa digunge.”<verse eid="LUK 10:28"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="LUK 10:29"/>Ila ija imfundiza Malagizo ga Musa kalonda kuilagusa kamba kakimanya kija chayakalile youza, kamuuza Yesu, “Munhu wa habehi yangu iyo yalihi?”<verse eid="LUK 10:29"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="LUK 10:30"/>Yesu kamulongela, “Munhu imwe kakala yohumuluka kulawa Yelusalemu kachola Yeliko, mibokonyi im'vamhila, im'bokonya vinhu vake vose, abaho, wamtoa ng'hani, wamuleka behi na kudanganhika. <verse eid="LUK 10:30"/><verse number="31" style="v" sid="LUK 10:31"/>Baho kalawila mkulu wa nhambiko imwe kahumuluka mnzila ija, viyamuwene ija imunhu, kakuluguta, kagendelela na mwanza wake. <verse eid="LUK 10:31"/><verse number="32" style="v" sid="LUK 10:32"/>Vivija mnzila ija kabita Mulawi, kamkwenhukila, kamulola, abaho, kakuluguta, kagendelela na mwanza wake. <verse eid="LUK 10:32"/><verse number="33" style="v" sid="LUK 10:33"/>Ila Msamalia yakalile yobita nzila ija kavika hayali munhu ija, viyamuwene, kamonela bazi. <verse eid="LUK 10:33"/><verse number="34" style="v" sid="LUK 10:34"/>Kamkwenhukila, kamgela mavuta na divai m'vilonda vake, na kumfungiliza ivilonda, abaho, kamkweleza mkihongwe wake kamgala kung'anda ya wahenza kumuguza. <verse eid="LUK 10:34"/><verse number="35" style="v" sid="LUK 10:35"/>Imitondo iyagwe kalava vidanga vibili va hela, kamgwelela ija imwimilizi wa ing'anda ya wahenza. Kamulongela, ‘Muguze, nihabwela, nokuliha kinhu chochose chuulavile sama yake.’ ”<verse eid="LUK 10:35"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" sid="LUK 10:36"/>Baho Yesu kalonga, “Kokonaze, yalihi muwanhu wano wadatu yali munhu wa habehi wa munhu ija yavamhilwe na mibokonyi?”<verse eid="LUK 10:36"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" sid="LUK 10:37"/>Ija imfundiza Malagizo ga Musa kamwidika, “Ija yamonele bazi.”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="LUK 10:37">Yesu kalonga, “Genda ukatende kamba avo.”<verse eid="LUK 10:37"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Yesu Kowatembelela Mata na Maliamu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="38" style="v" sid="LUK 10:38"/>Yesu na wanahina zake viwakalile wochola mnzila, wavika hakiwambo kimwe. Mtwanzi imwe yokemigwa Mata kam'bokela hakae yake. <verse eid="LUK 10:38"/><verse number="39" style="v" sid="LUK 10:39"/>Kakala na lumbu jake yokemigwa Maliamu yakalile hamagulu ga Mndewa, yotegeleza gaja goyolonga. <verse eid="LUK 10:39"/><verse number="40" style="v" sid="LUK 10:40"/>Avo Mata kakala yogaya na sang'hano zose, avo keza ha Yesu kamulongela, “Mndewa, huvona vino lumbu jangu voyonilekela nitende sang'hano zose nene niiyeka? Mulongele yeze kunitaza.”<verse eid="LUK 10:40"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="41" style="v" sid="LUK 10:41"/>Ila Mndewa kamwidika, yolonga, “Gweye Mata, gweye Mata! Kohunganika na kugaya m'vinhu bwando, <verse eid="LUK 10:41"/><verse number="42" style="v" sid="LUK 10:42"/>ila kinhu kimwe kilondigwa. Maliamu kasagula kinhu hicho, na havidahika kusegezwa kumwake.”<verse eid="LUK 10:42"/></para>
  <chapter eid="LUK 10"/>
  <chapter number="11" style="c" sid="LUK 11"/>
  <para style="s1">Yesu Kofundiza Kutambika</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 6:9-13">Mat. 6:9-13</ref>; <ref loc="MAT 7:7-11">7:7-11</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="LUK 11:1"/>Zua dimwe Yesu kakala yotambika hanhu hamwe. Viyeshile kutambika, mwanahina wake imwe kamulongela, “Mndewa, tufundize kutambika kamba Yohana viyawafundize wanahina zake.”<verse eid="LUK 11:1"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="LUK 11:2"/>Yesu kawalongela, “Muhatambika, longeni vino,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="LUK 11:2">‘Tata,<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">11:2 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Nyandiko ziyagwe za umwaka zongeza </char><char style="fqa" closed="false">uli kuulanga.</char></note></para>
  <para style="q2" vid="LUK 11:2">twaga jako diyenzigwe,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="LUK 11:2">undewa wako wize,<verse eid="LUK 11:2"/></para>
  <para style="q2">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="LUK 11:3"/>utugwelele mandia getu ga kila zua,<verse eid="LUK 11:3"/></para>
  <para style="q2">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="LUK 11:4"/>ugele kumgongo vilozo vetu,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="LUK 11:4">kwavija na tweye towagela kumgongo awo wotutendela gehile,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="LUK 11:4">na sambiutugele mkugezigwa.’ ”<verse eid="LUK 11:4"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="LUK 11:5"/>Yesu kawalongela wanahina zake, “Tutende munhu imwe mmwanza wenu yachole hang'anda ya mbwigaake ikilo kikulu yolonga, ‘Mbwigaangu, ng'halizi mikate midatu, <verse eid="LUK 11:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="LUK 11:6"/>kwavija mbwigaangu ka mmwanza kabitila hang'anda yangu, na nabule mandia ga kumgwaa!’ <verse eid="LUK 11:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="LUK 11:7"/>Na mbwigaako yakwidike yali mng'anda, ‘Sambiungaze! Lwivi luhindigwa lwisha, nie na wanangu twa mulusazi. Sidaha kwinuka nikugwelele kinhu chochose.’ <verse eid="LUK 11:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="LUK 11:8"/>Nowalongela, hata kamba henuka yakugwelele umkate, kwavija gweye kwa mbwigaake, kokwinuka na kokugwelela kila kinhu kwavija hukonile kinyala kupula ubwelela.<verse eid="LUK 11:8"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="LUK 11:9"/>“Avo nowalongeleni puleni, mogweleligwa. Zahileni, movumbula. Toeni hodi, movugulilwa. <verse eid="LUK 11:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="LUK 11:10"/>Kwavija yoyose yopula kogweleligwa, na yoyose yozahila kovumbula, na yoyose yotoa hodi kovugulilwa. <verse eid="LUK 11:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="LUK 11:11"/>Vino hana tata yalihi kumwenu, mwanage yahampula somba yomgwaa nyoka? <verse eid="LUK 11:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="LUK 11:12"/>Ama yahampula finga yomgwaa inge? <verse eid="LUK 11:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="LUK 11:13"/>Ihawa mweye mtenda mbuli zihile, movitanga kuwagwelela wanenu vinhu vinogile, avo, Tata wenu wa kuulanga kabanza ng'hani kuwagwelela Loho wa Mulungu waja wose wompula!”<verse eid="LUK 11:13"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Yesu na Belizebuli</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 12:22-30">Mat. 12:22-30</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 3:20-27">Mlk. 3:20-27</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="LUK 11:14"/>Yesu kakala yomuwinga kinyamkela yamtendile munhu yawe bubui, na ikinyamkela viyalawile, munhu ija kasonga kulonga, dale da wanhu dikanganya. <verse eid="LUK 11:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="LUK 11:15"/>Ila wanhu wayagwe walonga, “Kowinga vinyamkela na udaho wa Belizebuli, mkulu wa vinyamkela.”<verse eid="LUK 11:15"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="LUK 11:16"/>Wayagwe walonda kumwikila vitega Yesu, avo wamulonda yatende mzonza yoneke kamba udaho wake ulawa kuulanga. <verse eid="LUK 11:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="LUK 11:17"/>Ila Yesu kagatanga gaja gowokala wogelegeza, avo kawalongela, “Undewa wowose uhaigola wenyego kwa wenyego wopwililika, na kamba mulango uhaigola wenyego wogwa. <verse eid="LUK 11:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="LUK 11:18"/>Kamba Mwenembago yahaigola mwenyego, undewa wake wokwimaze? Nolonga gano kwavija molonga kamba nowinga vinyamkela na udaho wa Belizebuli. <verse eid="LUK 11:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="LUK 11:19"/>Kamba nie nowinga vinyamkela na udaho wa Belizebuli, wanenu wowinga vinyamkela na udaho ulihi? Avo wanenu wowa watagusa wenu. <verse eid="LUK 11:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="LUK 11:20"/>Ila kamba nowinga vinyamkela na mhiko za Mulungu, togoleni kamba Undewa wa Mulungu uwavikila.”<verse eid="LUK 11:20"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="LUK 11:21"/>Munhu yali na mhiko, yehemiliza ng'anda yake na via vake va kuiimilizila, vinhu vake vose havibigwa. <verse eid="LUK 11:21"/><verse number="22" style="v" sid="LUK 11:22"/>Ila munhu yali na mhiko kubanza heyo yaham'vamhila na kumuhuma, kom'bokonya via vake vose va kuiimilizila voyokala yotamanila na kupwililisa vinhu vayebile.<verse eid="LUK 11:22"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="LUK 11:23"/>“Munhu yoyose yalekile kuwa hamoja na nie, konibeza, na munhu yoyose yalekile kukunzanya na nie, kopwililisa.<verse eid="LUK 11:23"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Kinyamkela Voyobwela</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 12:43-45">Mat. 12:43-45</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="LUK 11:24"/>“Kinyamkela yahamulawa munhu, kochola hanhu halibule mazi yozahila hanhu ha kuhumula. Kamba honile hanhu, kokiilongela mwenyego, ‘Nobwela hang'anda yangu.’ <verse eid="LUK 11:24"/><verse number="25" style="v" sid="LUK 11:25"/>Avo kobwela koivika ng'anda ifagiligwe na kuhambigwa. <verse eid="LUK 11:25"/><verse number="26" style="v" sid="LUK 11:26"/>Abaho, kochola kuwasola vinyamkela wayagwe saba wehile kubanza heyo mwenyego, wokwiza na kumwingila. Avo hali ya munhu ija yokwiha ng'hani kubanza viyakalile haichanduso.”<verse eid="LUK 11:26"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Deng'ho da Kweli</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="LUK 11:27"/>Yesu viyalongile gano, mtwanzi imwe kenula dizwi kalonga, “Kamota ng'hani mtwanzi ija yakulelile na yakukong'heze.”<verse eid="LUK 11:27"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="LUK 11:28"/>Yesu kamulongela, “Wamota ng'haning'hani wanhu waja wotegeleza mbuli za Mulungu na kuzitogola.”<verse eid="LUK 11:28"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Wanhu Wolonda Wone Mzonza</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 12:38-42">Mat. 12:38-42</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="LUK 11:29"/>Wanhu viwammemele womzunguluka Yesu, kasonga kulonga, “Wanhu wa mulelo wihile wozahila kilaguso! Hawagweleligwa kilaguso, ila kilaguso cha Yona. <verse eid="LUK 11:29"/><verse number="30" style="v" sid="LUK 11:30"/>Kamba vija Yona viyakalile kilaguso cha wanhu wa Ninawi, avo nie, Mwana wa Munhu, nowa kilaguso cha wanhu wa mazua gano. <verse eid="LUK 11:30"/><verse number="31" style="v" sid="LUK 11:31"/>Hana dizua da nhaguso Malikia wa Sheba kokwima na kuwatagusa wanhu wa mulelo uno, kwavija kachola mwanza mtali kulawa muisi yake keza kutegeleza mafundo gali na ng'hungwe ga Mndewa Selemani, avo nowalongeleni hano hana munhu mkulu kubanza Selemani. <verse eid="LUK 11:31"/><verse number="32" style="v" sid="LUK 11:32"/>Hana idizua da nhaguso wanhu wa Ninawi vivija wokwima haja hamoja na mweye na wowatagusa mweye, kwavija viwahulike Yona yopeta mbuli za Mulungu, waleka vilozo vao, avo nowalongeleni hano hana munhu mkulu kubanza Yona!<verse eid="LUK 11:32"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Kiwenge cha Lukuli</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 5:15">Mat. 5:15</ref>; <ref loc="MAT 6:22-23">6:22-23</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="LUK 11:33"/>“Haduhu munhu yobwinha kiwenge, abaho, yakifise ama yakigubike na kiteleko, ila kokika uchana hakingolobweda wanhu wehengila mng'anda wone mulangaza. <verse eid="LUK 11:33"/><verse number="34" style="v" sid="LUK 11:34"/>Kiwenge cha lukuli lwako meso gako. Kamba meso gako gahawa magima, lukuli lwako lose lowa na mulangaza, ila meso gako gahabanangika, lukuli lwako lose lowa mziza. <verse eid="LUK 11:34"/><verse number="35" style="v" sid="LUK 11:35"/>Teganyeni, mulangaza uli mmwenu sambiuwe ziza. <verse eid="LUK 11:35"/><verse number="36" style="v" sid="LUK 11:36"/>Ihawa lukuli lwako lose luna mulangaza, bila kuleka hanhu mziza, avo lukuli lose lomulika, kamba vija kiwenge vikikumulikila na mulangaza wake.”<verse eid="LUK 11:36"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Yesu Kowatagusa Mafalisayo na Wafundiza Malagizo ga Musa</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 23:1-36">Mat. 23:1-36</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 12:38-40">Mlk. 12:38-40</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" sid="LUK 11:37"/>Yesu viyeshile kulonga, Mfalisayo imwe kamgoneka yachole kumwake yakaje hamoja na heyo, avo kachola, kengila mng'anda kakala hasi yaje. <verse eid="LUK 11:37"/><verse number="38" style="v" sid="LUK 11:38"/>Ija Imfalisayo kakanganya viyawene kamba Yesu hasonga kusungusa makono kipigiti yahalonda kuja mandia. <verse eid="LUK 11:38"/><verse number="39" style="v" sid="LUK 11:39"/>Avo Mndewa kamulongela, “Mweye Mafalisayo mosungusa hanze ya ikikasi na ichano, ila mgati yenu mmema ubokonyi na wiho. <verse eid="LUK 11:39"/><verse number="40" style="v" sid="LUK 11:40"/>Wabozi mweye! Avino si heyo Mulungu yatendile hanze vivija katenda na mgati? <verse eid="LUK 11:40"/><verse number="41" style="v" sid="LUK 11:41"/>Avo wagweleleni wakumbulu vinhu vili mchano na mkikasi, avo kila kinhu chong'ala kumwenu.<verse eid="LUK 11:41"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="42" style="v" sid="LUK 11:42"/>“Mojona Mafalisayo! Molava zaka ya matepo ga kulungila mandia na mboga ziyagwe, ila muleka kutenda ganogile mwa wanhu na kumnogela Mulungu. Molondigwa mtende gano tanhu, na sambimuleke gayagwe.<verse eid="LUK 11:42"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="43" style="v" sid="LUK 11:43"/>“Mojona Mafalisayo! Kwavija molonda kukala m'vigoda va haulongozi muna izing'anda za nhambiko na kulamswa m'vigenge va wanhu. <verse eid="LUK 11:43"/><verse number="44" style="v" sid="LUK 11:44"/>Mojona! Kwavija mweye mwa kamba mapanga galibule viguzo wanhu wogabojaga bila kuvimanya.”<verse eid="LUK 11:44"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="45" style="v" sid="LUK 11:45"/>Mfundiza imwe wa Malagizo ga Musa kamulongela Yesu, “Mkulufunzi, uhalonga avo, kotuliga na tweye!”<verse eid="LUK 11:45"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="46" style="v" sid="LUK 11:46"/>Yesu kamulongela, “Vivija na mweye wafundiza Malagizo ga Musa, mojona! Kwavija mowadikwa wanhu mibahasha haidahika kupapika, kuno mweye wenyego hamgolosa hata kidole kuwataza. <verse eid="LUK 11:46"/><verse number="47" style="v" sid="LUK 11:47"/>Mojona! Kwavija mogazengela goya mapanga ga wahokozi, wawaja wakomigwe na wahenga zenu. <verse eid="LUK 11:47"/><verse number="48" style="v" sid="LUK 11:48"/>Avo mwemwe wenyego motogola gaja gawatendile wahenga zenu. Wawakoma wahokozi, na mweye mogazengela mapanga gao. <verse eid="LUK 11:48"/><verse number="49" style="v" sid="LUK 11:49"/>Avo sama ya mbuli ino, Ng'hungwe ya Mulungu ilonga, ‘Nowagalila wahokozi na watumigwa, wayagwe wowakoma na wayagwe wowagaza ng'hani.’ <verse eid="LUK 11:49"/><verse number="50" style="v" sid="LUK 11:50"/>Avo wanhu wa mulelo uno wotaguswa sama ya wahokozi wose wakomigwe songela isi viilumbigwe, <verse eid="LUK 11:50"/><verse number="51" style="v" sid="LUK 11:51"/>songela kukomigwa kwa Abeli mbaka kukomigwa kwa Zakalia, yakomigwe hagatigati ya ikilingo cha kulavila nhosa na Hanhu Hang'alile. Ona, nowalongela, wanhu wa mulelo uno wotaguswa sama ya kuwakoma wanhu wano wose!<verse eid="LUK 11:51"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="52" style="v" sid="LUK 11:52"/>“Mojona mweye wafundiza Malagizo ga Musa! Kwavija mkisola kivugulilo cha ulwivi lwa ilimu ya kuzimanyila mbuli, mweye wenyego hamwingila, na waja wolonda kwingila mowazuila!”<verse eid="LUK 11:52"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="53" style="v" sid="LUK 11:53"/>Yesu viyalawile muja, wafundiza Malagizo ga Musa na Mafalisayo wasonga kum'beza na lusango na kumuuza mbuli bwando, <verse eid="LUK 11:53"/><verse number="54" style="v" sid="LUK 11:54"/>wompelemba giladi kamba yahalonga gehile, wamnamate.<verse eid="LUK 11:54"/></para>
  <chapter eid="LUK 11"/>
  <chapter number="12" style="c" sid="LUK 12"/>
  <para style="s1">Yesu Kowazuma Videlenya</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 10:26-27">Mat. 10:26-27</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="LUK 12:1"/>Wanhu bwando walibule mheta viwakiilundize hamoja, mbaka wakala wokiibojaga, tanhu Yesu kasonga kulonga na wanahina zake, “Iteganyeni na mela da Mafalisayo, nolonga udelenya wao. <verse eid="LUK 12:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="LUK 12:2"/>Haduhu kinhu chochose kigubikwe chondakileke kugubulwa, ama kifisigwe chondakileke kutangigwa. <verse eid="LUK 12:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="LUK 12:3"/>Avo mina, chochose chumulongile mziza, chohulikwa mmulangaza, na chochose chumnyong'onye mwiyeka mgati dihindigwe, chopetigwa mwa wanhu wose.<verse eid="LUK 12:3"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Yolondigwa Kudumbigwa</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 10:28-31">Mat. 10:28-31</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="LUK 12:4"/>“Nowalongeleni, mweye wambwiga zangu, sambimuwadumbe awo wokoma ulukuli, abaho, hawadaha kutenda kinhu chochose kiyagwe. <verse eid="LUK 12:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="LUK 12:5"/>Ila nowalagusila wa kumdumba, mdumbeni Mulungu kwavija Mulungu yehesha kulukoma ulukuli, kana udaho wa kuwasa mweye kuzimu. Avo, nowalongeleni, ino iyo wa kumdumba!<verse eid="LUK 12:5"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="LUK 12:6"/>“Vitongwa vitano haviuzigwa na hela ndodo? Ila haduhu hata kitongwa kimwe kiisemwigwa na Mulungu. <verse eid="LUK 12:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="LUK 12:7"/>Ila mweye, hata mheta ya mvili za mmapala genu zitangigwa na Mulungu. Avo sambimdumbe, mweye mzama ng'hani kubanza vitongwa bwando!<verse eid="LUK 12:7"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Kumtogola ama Kumulema Kilisto</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 10:32-33">Mat. 10:32-33</ref>; <ref loc="MAT 12:32">12:32</ref>; <ref loc="MAT 10:19-20">10:19-20</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="LUK 12:8"/>“Nowalongela, munhu yoyose yondayanitogole nie hameso ga wanhu kamba ka ng'ambu yangu, nie, Mwana wa Munhu, nomtogola munhu ija hameso ga wasenga wa Mulungu wa kuulanga. <verse eid="LUK 12:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="LUK 12:9"/>Ila munhu yoyose yahanilema nie hameso ga wanhu, nie, Mwana wa Munhu, nomulema munhu ija hameso ga wasenga wa Mulungu wa kuulanga.<verse eid="LUK 12:9"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="LUK 12:10"/>“Munhu yoyose yolonga mbuli za kunibeza nie, Mwana wa Munhu, vodahika kugeligwa kumgongo, ila munhu yoyose yahalonga mbuli za ufukuzi ha Loho wa Mulungu, havidahika kugeligwa kumgongo.<verse eid="LUK 12:10"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="LUK 12:11"/>“Wahawagala mzing'anda za nhambiko ama ha wandewa ama ha wakulu kuwatagusa, sambimgelegeze avija vondamuigombeleze ama avija vondamulonge. <verse eid="LUK 12:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="LUK 12:12"/>Kwavija Loho wa Mulungu kowafundiza kimulondigwa kulonga mkipigiti hicho.”<verse eid="LUK 12:12"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Hala da Mgoli M'bozi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="LUK 12:13"/>Munhu imwe yakalile mdidale dija kamulongela Yesu, “Mkulufunzi, mulongele mkulu wangu yanigolele uhazi uyatulekele tata wetu.”<verse eid="LUK 12:13"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="LUK 12:14"/>Yesu kamulongela, “Mbwigaangu, yalihi yangwelele nie sang'hano ya kulamula ama kuwagolela vinhu mweye wabili?” <verse eid="LUK 12:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="LUK 12:15"/>Abaho, kawalongela, “Teganyeni, inegeni na sulukila ya namna zose, kwavija ugima wa munhu hauli m'vinhu bwando vayalinavo.”<verse eid="LUK 12:15"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="LUK 12:16"/>Abaho, Yesu kawalongela hala dino, “Kukala na munhu imwe mgoli, yakalile na mgunda ugwisile vakuja bwando. <verse eid="LUK 12:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="LUK 12:17"/>Kasonga kugelegeza munda kwa munda, yolonga, ‘Nabule hanhu ha kwika vakuja vangu. Nhendeze?’ <verse eid="LUK 12:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="LUK 12:18"/>Abaho, kalonga, ‘Nhende vino, nogabomola makano gangu, nizenge makano makulu, avo nokwika vakuja vangu na vinhu vangu vose visigale. <verse eid="LUK 12:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="LUK 12:19"/>Abaho, nokiilongela, “Gweye munhu mwene mhome! Kuna vinhu bwando vinogile vuwikile ngama ya milao bwando, avo uhumule, uje, ung'we, na udeng'he!” ’ <verse eid="LUK 12:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="LUK 12:20"/>Ila Mulungu kamulongela, ‘M'bozi gweye! Ikilo ya lelo ugima wako wolondigwa, avo vinhu vino vose vuuilundikizile vowa va yalihi!’ ”<verse eid="LUK 12:20"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="LUK 12:21"/>Yesu kamambukiza yolonga, “Vino vivo vondaiwe mwa munhu yoyose yokiilundikizila mwenyego vinhu, ila hameso ga Mulungu kabule kinhu.”<verse eid="LUK 12:21"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Mtamanile Mulungu</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 6:25-34">Mat. 6:25-34</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="LUK 12:22"/>Abaho, Yesu kawalongela wanahina zake, “Avo, nowalongela, sambimuigazile ugima wenu, muje choni, ama ng'huli zenu, m'vale choni. <verse eid="LUK 12:22"/><verse number="23" style="v" sid="LUK 12:23"/>Kwavija ugima uzama kubanza mandia, na lukuli luzama kubanza vivalo. <verse eid="LUK 12:23"/><verse number="24" style="v" sid="LUK 12:24"/>Waloleni mabondwa, hawahanda mbeyu ama kuhuna vakuja, wabule makano gogose, ila Mulungu kowagwelela mandia! Mweye mzama ng'hani kubanza ndege. <verse eid="LUK 12:24"/><verse number="25" style="v" sid="LUK 12:25"/>Yalihi kumwenu mkuigaza ng'hani mmoyo, yodaha kongeza hata zua dimwe muugima wake? <verse eid="LUK 12:25"/><verse number="26" style="v" sid="LUK 12:26"/>Kamba hamdaha kutenda kinhu kidodo kamba kino, habali muigazila vinhu viyagwe? <verse eid="LUK 12:26"/><verse number="27" style="v" sid="LUK 12:27"/>Loleni malua ga mmuhulo vigokula, hagasang'hanika ama kuitendela vivalo. Ila nowalongela, hata Selemani na mali gake gose hawile na vivalo vinogile kamba malua gano. <verse eid="LUK 12:27"/><verse number="28" style="v" sid="LUK 12:28"/>Kamba Mulungu koivaza mijani ya mmuhulo ikoneka lelo na mayo yokwasigwa na kusomigwa, habanza ng'hani kuwavaza mweye? Mweye wanhu muli na nhamanila ndodo!<verse eid="LUK 12:28"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="LUK 12:29"/>“Avo sambimgaye mmioyo yenu, kamba moja choni, ama mong'wa choni, na sambimdungwedungwe sama ya mbuli zino. <verse eid="LUK 12:29"/><verse number="30" style="v" sid="LUK 12:30"/>Kwavija Wamhazi wa ulumwengu uno wawo wozigelegeza ng'hani mbuli kamba zino, ila mweye, Tata wenu kovitanga kamba movilonda vinhu vino. <verse eid="LUK 12:30"/><verse number="31" style="v" sid="LUK 12:31"/>Ila uzahileni Undewa wa Mulungu, na gano gose mogweleligwa.<verse eid="LUK 12:31"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Mali Kuulanga</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 6:19-21">Mat. 6:19-21</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="LUK 12:32"/>“Sambimdumbe, mweye dale dodo, kwavija Tata wenu kanogelwa kuwagwelela mweye Undewa wake. <verse eid="LUK 12:32"/><verse number="33" style="v" sid="LUK 12:33"/>Guzeni vimulinavo zihela muwagwelele wakumbulu. Itendeleni wenyego mkwiji wa hela haulalaga, mwike mali genu kuulanga, aho mali genu hagahunguka, kwavija haduhu wabavi wondawakwenhukile ama vimhungu vondavibanange. <verse eid="LUK 12:33"/><verse number="34" style="v" sid="LUK 12:34"/>Kwavija mali gako hagali na moyo wako baho hondaukale.<verse eid="LUK 12:34"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Watumigwa Wali Meso</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="LUK 12:35"/>“Kaleni meso na jojose dondadize, toeni lupati, na kubwinha viwenge venu, <verse eid="LUK 12:35"/><verse number="36" style="v" sid="LUK 12:36"/>kamba watumigwa wom'beta mndewa wao yobwela kulawa kulusona lwa zengele. Avija yobwela na kubwenga ulwivi, hima wom'vugulila. <verse eid="LUK 12:36"/><verse number="37" style="v" sid="LUK 12:37"/>Wodeng'ha ng'hani watumigwa waja mndewa wao vondayabwele yahawavika wameso, waisasale! Nowalongela ikweli, koisasala, na kuwalongela wakale hasi na kuwasang'hanikila. <verse eid="LUK 12:37"/><verse number="38" style="v" sid="LUK 12:38"/>Wodeng'ha ng'hani watumigwa waja kamba yahawavika waisasale, hata kamba yeheza ikilo kikulu ama nzogolo zikwika. <verse eid="LUK 12:38"/><verse number="39" style="v" sid="LUK 12:39"/>Muitange goya mbuli ino, kamba mwene ng'anda yahakimanyile kipigiti m'bavi chondayeze, sambiyaileke ng'anda yake ituligwe. <verse eid="LUK 12:39"/><verse number="40" style="v" sid="LUK 12:40"/>Vivija na mweye muisasale, kwavija nie, Mwana wa Munhu, nokwiza mkipigiti hamkitamanile.”<verse eid="LUK 12:40"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Mtumigwa Yalibule Uzenzeleganye na Mtumigwa Mzenzeleganye</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 24:45-51">Mat. 24:45-51</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="41" style="v" sid="LUK 12:41"/>Petulo kalonga, “Mndewa, hala dino kotulongela tweye twiyeka, ama kowalongela na wanhu wose?”<verse eid="LUK 12:41"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="42" style="v" sid="LUK 12:42"/>Mndewa kamulongela, “Yalihi mtumigwa ija yalibule uzenzeleganye, yali m'bala, mkulu wake yondayamwike yawe mkulu wa watumigwa zake wayagwe, giladi yawagwelele mandia mkipigiti kilondigwa? <verse eid="LUK 12:42"/><verse number="43" style="v" sid="LUK 12:43"/>Kodeng'ha ng'hani mtumigwa ija mkulu wake yahabwela ukae, yaham'vika yotenda vino. <verse eid="LUK 12:43"/><verse number="44" style="v" sid="LUK 12:44"/>Nowalongela ikweli, mkulu ija komtenda mtumigwa ija yawe mkulu wa mali gake gose. <verse eid="LUK 12:44"/><verse number="45" style="v" sid="LUK 12:45"/>Ila kamba mtumigwa ija yahalonga mmoyo wake, ‘Mkulu wangu kokawa ng'hani kubwela,’ na kusonga kuwatoa watumigwa wayage wakitwanzi na wakimbigalo na kuja na kung'wa na kukoligwa, <verse eid="LUK 12:45"/><verse number="46" style="v" sid="LUK 12:46"/>mkulu ija kobwela mdizua mtumigwa ija haditamanile na kipigiti hakitangile. Mkulu ija komkanha mtumigwa ija vidangavidanga na kumwika hamoja na walibule nhamanila.<verse eid="LUK 12:46"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="47" style="v" sid="LUK 12:47"/>“Mtumigwa ija yovimanya vija voyolondigwa yatende na mkulu wake ila hakiisasala, ama hatenda gaja goyolonda mkulu wake, mtumigwa ija kolimbwa ng'hani. <verse eid="LUK 12:47"/><verse number="48" style="v" sid="LUK 12:48"/>Ila kamba mtumigwa ija hagatangile gaja mkulu wake goyolonda, na kutenda kinhu kimulumbile kulimbwa, kolimbwa hadodo. Munhu yagweleligwe vinhu bwando, kumwake volondigwa vinhu bwando. Na munhu yagweleligwe vinhu bwando ng'hani, kumwake volondigwa vinhu bwando ng'hani.<verse eid="LUK 12:48"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Yesu Keza Kugala Mbagu</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 10:34-36">Mat. 10:34-36</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="49" style="v" sid="LUK 12:49"/>“Niza kubwinha moto muisi, vinilondile wakile umalile! <verse eid="LUK 12:49"/><verse number="50" style="v" sid="LUK 12:50"/>Nna ubatizo nolondigwa niubokele, nogaya ng'hani mbaka vondaumale! <verse eid="LUK 12:50"/><verse number="51" style="v" sid="LUK 12:51"/>Mwagiza niza kugala tindiwalo muisi? Si vivo, sigalile tindiwalo ila uhasanyi. <verse eid="LUK 12:51"/><verse number="52" style="v" sid="LUK 12:52"/>Songela lelo na kugendelela, mulango wa wanhu watano wokiihasanya, wadatu kwa wabili na wabili kwa wadatu. <verse eid="LUK 12:52"/><verse number="53" style="v" sid="LUK 12:53"/>Watata wokiihasanya na wana zao, na wana wokiihasanya na watata zao, wakinamama wokiihasanya na wandele zao, na wandele wokiihasanya na wamama zao, wamama mkwe wokiihasanya na wakemwana zao, na wakemwana wokiihasanya na wamama mkwe zao.”<verse eid="LUK 12:53"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Kuutanga Msimu</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 16:2-3">Mat. 16:2-3</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="54" style="v" sid="LUK 12:54"/>Kabili Yesu kawalongela wanhu, “Muhajona wingu dilawilila ng'ambu ya uswelo wa zua, molonga mvula konda kutoa, na kweli kotoa. <verse eid="LUK 12:54"/><verse number="55" style="v" sid="LUK 12:55"/>Na muhajona beho dilawilila kusi, molonga zua dobatuka lelo, na kweli dobatuka. <verse eid="LUK 12:55"/><verse number="56" style="v" sid="LUK 12:56"/>Videlenya mweye! Modaha kutapita gaja gokoneka kuulanga na muisi. Habali hamtanga kukitapita kipigiti kino?<verse eid="LUK 12:56"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Ilumbe na Mdumuka Wako</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 5:25-26">Mat. 5:25-26</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="57" style="v" sid="LUK 12:57"/>“Habali hamdaha kuilamula wenyego mtende mbuli zinogile? <verse eid="LUK 12:57"/><verse number="58" style="v" sid="LUK 12:58"/>Iyohe ng'hani kuilumba na munhu yokugala ha mulamula kipigiti mng'hali mnzila, kamba hutendile avo kokukwekwesa yakuvikize ha mulamula, na mulamula yakugele mmakono ga wemilizi, na wemilizi wakugele mkifungo. <verse eid="LUK 12:58"/><verse number="59" style="v" sid="LUK 12:59"/>Nokulongela hulawa himo mbaka ulihe shilingi ya ikimambukizo.”<verse eid="LUK 12:59"/></para>
  <chapter eid="LUK 12"/>
  <chapter number="13" style="c" sid="LUK 13"/>
  <para style="s1">Lekeni Vilozo Venu Bule Mofa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="LUK 13:1"/>Kipigiti kija wanhu wayagwe wakalile haja wamulongela Yesu mbuli ya Wagalilaya wakomigwe na Pilato viwakalile womulavila Mulungu nhosa zao. <verse eid="LUK 13:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="LUK 13:2"/>Yesu kawauza, “Kwavija Wagalilaya waja wakomigwa kamba vija, mokwagiza wakala walozile ng'hani kubanza Wagalilaya wose? <verse eid="LUK 13:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="LUK 13:3"/>Si vivo! Na nowalongela, kamba hamulekile vilozo venu, mweye mose modanganhika kamba viwadanganhike wano. <verse eid="LUK 13:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="LUK 13:4"/>Ama mowagesaze waja wanhu longo dimwe na wanane walagalilwe na ulingo kuja Siloamu? Mokwagiza kamba wakala walozile ng'hani kubanza wanhu wose wokala Yelusalemu? <verse eid="LUK 13:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="LUK 13:5"/>Si vivo! Na nowalongela, kamba hamulekile vilozo venu, mweye mose modanganhika kamba viwadanganhike wano.”<verse eid="LUK 13:5"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Hala da Mtini Haulelaga</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="LUK 13:6"/>Abaho, Yesu kawalongela hala dino, “Kukala na munhu imwe yakalile na mtini uhandigwe muna umgunda wake wa mizabibu. Kachola kuzahila mujo muja mumtini ila havikile kinhu. <verse eid="LUK 13:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="LUK 13:7"/>Avo kamulongela imulimi wa umgunda, ‘Lola! Mulao wa ikadatu uno nikwiza kuzahila mujo mumtini uno na sipata kinhu. Uukanhe! Habali uibananga isi bule?’ <verse eid="LUK 13:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="LUK 13:8"/>Ija imulimi kamulongela, ‘Mndewa, uleke tanhu mulao umwe, niutifulile nizunguluka disina, abaho, niwikile mboji. <verse eid="LUK 13:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="LUK 13:9"/>Abaho, mulao uyagwe kamba uhalela, vonoga. Ila kamba haulelile, leka uukanhe.’ ”<verse eid="LUK 13:9"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Yesu Komuhonya Mtwanzi Imwe Mdizua da Mhumulo</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="LUK 13:10"/>Zua dimwe da Mhumulo, Yesu kakala yofundiza mng'anda ya nhambiko. <verse eid="LUK 13:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="LUK 13:11"/>Na haja kukala na mtwanzi yalemazwe na kinyamkela mmilao longo dimwe na minane. Kakala yabongomale na hadahile kugoloka hata kidogo. <verse eid="LUK 13:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="LUK 13:12"/>Yesu viyamonile, kamkema haulongozi, kamulongela, “Mama, utamu wako uhona!” <verse eid="LUK 13:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="LUK 13:13"/>Kamwikila makono gake, na bahaja kagoloka na kusonga kumuyenzi Mulungu.<verse eid="LUK 13:13"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="LUK 13:14"/>Ila mkulu wa ing'anda ya nhambiko kona lusango kwavija Yesu kahonya Mdizua da Mhumulo, avo kenula dizwi yowalongela wanhu, “Hana mazua sita gamulondigwa kusang'hanika, izoni kuhonyigwa mmazua higo, ila sambimwize kuhonyigwa Mdizua da Mhumulo!”<verse eid="LUK 13:14"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="LUK 13:15"/>Mndewa kamwidika yolonga, “Mweye videlenya! Hana munhu yoyose mmwanza wenu yoleka kumfungula ng'ombe wake ama mhunda wake yalawe mdikonhi yamgale kung'wa mazi Mdizua da Mhumulo? <verse eid="LUK 13:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="LUK 13:16"/>Avo mtwanzi ino yali wa lukolo lwa Ablaham, Mwenembago yambongomaze mmilao longo dimwe na minane, sambiyahonyigwe Mdizua da Mhumulo?” <verse eid="LUK 13:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="LUK 13:17"/>Mbuli zake ziwatenda wadumuka zake wone kinyala, ila wanhu wayagwe wadeng'helela mbuli zose za mkanganyo zayatendile.<verse eid="LUK 13:17"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Hala da Mbeyu ya Haladali</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 13:31-32">Mat. 13:31-32</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 4:30-32">Mlk. 4:30-32</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="LUK 13:18"/>Yesu kauza, “Undewa wa Mulungu ulinga na kinhu kilihi? Niulinge na kinhu chaki? <verse eid="LUK 13:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="LUK 13:19"/>Ulinga kamba mbeyu ya haladali, yaaisolile munhu na kuihanda mkihati chake. Ikula na kugaluka kamba m'biki, na ndege wazenga mvulu zao mmatambi gake.”<verse eid="LUK 13:19"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Hala da Mela</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 13:33">Mat. 13:33</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="LUK 13:20"/>Kabili Yesu kauza, “Undewa wa Mulungu niulinge na kinhu chaki? <verse eid="LUK 13:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="LUK 13:21"/>Ulinga na mela diyasolile mtwanzi na kuditibuliza muna ivibaba vidatu va usage mbaka tonge jose dilulumuka.”<verse eid="LUK 13:21"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Lwivi Lusisili</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 7:13-14">Mat. 7:13-14</ref>, <ref loc="MAT 7:21-23">21-23</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="LUK 13:22"/>Yesu kagendelela na mwanza wake yochola Yelusalemu, yobitila mmiwambo na m'viwambo yowafundiza wanhu. <verse eid="LUK 13:22"/><verse number="23" style="v" sid="LUK 13:23"/>Munhu imwe kamuuza, “Mndewa, wanhu wadodo iwo wondawakomboligwe?”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="LUK 13:23">Yesu kawalongela, <verse eid="LUK 13:23"/><verse number="24" style="v" sid="LUK 13:24"/>“Iyoheni kwingila mkubitila mulwivi luli lusisili, kwavija nowalongela, wanhu bwando wogeza kwingila, ila hawadaha. <verse eid="LUK 13:24"/><verse number="25" style="v" sid="LUK 13:25"/>Mwene ng'anda vondayenuke na kuhinda ulwivi, abaho, mweye mokwima hanze na kusonga kubwenga ulwivi na kulonga, ‘Mndewa, tuvugulile ulwivi!’ Na heyo kowalongela, ‘Siwatangile mweye na sikutangile kumulawa!’ <verse eid="LUK 13:25"/><verse number="26" style="v" sid="LUK 13:26"/>Abaho, momulongela, ‘Tuja na kung'wa nagwe, na kutufundiza m'viwambo vetu!’ <verse eid="LUK 13:26"/><verse number="27" style="v" sid="LUK 13:27"/>Ila heyo kowalongela, ‘Siwatangile mweye na sikutangile kumulawa, segeleni hano hamwangu, mweye mose watenda gehile!’ <verse eid="LUK 13:27"/><verse number="28" style="v" sid="LUK 13:28"/>Aho hondahawe na kililo na kugegedula meno vondamuwone Ablaham na Isaka na Yakobo na wahokozi wose wa Kuundewa wa Mulungu, ila mweye mokwasigwa hanze. <verse eid="LUK 13:28"/><verse number="29" style="v" sid="LUK 13:29"/>Wanhu wokwiza kulawa ng'ambu zose za ulumwengu na kukala hasi waje kulusona lwa Kuundewa wa Mulungu. <verse eid="LUK 13:29"/><verse number="30" style="v" sid="LUK 13:30"/>Kweli, wanhu wayagwe wali kuchugu wowa haulongozi, na wanhu wayagwe wali haulongozi wowa kuchugu.”<verse eid="LUK 13:30"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Yesu Koililila Yelusalemu</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 23:37-39">Mat. 23:37-39</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="LUK 13:31"/>Kipigiti kikija Mafalisayo wamcholela Yesu wamulongela, “Segela hano uchole hanhu hayagwe, kwavija Helode Antipa konda kukukoma.”<verse eid="LUK 13:31"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="LUK 13:32"/>Yesu kawalongela, “Gendeni mkamulongele mbweha ija, ‘Lelo na mayo nowinga vinyamkela na kuhonya wanhu, na zua da ikadatu nokwishiliza sang'hano yangu.’ <verse eid="LUK 13:32"/><verse number="33" style="v" sid="LUK 13:33"/>Nolondigwa nigendelele na mwanza wangu, lelo, mayo, na kisindo. Havidahika muhokozi kudanganhikila hanze ya Yelusalemu.<verse eid="LUK 13:33"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="LUK 13:34"/>“Yelusalemu! Yelusalemu! Gweye uwakoma wahokozi na kuwatoa na mibwe waja watumigwe kumwako! Mianza mingahi nilonda kuwakunzanya hamoja wanago kamba nguku viyowafagatila wanage hasi ya mbawa zake, ila hutogole! <verse eid="LUK 13:34"/><verse number="35" style="v" sid="LUK 13:35"/>Avo lola ng'anda yako yolekigwa. Nokulongela, hunyona nie kabili mbaka vondaulonge, ‘Kamota ayo yokwiza mditwaga da Mndewa.’ ”<verse eid="LUK 13:35"/></para>
  <chapter eid="LUK 13"/>
  <chapter number="14" style="c" sid="LUK 14"/>
  <para style="s1">Yesu Komuhonya Mtamu wa Kuvuha Lukuli</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="LUK 14:1"/>Zua dimwe da Mhumulo Yesu kachola kuja mandia kung'anda ya mkulu imwe wa Mafalisayo, wanhu wakala womulola goya. <verse eid="LUK 14:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="LUK 14:2"/>Haulongozi wake kukala na munhu yali na utamu wa kuvuha lukuli. <verse eid="LUK 14:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="LUK 14:3"/>Yesu kawauza wafundiza Malagizo ga Musa na Mafalisayo, yolonga, “Malagizo getu gotutogoza kuhonya Mdizua da Mhumulo, ama gotugomesa?”<verse eid="LUK 14:3"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="LUK 14:4"/>Ila hewo hawalongile kinhu chochose. Yesu kamgoga ija imunhu kamuhonya, abaho, kamuleka yachole na zake. <verse eid="LUK 14:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="LUK 14:5"/>Abaho, kawalongela, “Yalihi mmwanza wenu mwanage ama ng'ombe wake yehengila mdisima, yondayaleke kumulava mbwisa Mdizua da Mhumulo?” <verse eid="LUK 14:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="LUK 14:6"/>Ila hewo wanyamala.<verse eid="LUK 14:6"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Wende na Moyo Kunoga</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="LUK 14:7"/>Yesu kawona avija wahenza wayagwe viwokala wosagula ivigoda va haulongozi, avo kawalongela wanhu wose hala dino, <verse eid="LUK 14:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="LUK 14:8"/>“Munhu yahakugoneka halusona lwa zengele, sambiukale m'vigoda va haulongozi. Ihalawila kagonekigwa munhu yali na twaga kubanza gweye yeheza, <verse eid="LUK 14:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="LUK 14:9"/>na mwenekae wenu, yawagoneke gweye na heyo, kokwiza na kukulongela, ‘Mnegele ino yakale hano.’ Avo vivo vondausegele kuno ukona kinyala uikunyate uchola kukala kuchugu. <verse eid="LUK 14:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="LUK 14:10"/>Ila uhagonekigwa hanhu, genda ukakale kigoda cha kuchugu, avo mwenekae wenu kokwiza hauli na kulonga, ‘Izo kuno kuulongozi, mbwigaangu, ukale hanhu hanogile.’ Dino dokugwaa kituno hameso ga wahenza wose. <verse eid="LUK 14:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="LUK 14:11"/>Kwavija munhu yoyose yokiituniza mwenyego kobwezwa hasi, na ayo yoibweza hasi mwenyego kotunizwa.”<verse eid="LUK 14:11"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="LUK 14:12"/>Abaho, Yesu kamulongela mwenekae wake, “Mana uwagomela wanhu mandia ga imisi ama mandia ga ichungulo, sambiuwagoneke wambwiga zako ama wandugu zako ama wanhu wa lukolo lwako ama wanhu wa habehi yako wali wagoli, kwavija na hewo kwiza wokugoneka, mkutenda vino kolihigwa gaja gautendile. <verse eid="LUK 14:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="LUK 14:13"/>Uhatenda mandia ga lusona, wagoneke wakumbulu, mbetembete, walemale ivipindi, na vimbugumbugu, <verse eid="LUK 14:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="LUK 14:14"/>na gweye komotezwa kwavija hewo hawadaha kukuliha. Ila Mulungu kokuliha kuna idizua da kuzusigwa kwa wanhu walibule uzenzeleganye.”<verse eid="LUK 14:14"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Hala da Lusona Lukulu</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 22:1-10">Mat. 22:1-10</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="LUK 14:15"/>Imwe wa wanhu wakalile na heyo hameza, kagahulika gaja, kamulongela Yesu, “Kamota ng'hani munhu ayo yondayaje kulusona Muundewa wa Mulungu!”<verse eid="LUK 14:15"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="LUK 14:16"/>Yesu kamulongela, “Kukala na munhu imwe yatendile lusona lukulu ng'hani, abaho, kawagoneka wanhu bwando. <verse eid="LUK 14:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="LUK 14:17"/>Kipigiti cha kuja vikivikile, kamulagiza nyakadala wake yakawalongele wahenza zake, ‘Izoni, vinhu vose visasaligwa vimala!’ <verse eid="LUK 14:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="LUK 14:18"/>Ila kila munhu kasonga kulava uyalazi wake, waichanduso kamulongela ija inyakadala, ‘Nigula mgunda avo nolondigwa nikaulole, chonde togola uyalazi wangu.’ <verse eid="LUK 14:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="LUK 14:19"/>Waikabili kalonga, ‘Nigula ng'ombe longo dimwe wa kulimila, avo nochola kuwageza, chonde ndeka nyhole.’ <verse eid="LUK 14:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="LUK 14:20"/>Iyagwe kalonga, ‘Nisola mtwanzi sambi baha, avo sidaha kwiza.’<verse eid="LUK 14:20"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="LUK 14:21"/>“Ija inyakadala kabwela, kamsimulila mbuli zose mkulu wake. Ija imkulu kagevuzika ng'hani avo kamulongela nyakadala wake, ‘Hima, genda mzinzila ng'hulu na ndodo za mkiwambo, ukawagale wakumbulu, mbetembete, vimbugumbugu, na walemale.’ <verse eid="LUK 14:21"/><verse number="22" style="v" sid="LUK 14:22"/>Ija inyakadala kamulongela, ‘Mkulu, gaja gose gaulagize gatendigwa, ila hana nafasi isigala.’ <verse eid="LUK 14:22"/><verse number="23" style="v" sid="LUK 14:23"/>Avo mkulu ija kamulongela nyakadala wake, ‘Genda m'balabala ng'hulu na ndodo za muisi ukawashulutize wanhu wose weze kwingila giladi ng'anda yangu imeme.’ <verse eid="LUK 14:23"/><verse number="24" style="v" sid="LUK 14:24"/>Nowalongela mweye mose kamba, ‘Waja wagonekigwe haichanduso, haduhu hata imwe yondayalanze vakuja vangu!’ ”<verse eid="LUK 14:24"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Golondigwa Giladi Uwe Mwanahina wa Kilisto</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 10:37-38">Mat. 10:37-38</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="LUK 14:25"/>Zua dimwe dale kulu da wanhu dikala diilongoza na Yesu, kahinduka kawalongela, <verse eid="LUK 14:25"/><verse number="26" style="v" sid="LUK 14:26"/>“Munhu yoyose yokwiza kumwangu, na kuno koleka kuninogela nie kubanza tataake na mamaake, na mtwanzi wake, na wanage, na wandugu zake na lumbu zake na hata ugima wake mwenyego, hadaha kuwa mwanahina wangu. <verse eid="LUK 14:26"/><verse number="27" style="v" sid="LUK 14:27"/>Munhu yoyose yoleka kupapa msalaba wake na kung'holeleza hadaha kuwa mwanahina wangu.<verse eid="LUK 14:27"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="LUK 14:28"/>“Vino yalihi mmwanza wenu yahalonda kuzenga ulingo, yondayaleke kukala hasi tanhu, yalole kamba kana hela za kwishilizila sang'hano ija? <verse eid="LUK 14:28"/><verse number="29" style="v" sid="LUK 14:29"/>Kamba hatendile vino, yahamambukiza umsingi na kuhumwa kumambukiza, wanhu wondawone gaja galawilile womseka, <verse eid="LUK 14:29"/><verse number="30" style="v" sid="LUK 14:30"/>wolonga, ‘Munhu ino kasonga kuzenga ila hadahile kwishilizila isang'hano.’<verse eid="LUK 14:30"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="LUK 14:31"/>“Ama mndewa yalihi yochola kugomba na mndewa iyagwe, yoleka tanhu kukala na kugelegeza kamba heyo na asikali zake alufu longo dimwe kodaha kugomba na mndewa ija yokwiza kugomba na heyo yali na asikali alufu malongo mabili? <verse eid="LUK 14:31"/><verse number="32" style="v" sid="LUK 14:32"/>Kamba ihawa hadaha, kowagala wasenga wakaiting'hane na ija imndewa iyagwe, wakamgwile mavindi kulonda tindiwalo kipigiti yang'hali kutali.” <verse eid="LUK 14:32"/><verse number="33" style="v" sid="LUK 14:33"/>Yesu kamambukiza, “Vivija haduhu yoyose mmwanza wenu yodaha kuwa mwanahina wangu kamba halekile vinhu vake vose vayalinavo.<verse eid="LUK 14:33"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Munyu Ubanangike</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 5:13">Mat. 5:13</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 9:50">Mlk. 9:50</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="LUK 14:34"/>“Munyu unoga, ila uhagiza kilandu chake, haduhu nzila iyagwe ya kuutenda unoge kabili. <verse eid="LUK 14:34"/><verse number="35" style="v" sid="LUK 14:35"/>Haunoga kinhu, kwikigwa mmigunda ama kutibulizwa na mhugutu, ila wanhu wowasa kunze. Yali na magwiti na yahulike!”<verse eid="LUK 14:35"/></para>
  <chapter eid="LUK 14"/>
  <chapter number="15" style="c" sid="LUK 15"/>
  <para style="s1">Hala da Ng'hondolo Yapotele</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 18:12-14">Mat. 18:12-14</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="LUK 15:1"/>Zua dimwe wawila kodi bwando na wanhu wayagwe wene vilozo weza kumtegeleza Yesu. <verse eid="LUK 15:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="LUK 15:2"/>Mafalisayo na wafundiza Malagizo ga Musa wasonga kutwanganika, wolonga, “Munhu ino kowabokela wanhu wali na vilozo na hata kuja nao!” <verse eid="LUK 15:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="LUK 15:3"/>Avo Yesu kawalongela hala dino.<verse eid="LUK 15:3"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="LUK 15:4"/>“Tutende munhu imwe mmwanza wenu kana ng'hondolo mia, abaho, ng'hondolo imwe kapotela, kotendaze? Kowaleka waja iwang'hondolo malongo tisa na tisa muluwala na kuchola kumzahila ija yapotele mbaka yamone. <verse eid="LUK 15:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="LUK 15:5"/>Yahamona, kodeng'helela ng'hani avo kompapa mmaega <verse eid="LUK 15:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="LUK 15:6"/>na kum'bweza ukae. Abaho, kowakema hamoja wambwiga zake na wanhu wa mzing'anda za habehi na kuwalongela, ‘Nodeng'ha ng'hani kwavija nimona ng'hondolo wangu yapotele, avo izoni tudeng'he chose!’ <verse eid="LUK 15:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="LUK 15:7"/>Avo nowalongela, kowa na ndeng'helelo ng'hulu kuulanga avija munhu imwe yali na vilozo yahaleka vilozo vake, kubanza wanhu malongo tisa na tisa walibule vilozo na hawalonda kuleka vilozo vao.<verse eid="LUK 15:7"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Hala da Hela Yagile</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="LUK 15:8"/>“Ama tulonge mtwanzi imwe kana hela<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">15:8 </char><char style="fk" closed="false">Hela imwe </char><char style="ft" closed="false">ikala iliha sang'hano ya zua dimwe.</char></note> longo dimwe, abaho, kasa hela imwe, kotendaze? Kobwinha kiwenge na kufagila ng'anda yake na kulolesa kila hanhu mbaka yayone. <verse eid="LUK 15:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="LUK 15:9"/>Yahayona, kowakema hamoja wambwiga zake na wanhu wa mzing'anda za habehi na kuwalongela, ‘Nodeng'helela ng'hani kwavija niyona ihela inyasile. Izoni tudeng'he tose!’ <verse eid="LUK 15:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="LUK 15:10"/>Avo nowalongela, vivija wasenga wa Mulungu wa kuulanga wodeng'ha avija munhu imwe yali na vilozo yahaleka vilozo vake.”<verse eid="LUK 15:10"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Hala da Mwana Yapotele</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="LUK 15:11"/>Yesu kagendelela kulonga, “Kukala na munhu imwe yakalile na wana wabili wambigalo. <verse eid="LUK 15:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="LUK 15:12"/>Imdodo kamulongela tataake, ‘Tata, ngwelela uhazi wangu sambisambi.’ Avo ija imunhu kawagolela mali gake wanage wose wabili. <verse eid="LUK 15:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="LUK 15:13"/>Mkipigiti kiguhi ija imwanage imdodo kaguza vinhu vake vose, kasegela hakae na izihela. Kachola isi ya kutali, ako kwayasile hela zake mmbuli za mzanyamzanya. <verse eid="LUK 15:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="LUK 15:14"/>Viyamambukize vinhu vose, ingila nzala mpamanho muisi ija yose, avo kasonga kuzahila vinhu vakuja. <verse eid="LUK 15:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="LUK 15:15"/>Avo kachola kusang'hanika ha munhu imwe mwenekae wa isi ija, na heyo kamgala kumgunda wake yakemilize mitumbi. <verse eid="LUK 15:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="LUK 15:16"/>Kasulukila kuigutiza na mikamhi iidile imitumbi, na haduhu munhu yamgwelele kinhu chochose. <verse eid="LUK 15:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="LUK 15:17"/>Ngelegeza zinogile vuzimwizile, kalonga mmoyo wake, ‘Wasang'hana wangahi wa tataangu woja na kusigaza, ila nie hano nofa nzala! <verse eid="LUK 15:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="LUK 15:18"/>Nosegela nibweleganye ha tataangu nikamulongele, “Tata, niloza ha Mulungu na hamwako gweye. <verse eid="LUK 15:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="LUK 15:19"/>Silumbile kukemigwa mwanago, nitende kamba vija imwe wa wasang'hana zako.” ’ <verse eid="LUK 15:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="LUK 15:20"/>Avo kenuka na kusonga kubwela ha tataake.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="LUK 15:20">“Viyakalile yang'hali kutali, tataake kamona, kamonela bazi, avo kamkimbilila, abaho, kamkumbatila na kumnonela. <verse eid="LUK 15:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="LUK 15:21"/>Ija imwana kalonga, ‘Tata, niloza ha Mulungu na hamwako gweye. Silumbile kukemigwa mwanago.’ <verse eid="LUK 15:21"/><verse number="22" style="v" sid="LUK 15:22"/>Ila tataake kawakema nyakadala zake, kalonga, ‘Hima mgalileni ng'hanzu inogile mum'vaze. M'vazeni kitindi mkidole chake na vilatu mmagulu gake. <verse eid="LUK 15:22"/><verse number="23" style="v" sid="LUK 15:23"/>Abaho, gendeni mkamsole mwanang'ombe yanonile mumchinje, na tutende lusona, tudeng'he! <verse eid="LUK 15:23"/><verse number="24" style="v" sid="LUK 15:24"/>Kwavija mwanangu ino kakala kamba yadanganhike, ila sambi mgima, kakala yapotele, ila sambi koneka!’ Avo lusona lusonga.<verse eid="LUK 15:24"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="LUK 15:25"/>“Kipigiti kikija mwanage imkulu kakala yobwela kulawa kumgunda, mnzila viyakalile behi na ing'anda, kahulika ngoma na sing'hino za mvina. <verse eid="LUK 15:25"/><verse number="26" style="v" sid="LUK 15:26"/>Avo kamkema imwe wa nyakadala, kamuuza, ‘Kuna choni?’ <verse eid="LUK 15:26"/><verse number="27" style="v" sid="LUK 15:27"/>Ija inyakadala kamulongela, ‘Mdodo wako kabwela, na tataako kachinja mwanang'ombe yanonile kwavija kabwela yali mpile.’<verse eid="LUK 15:27"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="LUK 15:28"/>“Ija imwana imkulu kagevuzika ng'hani mbaka kalema kwingila mng'anda. Avo tataake kalawa hanze kamuyalalila yomulonda yengile mng'anda. <verse eid="LUK 15:28"/><verse number="29" style="v" sid="LUK 15:29"/>Ila heyo kamulongela tataake, ‘Lola! Milao ino yose nikusang'hanikila sang'hano zako kamba nyakadala, na siduluke ndagizi zako zozose. Kungwelela choni? Hungwelele hata menhe mdodo nhende lusona na wambwiga zangu! <verse eid="LUK 15:29"/><verse number="30" style="v" sid="LUK 15:30"/>Ila mwanago ino kasa mali gako gose mkutenda ugoni ndwanga, abaho, kabwela ukae, komchinjila mwanang'ombe yanonile!’ <verse eid="LUK 15:30"/><verse number="31" style="v" sid="LUK 15:31"/>Tataake kamulongela, ‘Mwanangu, gweye kokala hano na nie mazua gose, na vinhu vose vinilinavo nie vako gweye. <verse eid="LUK 15:31"/><verse number="32" style="v" sid="LUK 15:32"/>Avo vinoga tweye tuvine na kudeng'ha kwavija mdodo wako kakala kamba yadanganhike, ila sambi mgima. Kakala yapotele, ila sambi koneka!’ ”<verse eid="LUK 15:32"/></para>
  <chapter eid="LUK 15"/>
  <chapter number="16" style="c" sid="LUK 16"/>
  <para style="s1">Hala da Mwimilizi M'bala</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="LUK 16:1"/>Yesu kawalongela wanahina zake, “Kukala na munhu imwe mgoli yakalile na mwimilizi wa vinhu vake. Ija imgoli kalongeligwa kamba ija imwimilizi kakala yomung'hunya hela zake, <verse eid="LUK 16:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="LUK 16:2"/>avo kamkema, kamuuza, ‘Mbuli zaki zino zinihulika zikulonga gweye? Ngwelela mheta ya mali gangu gose gaukalile wimiliza, kwavija hudaha tena gweye kuwa mwimilizi wangu.’ <verse eid="LUK 16:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="LUK 16:3"/>Ija imwimilizi kalonga munda kwa munda, ‘Mkulu wangu kolonda kunisegeza msang'hano yangu. Nhendeze? Kulima sidaha, na kupula nokona kinyala. <verse eid="LUK 16:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="LUK 16:4"/>Nikitanga chondanhende! Nihawingigwa kulawa msang'hano yangu, nopata wambwiga wondawanibokele mkae zao.’<verse eid="LUK 16:4"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="LUK 16:5"/>“Avo kawakema wanhu wose wakalile wowilwa na ija imgoli wake, kamuuza waichanduso, ‘Kowilwa aki na mkulu wangu?’ <verse eid="LUK 16:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="LUK 16:6"/>Na heyo kalonga, ‘Madebe mia mbili ga mavuta ga mizaituni.’ Ija imwimilizi kamulongela, ‘Sola cheti chako, ukale hasi hima wandike madebe mia.’ <verse eid="LUK 16:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="LUK 16:7"/>Abaho, kamuuza iyagwe, ‘Na gweye kowilwa aki?’ Kalonga, ‘Vipeto mia sita va ngano.’ Ija imwimilizi kamulongela, ‘Sola cheti chako, wandike vipeto mia nne na malongo manane.’<verse eid="LUK 16:7"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="LUK 16:8"/>“Avo mkulu wa mwimilizi ija kizenzeleganye kamtogola avija viyatendile ubala kamba uja, kwavija wanhu wa ulumwengu uno wabala ng'hani mkuzigongomanya mbuli zao na wayao kubanza wanhu wali mmulangaza.”<verse eid="LUK 16:8"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="LUK 16:9"/>Yesu kagendelela kulonga, “Nowalongela, izahilileni wambwiga mkubitila mali ga muulumwengu, avo kamba gehesha, mobokelwa muna uukazi wa milongo yose. <verse eid="LUK 16:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="LUK 16:10"/>Munhu yoyose yalibule uzenzeleganye m'vinhu vidodo, vivija kowa bule uzenzeleganye m'vinhu bwando. Na munhu yoyose yali na uzenzeleganye m'vinhu vidodo, vivija kowa na uzenzeleganye m'vinhu bwando. <verse eid="LUK 16:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="LUK 16:11"/>Avo kamba muhawa vizenzeleganye mkwimiliza mali ga muulumwengu, yalihi yondayawatogole kwimiliza mali ga kweli? <verse eid="LUK 16:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="LUK 16:12"/>Na kamba muhawa vizenzeleganye m'vinhu va munhu iyagwe, yalihi yondayaweng'he vinhu venu wenyego?<verse eid="LUK 16:12"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="LUK 16:13"/>“Haduhu mtumigwa yodaha kuwasang'hanikila wakulu wabili, kwavija komwihila ino na kumnogela iyagwe, ama koigoga na imwe na kum'buhiza iyagwe. Hamdaha kumsang'hanikila Mulungu hamoja na hela.”<verse eid="LUK 16:13"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Mbuli Ziyagwe za Yesu</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 11:12-13">Mat. 11:12-13</ref>; <ref loc="MAT 5:31-32">5:31-32</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 10:11-12">Mlk. 10:11-12</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="LUK 16:14"/>Mafalisayo viwahulike gano, wam'beza Yesu kwavija wanogelwa na hela. <verse eid="LUK 16:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="LUK 16:15"/>Yesu kawalongela, “Mweye iwo wanhu mkiitenda muna mioyo inogile mmeso ga wanhu, ila Mulungu koitanga mioyo yenu, kwavija vinhu vigesigwa na wanhu kamba vinoga ng'hani vabule unozi hameso ga Mulungu.<verse eid="LUK 16:15"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="LUK 16:16"/>“Malagizo ga Musa na Nyandiko Zing'alile za wahokozi zikala zipetigwa mbaka kipigiti cha Yohana M'batiza, songela aho Usenga Unogile wa Undewa wa Mulungu wopetigwa, na kila munhu kokwingila na mhiko. <verse eid="LUK 16:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="LUK 16:17"/>Ila vibuha ulanga na isi kuyangayuka kubanza kidanga kidodo cha Malagizo ga Musa kusegezwa.<verse eid="LUK 16:17"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="LUK 16:18"/>“Mbigalo yoyose yahamwasa mtwanzi wake na kusola mtwanzi iyagwe, kotenda ugoni, na munhu yahamsola mtwanzi yasigwe, kotenda ugoni.<verse eid="LUK 16:18"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Mgoli na Lazalo</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="LUK 16:19"/>“Kukala na munhu imwe mgoli yakalile yovala vivalo va zambalau vene hela bwando na kakala yoja goya mazua gose. <verse eid="LUK 16:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="LUK 16:20"/>Vivija kukala na munhu imwe mkumbulu yokemigwa Lazalo, yakalile na vilonda lukuli lugima, yakalile yogaligwa halwivi lwa ija imgoli, <verse eid="LUK 16:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="LUK 16:21"/>yosulukila kuja vakuja vilagale kulawa hameza ya ija imgoli. Hata mibwa iza kumulambita vilonda vake.<verse eid="LUK 16:21"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="LUK 16:22"/>“Hakimambukizo, ija imkumbulu kadanganhika, kapapigwa na wasenga wa Mulungu wa kuulanga kekigwa behibehi na Ablaham. Vivija ija imgoli na heyo kadanganhika na kazikigwa. <verse eid="LUK 16:22"/><verse number="23" style="v" sid="LUK 16:23"/>Avo akuja kuzimu ija imgoli kakala mumgayo mkulu ng'hani, kenula meso gake hatalitali kamona Ablaham na Lazalo hamgwazo wake. <verse eid="LUK 16:23"/><verse number="24" style="v" sid="LUK 16:24"/>Avo kenula dizwi yolonga, ‘Tata Ablaham! Nyonela bazi, mulongele Lazalo yazabike kidole chake mmazi yaluhoze lulimi lwangu, kwavija nie na mumgayo mkulu mmoto uno!’<verse eid="LUK 16:24"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="LUK 16:25"/>“Ila Ablaham kamulongela, ‘Kumbukila tanhu, mwanangu, vuukalile muulumwengu kugweleligwa vinhu vose vinogile, ila Lazalo kagweleligwa vinhu vose vihile. Ila sambi kohozigwa moyo na gweye kogaya. <verse eid="LUK 16:25"/><verse number="26" style="v" sid="LUK 16:26"/>Uhaleka gose gano, hana kolongo kulu dikigwe hagatigati yetu mweye na tweye, giladi waja wolonda kuloka kulawa hano kwiza hamwenu sambiwadahe, na munhu yoyose yolonda kuloka kulawa hiko kwiza kuno sambiyadahe.’ <verse eid="LUK 16:26"/><verse number="27" style="v" sid="LUK 16:27"/>Ija imgoli kalonga, ‘Basi, tata Ablaham, nokuyalalila, mulagize Lazalo yachole kung'anda ya tataangu, <verse eid="LUK 16:27"/><verse number="28" style="v" sid="LUK 16:28"/>hiko kuna ndugu zangu watano, yakawazume, giladi sambiweze kuno kuli na mgayo!’<verse eid="LUK 16:28"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="LUK 16:29"/>“Ila Ablaham kamulongela, ‘Wandugu zako wana Malagizo ga Musa na Nyandiko Zing'alile za wahokozi, waleke wazitegeleze hizo vuzilonga.’ <verse eid="LUK 16:29"/><verse number="30" style="v" sid="LUK 16:30"/>Ija imgoli kalonga, ‘Hivo havitosha, tata Ablaham! Ila munhu yahazuka na kuwacholela, woleka vilozo vao.’ <verse eid="LUK 16:30"/><verse number="31" style="v" sid="LUK 16:31"/>Ila Ablaham kalonga, ‘Kamba hawazitegeleze Nyandiko za Musa na wahokozi, hawatogola hata kamba munhu yahazuka.’ ”<verse eid="LUK 16:31"/></para>
  <chapter eid="LUK 16"/>
  <chapter number="17" style="c" sid="LUK 17"/>
  <para style="s1">Kugela Kumgongo Vilozo</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 18:6-7">Mat. 18:6-7</ref>, <ref loc="MAT 18:21-22">21-22</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 9:42">Mlk. 9:42</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="LUK 17:1"/>Yesu kawalongela wanahina zake, “Mbuli ziwatendaga wanhu watende vilozo hazilekaga kulawilila, ila kojona ng'hani munhu ija yondayazitende zilawile! <verse eid="LUK 17:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="LUK 17:2"/>Vihamnogele munhu ija yafungigwe msingo dibwe kulu da kusiginhila, abaho, yakasigwe m'bahali kubanza kumtenda imwe wa wanhu wano wadodo kuloza. <verse eid="LUK 17:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="LUK 17:3"/>Avo teganyeni!</para>
  <para style="p" vid="LUK 17:3">“Kamba ndugu yako yahaloza, mkomhokele, yahaleka kuloza, mgele kumgongo. <verse eid="LUK 17:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="LUK 17:4"/>Kamba yahakutendela vilozo mianza saba mdizua dimwe, na mianza yose saba keza kumwako yolonga, ‘Nileka,’ mgele kumgongo.”<verse eid="LUK 17:4"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Nhamanila</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="LUK 17:5"/>Watumigwa wa Kilisto wamulongela Mndewa Yesu, “Tongezele nhamanila yetu.”<verse eid="LUK 17:5"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="LUK 17:6"/>Mndewa kawalongela, “Kamba muhawile na nhamanila ndodo kamba mbeyu ya haladali, muhadahile kuulongela mkuyu uno, ‘Ng'ozoka ukaihande m'bahali!’ Na uhawahulike.<verse eid="LUK 17:6"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Sang'hano za Nyakadala</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="LUK 17:7"/>“Tulonge munhu imwe mmwanza wenu kana nyakadala wa kumulimila ama kumchungila ng'hondolo. Yahabwela kulawa kumgunda, komulongela nyakadala wake yatende hima yeze kuja mandia? <verse eid="LUK 17:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="LUK 17:8"/>Nokona si vivo! Ila komulongela, ‘Nhelekela mandia gangu hima, uisasale unisang'hanikile mbaka niheshiliza kuja na kung'wa, kileka na gweye uje mandia gako.’ <verse eid="LUK 17:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="LUK 17:9"/>Avo, komuheweza nyakadala ija avija viyagatendile gaja gayalagizwe? <verse eid="LUK 17:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="LUK 17:10"/>Vivija na mweye! Muhatenda kila kinhu kimulongeligwe mkitende, longeni, ‘Tweye twa nyakadala tulibule maliho, tutenda gaja gatulondigwe kutenda tu.’ ”<verse eid="LUK 17:10"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Yesu Kowahonya Wanhu Longo Dimwe</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="LUK 17:11"/>Yesu viyakalile yochola Yelusalemu, kabitila muimbaka ya isi za Samalia na Galilaya. <verse eid="LUK 17:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="LUK 17:12"/>Viyakalile yokwingila muna ikiwambo kimwe, wanhu longo dimwe wolumwa dikulu wamwizila, wema kutalitali, <verse eid="LUK 17:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="LUK 17:13"/>wenula dizwi wolonga, “Mndewa, Yesu, utonele bazi!”<verse eid="LUK 17:13"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="LUK 17:14"/>Yesu viyawawene kawalongela, “Gendeni ha iwakulu wa nhambiko wakawalole goya.”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="LUK 17:14">Viwakalile wochola mnzila wahona. <verse eid="LUK 17:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="LUK 17:15"/>Munhu imwe mmwanza wao viyonile kahona, kabwela, kenula dizwi yomuyenzi Mulungu. <verse eid="LUK 17:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="LUK 17:16"/>Kamfugamila mavindi Yesu na kumgwaa hewela. Na munhu ija kakala Msamalia. <verse eid="LUK 17:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="LUK 17:17"/>Ila Yesu kauza, “Hawakalile wanhu longo dimwe wahonyigwe? Wakwahi wayagwe tisa? <verse eid="LUK 17:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="LUK 17:18"/>Haduhu hata munhu imwe yabwelile kumuheweza Mulungu ila muhenza ino yeiyeka?” <verse eid="LUK 17:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="LUK 17:19"/>Yesu kamulongela, “Ima wima uchole, nhamanila yako ikuhonya.”<verse eid="LUK 17:19"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Kwiza kwa Undewa wa Mulungu</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 24:23-28">Mat. 24:23-28</ref>, <ref loc="MAT 24:37-41">37-41</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="LUK 17:20"/>Mafalisayo wayagwe wamuuza Yesu, wolonga, “Zua dilihi Undewa wa Mulungu vondawize?”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="LUK 17:20">Heyo kawalongela, “Undewa wa Mulungu hawiza mkoneka na meso. <verse eid="LUK 17:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="LUK 17:21"/>Haduhu munhu yondayalonge, ‘Loleni wa hano!’ Ama ‘Wa haja!’ Kwavija Undewa wa Mulungu wa mmwenu.”<verse eid="LUK 17:21"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="LUK 17:22"/>Abaho, kawalongela wanahina zake, “Kipigiti chokwiza vondamusulukile kona zua dondanibwele, nie, Mwana wa Munhu, ila hamujona. <verse eid="LUK 17:22"/><verse number="23" style="v" sid="LUK 17:23"/>Na wanhu wowalongela, ‘Loleni kahaja!’ ama, ‘Loleni kahano!’ Ila sambimuwakweleleze. <verse eid="LUK 17:23"/><verse number="24" style="v" sid="LUK 17:24"/>Kamba vija lumwemwe vulumweka kulawa kuulanga na kumwemwesa kulawa ng'ambu ino mbaka ng'ambu ija, avo vivo vondaiwe mdizua dondanize, nie, Mwana wa Munhu. <verse eid="LUK 17:24"/><verse number="25" style="v" sid="LUK 17:25"/>Ila tanhu nolondigwa nigaye ng'hani na kulemigwa na wanhu wa mulelo uno. <verse eid="LUK 17:25"/><verse number="26" style="v" sid="LUK 17:26"/>Kamba viikalile mkipigiti cha Nuhu vivo vondaiwe mdizua dondanibwele, nie, Mwana wa Munhu.<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">17:26 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Nyandiko ziyagwe za umwaka zabule mnhongo wa 26.</char></note> <verse eid="LUK 17:26"/><verse number="27" style="v" sid="LUK 17:27"/>Wanhu wose wakala woja na kung'wa, wosola na kusoligwa, mbaka zua dija Nuhu viyengile muisafina,<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">17:27 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Uhalonda kuitanga nhegulo ya </char><char style="fk" closed="false">Safina</char><char style="ft" closed="false">, soma kitabu cha </char><char style="xt"><ref loc="GEN 6-7">MWANDUSO 6—7</ref></char>.</note> na mvula ng'hulu ng'hani itoa na kumemeza mazi na kuwakoma wanhu wose. <verse eid="LUK 17:27"/><verse number="28" style="v" sid="LUK 17:28"/>Yowa kamba viikalile kipigiti cha Loti. Wanhu wose wakala woja na kung'wa, wogula na kuguza, wohanda na kuzenga, <verse eid="LUK 17:28"/><verse number="29" style="v" sid="LUK 17:29"/>mbaka zua dija Loti viyasegele wambo da Sodoma, moto na baluti vihumuluka hasi kulawa kuulanga na kuwakoma wanhu wose. <verse eid="LUK 17:29"/><verse number="30" style="v" sid="LUK 17:30"/>Vino vivo vondaiwe mdizua dondanigubuligwe, nie, Mwana wa Munhu.<verse eid="LUK 17:30"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="LUK 17:31"/>“Mdizua dija munhu yali kukiswili cha ng'anda yake sambiyahumuluke hasi yengile mng'anda yakasole vinhu vake, na munhu yali kumgunda sambiyabwele ukae. <verse eid="LUK 17:31"/><verse number="32" style="v" sid="LUK 17:32"/>Kumbukileni gam'vikile mtwanzi wa Loti! <verse eid="LUK 17:32"/><verse number="33" style="v" sid="LUK 17:33"/>Munhu yoyose yogeza kuukombola ugima wake, kowagiza, na munhu yoyose yowagiza ugima wake, koukombola. <verse eid="LUK 17:33"/><verse number="34" style="v" sid="LUK 17:34"/>Nowalongela, ikilo ija wanhu wabili wowasa mulusazi lumwe, imwe kosoligwa na imwe kolekigwa. <verse eid="LUK 17:34"/><verse number="35" style="v" sid="LUK 17:35"/>Watwanzi wabili wokomola ngano hamoja, imwe kosoligwa na imwe kolekigwa. <verse eid="LUK 17:35"/><verse number="36" style="v" sid="LUK 17:36"/>Wanhu wabili wolima mumgunda, imwe kosoligwa na imwe kolekigwa.”<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">17:36 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Nyandiko ziyagwe za umwaka zabule mnhongo wa 36.</char></note><verse eid="LUK 17:36"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" sid="LUK 17:37"/>Wanahina zake wamuuza, “Mndewa, kwahi?”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="LUK 17:37">Yesu kawalongela, “Hohose hauli mtufi, baho hondawaiting'hanile vimhungu.”<verse eid="LUK 17:37"/></para>
  <chapter eid="LUK 17"/>
  <chapter number="18" style="c" sid="LUK 18"/>
  <para style="s1">Hala da Kizuka na Mulamula</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="LUK 18:1"/>Abaho, Yesu kawalongela hala wanahina zake yowafundiza kamba wolondigwa kutambika bila kudonha. <verse eid="LUK 18:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="LUK 18:2"/>Kalonga, “Kukala na mulamula mkiwambo kimwe, yakalile hamdumba Mulungu, na vivija hawagesa wanhu. <verse eid="LUK 18:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="LUK 18:3"/>Mkiwambo kija kukala na kizuka yakalile yomwizila mulamula ija mianza bwando, yolonga, ‘Nhaza mhate kwing'higwa gaja golondigwa mhate kulawa ha ija yolonda kunizulunza!’ <verse eid="LUK 18:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="LUK 18:4"/>Mazua bwando ija imulamula kalema, ila hakimambukizo kalonga munda kwa munda, ‘Nie simdumba Mulungu vivija siwagesa wanhu, <verse eid="LUK 18:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="LUK 18:5"/>ila kwavija kizuka ino kongaza ng'hani, noilola nhaguso yake yeng'higwe choyolonda. Kamba sitendile vino, kogendelela kwiza, hakimambukizo kondonheza ng'hani!’ ”<verse eid="LUK 18:5"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="LUK 18:6"/>Abaho Mndewa kagendelela kulonga, “Tegelezeni viyolonga ija imulamula yalibule unhu. <verse eid="LUK 18:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="LUK 18:7"/>Avo mokwagiza Mulungu hondayawedike hima wanhu zake mwenyego womulilila misi na kilo? Mokwagiza kotenda mholemhole kuwataza? <verse eid="LUK 18:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="LUK 18:8"/>Nowalongela, kowataza hima. Ila vondanize nie, Mwana wa Munhu, noivika nhamanila muisi?”<verse eid="LUK 18:8"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Hala da Mfalisayo na Muwila Kodi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="LUK 18:9"/>Vivija Yesu kawalongela hala dino wanhu wokiiyona kamba hewo iwo iwende na kuwabeza wayagwe. <verse eid="LUK 18:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="LUK 18:10"/>“Wanhu wabili wakwela wachola Kung'anda ya Mulungu kutambika, imwe kakala Mfalisayo na imwe muwila kodi.<verse eid="LUK 18:10"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="LUK 18:11"/>“Ija Mfalisayo kaibagula kema yeiyeka katambika yolonga, ‘Nokuheweza, Mulungu, kwavija nie sili kamba wanhu wayagwe, mibokonyi ama vizenzeleganye ama wagoni ama kamba ino muwila kodi. <verse eid="LUK 18:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="LUK 18:12"/>Nofunga mianza mibili mmazua saba, nolava zaka m'vinhu vangu vose vinipata.’<verse eid="LUK 18:12"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="LUK 18:13"/>“Ila ija imuwila kodi kema kutali na hadahile hata kwinula kihanga chake kuulanga, kaitoatoa mmhambaga kulagusa giogio na kulonga, ‘Go Mulungu, nyonela bazi, nie nili na vilozo.’ ” <verse eid="LUK 18:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="LUK 18:14"/>Yesu kawalongela, “Ija imuwila kodi kabwela ukae yopetigwa kutenda gamnogele Mulungu kubanza ija Imfalisayo. Kwavija munhu yoyose yokiinula mwenyego kohumuluswa, na ija yoihumulusa mwenyego kokwinuligwa.”<verse eid="LUK 18:14"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Yesu Kowamoteza Wana Wadodo</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 19:13-15">Mat. 19:13-15</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 10:13-16">Mlk. 10:13-16</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="LUK 18:15"/>Wanhu wamgalila Yesu wana zao wadodo yawekile makono yawamoteze. Wanahina zake viwawawene wotenda vija, wawakomhokela. <verse eid="LUK 18:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="LUK 18:16"/>Ila Yesu kawakema iwana kumwake kalonga, “Walekeni wana wadodo weze kumwangu, sambimuwagomese. Kwavija Undewa wa Mulungu una wanhu wali kamba wano. <verse eid="LUK 18:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="LUK 18:17"/>Nowalongeleni ikweli! Munhu yoyose yahaleka kuubokela Undewa wa Mulungu kamba viyali mwana mdodo havidahika kuwingila.”<verse eid="LUK 18:17"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Mgoli</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 19:16-30">Mat. 19:16-30</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 10:17-31">Mlk. 10:17-31</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="LUK 18:18"/>Mkulu imwe wa Wayahudi kamuuza Yesu, “Mkulufunzi Unogile, nhende choni kileka mana niuhale ugima wa digunge?”<verse eid="LUK 18:18"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="LUK 18:19"/>Yesu kamuuza, “Habali ung'hema nie ninogile? Haduhu munhu yanogile ila Mulungu yeiyeka. <verse eid="LUK 18:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="LUK 18:20"/>Kuzitanga ndagizi? ‘Sambiutende ugoni, sambiukome, sambiwibe, sambiulave usindila wa uvwizi, wahishimile tataako na mamaako.’ ”<verse eid="LUK 18:20"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="LUK 18:21"/>Ija imunhu kalonga, “Gano gose nigatenda songela ning'hali mdodo.”<verse eid="LUK 18:21"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="LUK 18:22"/>Yesu viyahulike gano kamulongela, “Kusigaza kinhu kimwe chuulondigwa kutenda. Guza vinhu vose vuulinavo na zihela uwagwelele wakumbulu, avo kowa na ngama kuulanga, abaho, wize ung'holeleze.” <verse eid="LUK 18:22"/><verse number="23" style="v" sid="LUK 18:23"/>Ila munhu ija viyahulike gaja, kanyunguala ng'hani kwavija kakala na mali bwando.<verse eid="LUK 18:23"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="LUK 18:24"/>Yesu kamulola, abaho kalonga, “Vino vivo vondaviwe vidala wagoli kwingila Muundewa wa Mulungu! <verse eid="LUK 18:24"/><verse number="25" style="v" sid="LUK 18:25"/>Vibuha ngamia kubita mkizonzo cha shindano kubanza mgoli kwingila Muundewa wa Mulungu.”<verse eid="LUK 18:25"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="LUK 18:26"/>Wanhu wagahulike gano wamuuza, “Avo yalihi basi yondayadahe kukomboligwa?”<verse eid="LUK 18:26"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="LUK 18:27"/>Yesu kawalongela, “Gaja hagadahika mwa wanhu ha Mulungu godahika.”<verse eid="LUK 18:27"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="LUK 18:28"/>Abaho, Petulo kamulongela, “Lola! Tweye tuleka vinhu vetu vose, tukukweleleza gweye.”<verse eid="LUK 18:28"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="LUK 18:29"/>Yesu kawalongela, “Nowalongela ikweli, munhu yoyose yalekile kae ama mtwanzi wake ama wandugu ama watata na wamama ama wana sama ya Undewa wa Mulungu, <verse eid="LUK 18:29"/><verse number="30" style="v" sid="LUK 18:30"/>kobokela vinhu bwando ng'hani mkipigiti kino, na kubokela ugima wa digunge mkipigiti kikwiza.”<verse eid="LUK 18:30"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Yesu Koilonga Ifa Yake Mwanza wa Ikadatu</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 20:17-19">Mat. 20:17-19</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 10:32-34">Mlk. 10:32-34</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="LUK 18:31"/>Yesu kawagala wanahina zake longo dimwe na wabili hamgwazo, kawalongela, “Tegelezeni! Tokwela Yelusalemu, aho kila kinhu chawandike wahokozi kinilonga nie, Mwana wa Munhu, chovikila. <verse eid="LUK 18:31"/><verse number="32" style="v" sid="LUK 18:32"/>Nogeligwa mmakono ga Wamhazi awo wondawanitendele uponela, woniliga na kunitemela mate. <verse eid="LUK 18:32"/><verse number="33" style="v" sid="LUK 18:33"/>Wonilanha, abaho, wonikoma, ila mdizua da ikadatu nozuka.”<verse eid="LUK 18:33"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="LUK 18:34"/>Ila wanahina zake hawazimanyile mbuli zija. Nhegulo ya mbuli zija ikala ifisigwa kumwao, na hawagamanyile gaja gayawalongele.<verse eid="LUK 18:34"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Yesu Komuhonya Kimbugumbugu Yapulaga</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 20:29-34">Mat. 20:29-34</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 10:46-52">Mlk. 10:46-52</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="LUK 18:35"/>Yesu viyakalile behi na wambo da Yeliko, kukala na kimbugumbugu imwe yakalile mumgwazo wa inzila yopula. <verse eid="LUK 18:35"/><verse number="36" style="v" sid="LUK 18:36"/>Viyahulike dale da wanhu dobita, kauza, “Kuna choni?”<verse eid="LUK 18:36"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" sid="LUK 18:37"/>Wamulongela, “Yesu wa Nazaleti kobita.”<verse eid="LUK 18:37"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="38" style="v" sid="LUK 18:38"/>Kenula dizwi yolonga, “Yesu, Mwana wa Daudi, nyonela bazi!”<verse eid="LUK 18:38"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" sid="LUK 18:39"/>Wanhu walongole wamkomhokela wamulongela yanyamale. Ila heyo kagendelela kwinula dizwi kulu ng'hani, yolonga, “Mwana wa Daudi, nyonela bazi!”<verse eid="LUK 18:39"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="40" style="v" sid="LUK 18:40"/>Avo Yesu kema, kawalagiza wamgale hamwake ija imunhu kimbugumbugu. Viyavikile behi, Yesu kamuuza, <verse eid="LUK 18:40"/><verse number="41" style="v" sid="LUK 18:41"/>“Kolonda nikutendele choni?”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="LUK 18:41">Na heyo kamwidika, “Mndewa, nolonda kulola kabili.”<verse eid="LUK 18:41"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="42" style="v" sid="LUK 18:42"/>Yesu kamulongela, “Lola! Nhamanila yako ikuhonya.”<verse eid="LUK 18:42"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="43" style="v" sid="LUK 18:43"/>Bahaja munhu ija kadaha kulola kabili, kamkweleleza Yesu, kuno yomuyenzi Mulungu. Wanhu viwonile gaja, wose wamuheweza Mulungu.<verse eid="LUK 18:43"/></para>
  <chapter eid="LUK 18"/>
  <chapter number="19" style="c" sid="LUK 19"/>
  <para style="s1">Yesu na Zakayo</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="LUK 19:1"/>Yesu kengila mdiwambo da Yeliko kakala yobita mnzila za idiwambo dija. <verse eid="LUK 19:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="LUK 19:2"/>Haja kukala na mkulu imwe wa wawila kodi twaga jake Zakayo, yakalile mgoli ng'hani. <verse eid="LUK 19:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="LUK 19:3"/>Kakala yolonda kumona Yesu iyo munhu wa vilihi, ila kakala mguhi avo hadahile kumona Yesu kwavija wanhu wakala bwando. <verse eid="LUK 19:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="LUK 19:4"/>Avo kakimbilila haulongozi mwa ididale da wanhu na kukwela mumkuyu giladi yamone Yesu, kwavija kakala yobita mnzila ija. <verse eid="LUK 19:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="LUK 19:5"/>Yesu viyavikile haja, kalola uchana kamulongela Zakayo, “Zakayo, humuluka mbwisa, kwavija lelo nolondigwa nikale mng'anda yako.”<verse eid="LUK 19:5"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="LUK 19:6"/>Zakayo kahumuluka himahima, kam'bokela na ndeng'helelo ng'hulu. <verse eid="LUK 19:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="LUK 19:7"/>Wanhu wose wagawene gaja wasonga kutwanganika, walonga, “Munhu ino kachola kukala kung'anda ya munhu mwene vilozo!”<verse eid="LUK 19:7"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="LUK 19:8"/>Zakayo kema wima kamulongela Yesu, “Tegeleza, Mndewa! Nie nolava lwenza lwa vinhu vangu niwagwelele wakumbulu, na kamba nihasola kinhu cha munhu yoyose mkum'bulunya, nom'bwezela mianza mine.”<verse eid="LUK 19:8"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="LUK 19:9"/>Yesu kamulongela, “Lelo ukombola wingila mng'anda ino, kwavija ino vivija munhu wa lukolo lwa Ablaham. <verse eid="LUK 19:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="LUK 19:10"/>Kwavija nie, Mwana wa Munhu, niza kuzahila na kuwakombola waja wapotele.”<verse eid="LUK 19:10"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Hala da Hela Longo Dimwe</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 25:14-30">Mat. 25:14-30</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="LUK 19:11"/>Wanhu wakala womtegeleza Yesu, avo kawalongela hala diyagwe, katenda vino kwavija kakala behi na Yelusalemu, na wanhu wakala wogelegeza kamba Undewa wa Mulungu wa mmabehi kulawilila. <verse eid="LUK 19:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="LUK 19:12"/>Avo kalonga, “Kukala na munhu imwe wa lukolo lwa kindewa kachola isi ya kutali kutendigwa mndewa wa isi yake, ikwisha yabweleganye ukae. <verse eid="LUK 19:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="LUK 19:13"/>Viyakalile behi na kuchola, kawakema nyakadala zake longo dimwe, kamgwelela kila imwe hela imwe.<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">19:13 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Hano </char><char style="fk" closed="false">hela imwe </char><char style="ft" closed="false">ikala iliha kitumetume cha milenge midatu.</char></note> Kawalongela, ‘Tendeni uchuluzi mbaka vondanibwele.’ <verse eid="LUK 19:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="LUK 19:14"/>Ila wanhu wa muisi yake wamwihila, avo wawagala wasenga hachugu chake wakalonge, ‘Hatumulonda munhu ino yawe mndewa wetu.’<verse eid="LUK 19:14"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="LUK 19:15"/>“Ija munhu kagweleligwa undewa na kubwela ukae. Viyavikile, hima kalagiza wakemigwe nyakadala zake wachole kumwake giladi yavimanye hela nyingahi ziwapatile. <verse eid="LUK 19:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="LUK 19:16"/>Nyakadala wa ichanduso keza kalonga, ‘Mndewa, mhata hela ziyagwe longo dimwe kulawa muhela imwe yuungwelele.’ <verse eid="LUK 19:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="LUK 19:17"/>Kalonga, ‘Vinoga, nyakadala mwende! Kwavija hutendile uzenzeleganye mmbuli ndodo, nokwika uwe mkulu m'viwambo longo dimwe.’ <verse eid="LUK 19:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="LUK 19:18"/>Keza nyakadala wa ikabili, kalonga, ‘Mndewa, mhata hela tano kulawa muhela imwe yuungwelele.’ <verse eid="LUK 19:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="LUK 19:19"/>Na heyo kamulongela, ‘Kowa mkulu m'viwambo vitano.’<verse eid="LUK 19:19"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="LUK 19:20"/>“Nyakadala iyagwe keza, kalonga, ‘Mndewa, hela yako ino hano, niifunga mkitambala niifisa. <verse eid="LUK 19:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="LUK 19:21"/>Nikudumba, kwavija gweye kwa munhu mgaga. Kosola vinhu si vako, na kohuna vija huvihandile.’ <verse eid="LUK 19:21"/><verse number="22" style="v" sid="LUK 19:22"/>Ija imndewa kamulongela, ‘Nokutagusa kulawa mmbuli zako mwenyego! Gweye nyakadala mwavu, kuvitanga kamba nie na munhu mgaga, nosola vinhu si vangu, na nohuna vija sivihandile. <verse eid="LUK 19:22"/><verse number="23" style="v" sid="LUK 19:23"/>Habali hwikile hela yangu benki vinibwelile niivike ilelile?’<verse eid="LUK 19:23"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="LUK 19:24"/>“Abaho, kawalongela waja wakalile wemile haja, ‘M'bokeni ihela yaali nayo, mumgwelele nyakadala ija yapatile hela longo dimwe!’ <verse eid="LUK 19:24"/><verse number="25" style="v" sid="LUK 19:25"/>Ila hewo wamulongela, ‘Mndewa, heyo kana hela longo dimwe!’ <verse eid="LUK 19:25"/><verse number="26" style="v" sid="LUK 19:26"/>Ija imndewa kawedika, ‘Nowalongela, munhu yoyose yali na kinhu kokongezelwa, ila ija yalibule kinhu, hata kija ikidodo chayalinacho kobokonywa. <verse eid="LUK 19:26"/><verse number="27" style="v" sid="LUK 19:27"/>Na waja wadumuka zangu wanilemile nie sambiniwe mndewa wao, wagaleni hano muwakome hameso gangu!’ ”<verse eid="LUK 19:27"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Yesu Kokwingila Yelusalemu na Wila</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 21:1-11">Mat. 21:1-11</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 11:1-11">Mlk. 11:1-11</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 12:12-19">Yoh. 12:12-19</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="LUK 19:28"/>Yesu viyeshile kulonga gano, kagendelela na mwanza yowalongola wanhu, yochola Yelusalemu. <verse eid="LUK 19:28"/><verse number="29" style="v" sid="LUK 19:29"/>Viyavikile mkiwambo cha Betifage hana Ikigongo cha Mizaituni behi na kiwambo cha Betania, kawatuma wabili mmwanza wa wanahina zake, <verse eid="LUK 19:29"/><verse number="30" style="v" sid="LUK 19:30"/>kawalongela mbuli zino, “Gendeni hakiwambo kili haulongozi wenu, muhavika, mom'vika mwana mhunda hanapapa munhu yoyose, yafungigwe. Mfunguleni, munigalile. <verse eid="LUK 19:30"/><verse number="31" style="v" sid="LUK 19:31"/>Kamba munhu yahawauza habali mumfungula, mulongeleni, ‘Mndewa komulonda.’ ”<verse eid="LUK 19:31"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="LUK 19:32"/>Wanahina waja wachola, wavika kamba vija Yesu viyawalongele. <verse eid="LUK 19:32"/><verse number="33" style="v" sid="LUK 19:33"/>Viwakalile womfungula imwana mhunda, wenyego wawauza, “Habali mumfungula?”<verse eid="LUK 19:33"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="LUK 19:34"/>Wawalongela, “Mndewa komulonda.” <verse eid="LUK 19:34"/><verse number="35" style="v" sid="LUK 19:35"/>Wamsola imwana mhunda, wamgala ha Yesu. Abaho, watandika vivalo vao mumgongo wa imwana mhunda, abaho, wampapa Yesu wamwika mumgongo wa imwana mhunda. <verse eid="LUK 19:35"/><verse number="36" style="v" sid="LUK 19:36"/>Yesu viyakalile yochola, wanhu wanzanza vivalo vao mnzila. <figure style="fig" alt="Triumphal entry" file="CN01784B.jpg" size="col" loc="Luke 19:36" copy="© 1996 David C. Cook" ref="Luk. 19:37">Yesu kokwingila Yelusalemu na wila.</figure><verse eid="LUK 19:36"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" sid="LUK 19:37"/>Viyakalile behi na kuvika Yelusalemu, ahaja hana inhelemuko Hakigongo cha Mizaituni, dale kulu da wanahina zake disonga kwinula nyangi kuno wotoa ng'henze na kumuheweza Mulungu, sama ya mbuli zose ng'hulu ziwonile. <verse eid="LUK 19:37"/><verse number="38" style="v" sid="LUK 19:38"/>Wolonga, “Kamota Mtawala yokwiza mtwaga da Mndewa! Tindiwalo kuulanga na yenzi ha Mulungu!”<verse eid="LUK 19:38"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" sid="LUK 19:39"/>Mafalisayo wayagwe wakalile mdidale dija wamulongela Yesu, “Mkulufunzi, walongele wanahina zako wanyamale!”<verse eid="LUK 19:39"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="40" style="v" sid="LUK 19:40"/>Yesu kawedika, “Nowalongela! Kamba wano wahanyamala, mabwe gosonga kwinula dizwi.”<verse eid="LUK 19:40"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Yesu Kodililila Wambo da Yelusalemu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="41" style="v" sid="LUK 19:41"/>Viyakwenhuke behi na Yelusalemu na viyadiwene idiwambo, kadililila, <verse eid="LUK 19:41"/><verse number="42" style="v" sid="LUK 19:42"/>yolonga, “Kamba uhakitangile lelo kija kilondigwa kugala tindiwalo! Ila kifisigwa hameso gako! <verse eid="LUK 19:42"/><verse number="43" style="v" sid="LUK 19:43"/>Kwavija kipigiti chokwiza wadumuka zako vondawakuzungulusile lwigo, na kukuzunguluka kukubaniza ng'ambu zose. <verse eid="LUK 19:43"/><verse number="44" style="v" sid="LUK 19:44"/>Wokuhondahonda kabisa na kuwakoma wanhu wali mgati mwa iviwambaza vako, haduhu dibwe dondadilekigwe hachana ya diyagwe, kwavija hukitangile kipigiti Mulungu viyezile kukukombola!”<verse eid="LUK 19:44"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Yesu Kochola Kung'anda ya Mulungu</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 21:12-17">Mat. 21:12-17</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 11:15-19">Mlk. 11:15-19</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 2:13-22">Yoh. 2:13-22</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="45" style="v" sid="LUK 19:45"/>Abaho, Yesu kachola Kung'anda ya Mulungu, kasonga kuwawinga wanhu wakalile woguza vinhu, <verse eid="LUK 19:45"/><verse number="46" style="v" sid="LUK 19:46"/>yowalongela, “Yandikigwa Mzinyandiko Zing'alile kamba, ‘Ng'anda yangu yowa ng'anda ya nhambiko.’ Ila mweye muitenda kifiso cha wabavi!”<verse eid="LUK 19:46"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="47" style="v" sid="LUK 19:47"/>Mazua gose viyakalile Yelusalemu, Yesu kakala yofundiza Kung'anda ya Mulungu. Wakulu wa wakulu wa nhambiko, wafundiza Malagizo ga Musa, na wakulu wa wanhu wakala wozahila nzila ya kumkoma. <verse eid="LUK 19:47"/><verse number="48" style="v" sid="LUK 19:48"/>Ila hawapatile nzila ya kumkomela, kwavija wanhu wose wakala womtegeleza goya mazua gose, hawalondile kuihonya hata mbuli imwe.<verse eid="LUK 19:48"/></para>
  <chapter eid="LUK 19"/>
  <chapter number="20" style="c" sid="LUK 20"/>
  <para style="s1">Mbuza ya Udaho wa Yesu</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 21:23-27">Mat. 21:23-27</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 11:27-33">Mlk. 11:27-33</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="LUK 20:1"/>Zua dimwe Yesu viyakalile Kung'anda ya Mulungu yowafundiza wanhu na kuwapetela Usenga Unogile, wakulu wa wakulu wa nhambiko na wafundiza Malagizo ga Musa hamoja na wavyele wa wanhu weza, <verse eid="LUK 20:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="LUK 20:2"/>wamuuza, “Tulongele, kotenda mbuli zino na udaho ulihi? Yalihi yakugwelele udaho uno?”<verse eid="LUK 20:2"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="LUK 20:3"/>Yesu kawedika, “Beta niuze mbuli. Nilongeleni, <verse eid="LUK 20:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="LUK 20:4"/>vino udaho wa Yohana wa kubatiza ulawa ha Mulungu ama ulawa mwa wanhu?”<verse eid="LUK 20:4"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="LUK 20:5"/>Wasonga kuibamilila wenyego kwa wenyego, “Tulongeze? Kamba tuhalonga ‘Ulawa ha Mulungu,’ kwiza kotulongela, ‘Habali hamumtogole Yohana?’ <verse eid="LUK 20:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="LUK 20:6"/>Na tuhalonga, ‘Ulawa mwa wanhu,’ wanhu wose hano wotukoma mkututoa na mabwe, kwavija wamtogola kamba Yohana kakala muhokozi.” <verse eid="LUK 20:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="LUK 20:7"/>Avo wamulongela, “Hatukutangile kuulawile.”<verse eid="LUK 20:7"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="LUK 20:8"/>Yesu kawalongela, “Na nie siwalongela na udaho ulihi notenda mbuli zino.”<verse eid="LUK 20:8"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Hala da Walimi Mumgunda wa Zabibu</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 21:33-46">Mat. 21:33-46</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 12:1-12">Mlk. 12:1-12</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="LUK 20:9"/>Abaho, Yesu kawalongela wanhu hala dino, “Kukala na munhu imwe yakalile na mgunda wa mizabibu, kawapangiza walimi, abaho, kachola isi ya kutali, kakala kuja kipigiti kitali. <verse eid="LUK 20:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="LUK 20:10"/>Kipigiti cha kuhuna zizabibu vikivikile, kamtuma nyakadala wake ha iwalimi yakamsolele fungu jake da izizabibu. Ila waja iwalimi wamtoa ija inyakadala na kum'bweza bila kinhu. <verse eid="LUK 20:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="LUK 20:11"/>Avo kamgala nyakadala iyagwe, ila waja iwalimi vivija wamtoa, wamtendela mbuli za kumgela kinyala, abaho, wam'bweza bila kinhu. <verse eid="LUK 20:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="LUK 20:12"/>Abaho, kamgala nyakadala wa ikadatu, na heyo vivija waja iwalimi wamgela milonda, abaho, wamwasa hanze ya umgunda. <verse eid="LUK 20:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="LUK 20:13"/>Avo mwene umgunda wa zabibu kalonga, ‘Nhendeze? Nomgala mwanangu mwenyego yaninogele, kwa vovose ino womuhishimila!’ <verse eid="LUK 20:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="LUK 20:14"/>Ila waja iwalimi viwamonile, wailongela, ‘Ino iyo muhazi wake mwene mgunda. Natumkome, na uhazi wake wowa wetu!’ <verse eid="LUK 20:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="LUK 20:15"/>Avo wamwasa hanze ya umgunda, abaho, wamkoma.”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="LUK 20:15">Yesu kawauza, “Ija mwene umgunda wa izizabibu kowatenda choni waja iwalimi? <verse eid="LUK 20:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="LUK 20:16"/>Kokwiza kuwakoma wanhu waja, na umgunda wa izizabibu kowagwaa walimi wayagwe.”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="LUK 20:16">Wanhu viwahulike gano, walonga, “Sambigatulawilile gano!”<verse eid="LUK 20:16"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="LUK 20:17"/>Ila Yesu kawalola, abaho, kawauza. “Nyandiko zino Zing'alile nhegulo yake choni?</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="LUK 20:17">‘Dibwe dilemigwe na wazenzi</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="LUK 20:17">digaluka kuwa dibwe da kutamanilwa ng'hani kubanza mabwe gose.’<verse eid="LUK 20:17"/></para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="LUK 20:18"/>Munhu yoyose yondayadigwile dibwe dija kokanhika vidangavidanga, na kamba dibwe dija dihamgwila munhu, domsiginha lipilipi.”<verse eid="LUK 20:18"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Mbuza ya Kuliha Kodi</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 22:15-22">Mat. 22:15-22</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 12:13-17">Mlk. 12:13-17</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="LUK 20:19"/>Wafundiza Malagizo ga Musa na wakulu wa wakulu wa nhambiko bahaja walonda kumgoga Yesu, kwavija wavitanga kamba kadilonga hala dino yowalonga hewo, ila wawadumba wanhu. <verse eid="LUK 20:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="LUK 20:20"/>Wakala womuhembula ng'hani, abaho, wawatuma visepi waitendile kamba wanhu wanogile. Watamanila kumnamata Yesu mmbuli zayalongile, giladi wamgoge wamgele mmakono ga mkulu wa undewa wa Loma. <verse eid="LUK 20:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="LUK 20:21"/>Wanhu waja wamulongela Yesu, “Mkulufunzi, tuvitanga kamba kolonga na kufundiza mbuli za kweli, na kamba hudumba kihanga cha munhu yoyose, ila kofundiza ikweli vija Mulungu voyowalonda wanhu watende. <verse eid="LUK 20:21"/><verse number="22" style="v" sid="LUK 20:22"/>Tulongele, vino vinoga tweye kuliha kodi ha mkulu wa undewa wa Loma ama havinogile?”<verse eid="LUK 20:22"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="LUK 20:23"/>Ila Yesu kaumanya ubala wao, kawalongela, <verse eid="LUK 20:23"/><verse number="24" style="v" sid="LUK 20:24"/>“Ndagusileni ihela. Twaga na kihanga kino kili muno cha munhu yalihi?”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="LUK 20:24">Walonga, “Va mkulu wa undewa wa Loma.”<verse eid="LUK 20:24"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="LUK 20:25"/>Avo Yesu kalonga, “Vinoga. Avo muliheni mkulu wa undewa wa Loma vija vili va mkulu wa undewa wa Loma, na muliheni Mulungu vija vili va Mulungu.”<verse eid="LUK 20:25"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="LUK 20:26"/>Hawadahile kumnamata mmbuli ziyalongile haja hameso ga wanhu, avo wanyamala, wakanganya nyidikilo yake.<verse eid="LUK 20:26"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Mbuza ya Kuzuka</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 22:23-33">Mat. 22:23-33</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 12:18-27">Mlk. 12:18-27</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="LUK 20:27"/>Abaho, Masadukayo wayagwe, waja wolonga kamba wanhu hawazuka, weza ha Yesu na mbuza, <verse eid="LUK 20:27"/><verse number="28" style="v" sid="LUK 20:28"/>walonga, “Mkulufunzi, Musa katwandikila tweye lagizo dino, ‘Kamba munhu yahadanganhika na kaleka mwehe ila halelile nayo mwana, mdodo ama mkulu wa munhu hiyo kolondigwa yamsole ija ikizuka yamulelele wana ndugu yake yadanganhike.’ <verse eid="LUK 20:28"/><verse number="29" style="v" sid="LUK 20:29"/>Avo kukala na wandugu saba. Imkulu kasola mtwanzi, kadanganhika halekile mwana. <verse eid="LUK 20:29"/><verse number="30" style="v" sid="LUK 20:30"/>Abaho, waikabili kamsola ija imtwanzi, na heyo kadanganhika bila kuleka mwana, <verse eid="LUK 20:30"/><verse number="31" style="v" sid="LUK 20:31"/>na waikadatu kamsola. Galawilila gagaja mbaka wose saba wadanganhika bila kuleka wana. <verse eid="LUK 20:31"/><verse number="32" style="v" sid="LUK 20:32"/>Hakimambukizo, ija imtwanzi vivija kadanganhika. <verse eid="LUK 20:32"/><verse number="33" style="v" sid="LUK 20:33"/>Avo kuna dizua da kuzuka kwa wanhu wadanganhike, kowa mtwanzi wa yalihi? Kwavija wose saba wakala wamsolile.”<verse eid="LUK 20:33"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="LUK 20:34"/>Yesu kawalongela, “Wanhu wa kipigiti kino wosola na kusoligwa, <verse eid="LUK 20:34"/><verse number="35" style="v" sid="LUK 20:35"/>ila wanhu waja walumbile kwingila muulumwengu uja, na kuna umzuso wa kulawa mkudanganhika, hawasola ama kusoligwa, <verse eid="LUK 20:35"/><verse number="36" style="v" sid="LUK 20:36"/>na hawadanganhika, wowa kamba wasenga wa Mulungu wa kuulanga. Wao wowa wana wa Mulungu, kwavija wazusigwa. <verse eid="LUK 20:36"/><verse number="37" style="v" sid="LUK 20:37"/>Ila mmbuli ya kuzuka kwa wanhu, hata Musa kalagusa mbuli hiyo Mzinyandiko Zing'alile muna imbuli ya kitutua kikwaka, aho komulonga Mndewa kamba ‘Mulungu wa Ablaham, na Isaka, na Yakobo.’ <verse eid="LUK 20:37"/><verse number="38" style="v" sid="LUK 20:38"/>Heyo hali Mulungu wa wadanganhike, ila Mulungu wa wagima, kwavija kumwake heyo wose wana ugima.”<verse eid="LUK 20:38"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" sid="LUK 20:39"/>Wafundiza wayagwe wa Malagizo ga Musa walonga, “Kulonga goya, Mkulufunzi!” <verse eid="LUK 20:39"/><verse number="40" style="v" sid="LUK 20:40"/>Na haduhu munhu yagezile kumuuza tena mbuli iyagwe!<verse eid="LUK 20:40"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Mbuza ya Kilisto Mkombola</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 22:41-46">Mat. 22:41-46</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 12:35-37">Mlk. 12:35-37</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="41" style="v" sid="LUK 20:41"/>Yesu kawauza, “Vodahikaze wanhu kulonga kamba Kilisto Mkombola kowa mwana wa Daudi? <verse eid="LUK 20:41"/><verse number="42" style="v" sid="LUK 20:42"/>Kwavija Daudi mwenyego kolonga mkitabu cha Zabuli,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="LUK 20:42">‘Mndewa kamulongela Mndewa wangu,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="LUK 20:42">Kala kumkono wangu wa ukulume<verse eid="LUK 20:42"/></para>
  <para style="q2">
    <verse number="43" style="v" sid="LUK 20:43"/>mbaka vondaniweke wadumuka zako wawe kamba kigoda cha kwikila magulu gako.’<verse eid="LUK 20:43"/></para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="44" style="v" sid="LUK 20:44"/>Kamba Daudi kamkema heyo Mndewa, abaho, Kilisto Mkombola kowaze mwana wa Daudi?”<verse eid="LUK 20:44"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Yesu Kowazuma Wanhu Waiteganye na Mafundo ga Wafundiza Malagizo</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 23:1-36">Mat. 23:1-36</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 12:38-40">Mlk. 12:38-40</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="45" style="v" sid="LUK 20:45"/>Wanhu wose viwakalile wotegeleza, Yesu kawalongela wanahina zake, <verse eid="LUK 20:45"/><verse number="46" style="v" sid="LUK 20:46"/>“Iteganyeni na wafundiza Malagizo ga Musa, awo wonogelwa kuzungulukazunguluka kuno wavalile mikanzu yao, na wonogelwa kulamsigwa na hishima mmasoko, na kusagula vigoda va haulongozi mzing'anda za nhambiko na mulusona. <verse eid="LUK 20:46"/><verse number="47" style="v" sid="LUK 20:47"/>Wowabulunya vizuka na kutenda nhambiko nhali za uzenzeleganye hameso ga wanhu! Nhaguso yao yowa ng'hulu ng'hani!”<verse eid="LUK 20:47"/></para>
  <chapter eid="LUK 20"/>
  <chapter number="21" style="c" sid="LUK 21"/>
  <para style="s1">Nhosa ya Kizuka</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 12:41-44">Mlk. 12:41-44</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="LUK 21:1"/>Yesu kawalola wanhu wose, kawona wagoli vowogela nhosa zao mkia cha kulavila nhosa, <verse eid="LUK 21:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="LUK 21:2"/>abaho, kamona kizuka imwe mkumbulu ng'hani kagela senti mbili. <verse eid="LUK 21:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="LUK 21:3"/>Yesu kalonga, “Nowalongela kizuka ino imkumbulu kagela nhosa ng'hulu kubanza wayagwe wose, <verse eid="LUK 21:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="LUK 21:4"/>kwavija wayagwe walava nhosa zao kulawa m'vinhu vibanzile mmali gao gali bwando, ila heyo, hamoja na ukumbulu wake, kalava vose vayatamanile.”<verse eid="LUK 21:4"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Yesu Kolonga Ubananzi wa Ng'anda ya Mulungu</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 24:1-2">Mat. 24:1-2</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 13:1-2">Mlk. 13:1-2</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="LUK 21:5"/>Wanhu wayagwe wakala wolongelela woilonga Ing'anda ya Mulungu viihambigwe na mabwe ganogile na nhosa zilavigwa ha Mulungu. Yesu kalonga, <verse eid="LUK 21:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="LUK 21:6"/>“Gano gomkona hano, kipigiti chokwiza haduhu hata dibwe dimwe dondadilekigwe hachana ya diyagwe, gose golagazwa hasi.”<verse eid="LUK 21:6"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Kugaya na Kugazigwa</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 24:3-14">Mat. 24:3-14</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 13:3-13">Mlk. 13:3-13</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="LUK 21:7"/>Wamuuza, “Mkulufunzi, mbuli zino zolawila zua jaki? Na choni chondakilawilile kutulagusila kamba kipigiti kivika cha mbuli ino kulawilila?”<verse eid="LUK 21:7"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="LUK 21:8"/>Yesu kalonga, “Tegelezeni munhu sambiyawavwizile. Wanhu bwando wokwiza mtwaga jangu, wolonga, ‘Nie iyo Kilisto!’ na, ‘Kipigiti kivika!’ Ila sambimuwakoleleze. <verse eid="LUK 21:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="LUK 21:9"/>Sambimdumbe muhahulika ng'hondo na muhindumuhindu, kwavija vinhu kamba avo volondigwa visonge kulawila, ila ikimambukizo hakiza hima.”<verse eid="LUK 21:9"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="LUK 21:10"/>Kagendelela kulonga, “Isi yogomba na isi iyagwe, na undewa wouvamhila undewa uyagwe. <verse eid="LUK 21:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="LUK 21:11"/>Kowa na mgudemo mkulu ng'hani wa isi, nzala na utamu hauhonaga hanhu na hanhu, kowa na vinhu va mkanganyo na va kudumbiza vilagala kulawa kuulanga. <verse eid="LUK 21:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="LUK 21:12"/>Ila mbuli zino zose kipigiti hazinalawila, tanhu, mogogigwa na kugazigwa, mogaligwa mzing'anda za nhambiko na kugeligwa mkifungo, mogaligwa mwa wandewa na mwa watawala sama yangu. <verse eid="LUK 21:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="LUK 21:13"/>Kino chowa kipigiti cha mweye kuzipeta mbuli zangu kumwao. <verse eid="LUK 21:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="LUK 21:14"/>Lamuleni mmioyo yenu kamba hamwiza kugelegeza avija vondamuigombeleze, <verse eid="LUK 21:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="LUK 21:15"/>kwavija nowagwelela ng'hungwe na mbuli za kulonga azo zondaziwatende wadumuka zenu wose sambiwadahe kuzilema ama kubamila. <verse eid="LUK 21:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="LUK 21:16"/>Mohonzigwa na watata zenu na wamama zenu na wakulu na wadodo zenu na wandugu zenu na wambwiga zenu, na wayagwe mmwanza wenu wokomigwa. <verse eid="LUK 21:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="LUK 21:17"/>Wanhu wose wowehila sama yangu. <verse eid="LUK 21:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="LUK 21:18"/>Ila haduhu hata luvili lumwe kulawa mmatwi genu londalupotele. <verse eid="LUK 21:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="LUK 21:19"/>Nanahileni, moikombola wenyego.<verse eid="LUK 21:19"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Yesu Koulonga Ubananzi wa Yelusalemu</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 24:15-21">Mat. 24:15-21</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 13:14-19">Mlk. 13:14-19</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="LUK 21:20"/>“Muhajona wambo da Yelusalemu dizungulukwe na madale ga asikali, m'vitange kamba mkipigiti kiguhi dokwiza kubanangwa. <verse eid="LUK 21:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="LUK 21:21"/>Avo, awo wali Yudea wakimbilile m'vigongo, awo wali mdiwambo wasegele, na awo wali kumigunda sambiwabwele mdiwambo. <verse eid="LUK 21:21"/><verse number="22" style="v" sid="LUK 21:22"/>Kwavija kino kicho kipigiti cha nhaguso, kugatenda gaja gose galongigwe Mzinyandiko Zing'alile galawile. <verse eid="LUK 21:22"/><verse number="23" style="v" sid="LUK 21:23"/>Wogaya ng'hani watwanzi wali na inda mmazua higo na watwanzi wali na wana ving'hele! Mgayo mkulu wokwiza muisi ino, na lusango lukulu lwa Mulungu lowagwila wanhu wano. <verse eid="LUK 21:23"/><verse number="24" style="v" sid="LUK 21:24"/>Wanhu wayagwe wokomigwa na mapanga, na wanhu wayagwe wosoligwa kamba wafungigwa na kupwililiswa muisi zose. Na wambo da Yelusalemu dobojagwa na Wamhazi, mbaka kipigiti chao vondakimale.<verse eid="LUK 21:24"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Kwiza kwa Mwana wa Munhu</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 24:29-31">Mat. 24:29-31</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 13:24-27">Mlk. 13:24-27</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="LUK 21:25"/>“Kowa na vinhu va mkanganyo vondavilawile mdizua, mmulenge, na mnhondo. Muulumwengu, wanhu wa muisi zose wowa bule nhamanila, wodumba kisindo cha bahali na nyangi za kumema na kuhungula kwa ibahali. <verse eid="LUK 21:25"/><verse number="26" style="v" sid="LUK 21:26"/>Wanhu wosinduka mkona bwembwe, wobeta wone chondakilawilile muulumwengu wose, kwavija mhiko za kuulanga zotigiswa. <verse eid="LUK 21:26"/><verse number="27" style="v" sid="LUK 21:27"/>Aho baho hondawanyone nie, Mwana wa Munhu, nikwiza na mawingu na mhiko na yenzi ng'hulu. <verse eid="LUK 21:27"/><verse number="28" style="v" sid="LUK 21:28"/>Mbuli zino zihasonga kulawila, imeni wima, mgangamale, kwavija ukombola wenu wa mmabehi.”<verse eid="LUK 21:28"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Fundo da Mtini</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 24:32-35">Mat. 24:32-35</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 13:28-31">Mlk. 13:28-31</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="LUK 21:29"/>Abaho, Yesu kawalongela hala dino, “Ugelegezeni mtini na mibiki yose. <verse eid="LUK 21:29"/><verse number="30" style="v" sid="LUK 21:30"/>Muhagona matepo gake gosonga kuzuka, movitanga kamba vuli da mmabehi. <verse eid="LUK 21:30"/><verse number="31" style="v" sid="LUK 21:31"/>Vivija, muhazona mbuli zino zolawila, m'vitange kamba Undewa wa Mulungu wa mmabehi.<verse eid="LUK 21:31"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="LUK 21:32"/>“Kweli nowalongela, wanhu wa mulelo uno hawesha wose mbaka mbuli zino zose zilawilile. <verse eid="LUK 21:32"/><verse number="33" style="v" sid="LUK 21:33"/>Ulanga na isi vose vobita, ila mbuli zangu hazibita.<verse eid="LUK 21:33"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Kaleni Meso</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="LUK 21:34"/>“Teganyeni, mioyo yenu sambiibasakanywe na ngelegeza za kubukanya na kung'wa ugimbi na mbuli za ulumwengu uno, kwavija zua dija da ikimambukizo dowezila mkuwasinhukiza <verse eid="LUK 21:34"/><verse number="35" style="v" sid="LUK 21:35"/>kamba mtego. Kwavija vivo vondadiwezile wanhu wose wokala kila hanhu muulumwengu. <verse eid="LUK 21:35"/><verse number="36" style="v" sid="LUK 21:36"/>Kaleni meso mazua gose, na mtambike kipigiti chose giladi mwing'higwe mhiko za kubita muilegehe mmbuli hizo zose azo zondazilawile na kwima haulongozi wa nie, Mwana wa Munhu.”<verse eid="LUK 21:36"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" sid="LUK 21:37"/>Mazua gaja Yesu kakala yofundiza Kung'anda ya Mulungu, na ichungulo kakala yochola kuwasa kuna Ikigongo cha Mizaituni. <verse eid="LUK 21:37"/><verse number="38" style="v" sid="LUK 21:38"/>Ndamuka ya kila imitondo wanhu wose wachola Kung'anda ya Mulungu kumtegeleza.<verse eid="LUK 21:38"/></para>
  <chapter eid="LUK 21"/>
  <chapter number="22" style="c" sid="LUK 22"/>
  <para style="s1">Zundo da Kumkoma Yesu</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 26:1-5">Mat. 26:1-5</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 14:1-2">Mlk. 14:1-2</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 11:45-53">Yoh. 11:45-53</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="LUK 22:1"/>Kipigiti cha Lusona lwa Imikate Ilibule Mela, lukemigwa Pasaka, kikwenhuka. <verse eid="LUK 22:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="LUK 22:2"/>Wakulu wa wakulu wa nhambiko na wafundiza Malagizo ga Musa wakala wozahila nzila ya kumkoma Yesu, ila wawadumba wanhu.<verse eid="LUK 22:2"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Yuda Kotogola Kumuhonza Yesu</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 26:14-16">Mat. 26:14-16</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 14:10-11">Mlk. 14:10-11</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="LUK 22:3"/>Abaho, Mwenembago kamwingila Yuda, yokemigwa Isikalioti, yakalile mmwanza wa wanahina longo dimwe na wabili. <verse eid="LUK 22:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="LUK 22:4"/>Avo Yuda kachola kulonga na wakulu wa wakulu wa nhambiko na wakulu wa asikali wemilizi wa Ing'anda ya Mulungu avija vondayamgele mmakono gao. <verse eid="LUK 22:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="LUK 22:5"/>Wadeng'helela ng'hani, wailagana kumgwaa hela. <verse eid="LUK 22:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="LUK 22:6"/>Yuda katogola, kasonga kuzahila hanhu ha kumgela Yesu mmakono gao kipigiti halibule wanhu.<verse eid="LUK 22:6"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Yesu Koisasala Kuija Pasaka</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 26:17-25">Mat. 26:17-25</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 14:12-21">Mlk. 14:12-21</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 13:21-30">Yoh. 13:21-30</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="LUK 22:7"/>Zua da Ulusona lwa Imikate Ilibule Mela divika, lusona lwawachinjaga wana ng'hondolo wa Pasaka. <verse eid="LUK 22:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="LUK 22:8"/>Yesu kawatuma Petulo na Yohana yowalongela, “Gendeni mkatutandile mandia ga Pasaka tuje.”<verse eid="LUK 22:8"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="LUK 22:9"/>Wamuuza, “Kwahi kuulonda tukaitande?”<verse eid="LUK 22:9"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="LUK 22:10"/>Kawalongela, “Muhengila mdiwambo, moiting'hana na munhu yapapile nongo ya mazi. Mkwelelezeni mbaka kuna ing'anda yondayengile, <verse eid="LUK 22:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="LUK 22:11"/>mulongeleni mwene ng'anda, ‘Mkulufunzi kokuuza, dakwahi digati dondawadile Pasaka heyo na wanahina zake?’ <verse eid="LUK 22:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="LUK 22:12"/>Kowalagusila gati kulu da uchana dili na vinhu vose. Aho baho hondamsasale kila kinhu.”<verse eid="LUK 22:12"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="LUK 22:13"/>Wachola wavika kila kinhu kamba viwalongeligwe na Yesu, avo wasasala mandia ga Pasaka.<verse eid="LUK 22:13"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Mandia ga Mndewa</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 26:26-30">Mat. 26:26-30</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 14:22-26">Mlk. 14:22-26</ref>; <ref loc="1CO 11:23-25">1Kol. 11:23-25</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="LUK 22:14"/>Kipigiti vikivikile, Yesu kakala hameza na watumigwa zake. <verse eid="LUK 22:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="LUK 22:15"/>Kawalongela, “Nisulukila ng'hani kuja na mweye mandia gano ga Pasaka ning'hali sinagazigwa. <verse eid="LUK 22:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="LUK 22:16"/>Kwavija nowalongela sigaja kabili mandia gano mbaka vondagavikile Muundewa wa Mulungu.” <figure style="fig" alt="The Last Supper" file="WA03909b.jpg" size="col" loc="Luke 22:16-20" copy="Graham Wade © United Bible Societies, 1989." ref="22:15">Yesu hameza hamoja na wanahina zake.</figure><verse eid="LUK 22:16"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="LUK 22:17"/>Abaho, Yesu kasola kikasi, kamuheweza Mulungu, kalonga, “Soleni kino muigolele mwemwe kwa mwemwe. <verse eid="LUK 22:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="LUK 22:18"/>Nowalongela, songela kipigiti kino na kugendelela, sing'wa viyagwe divai mbaka Undewa wa Mulungu vondawize.”<verse eid="LUK 22:18"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="LUK 22:19"/>Abaho, kasola mkate, kamuheweza Mulungu, kaumogola, kawagwelela yolonga, “Uno uwo lukuli lwangu lulavigwe sama yenu, tendeni vino mkung'humbukila nie.” <verse eid="LUK 22:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="LUK 22:20"/>Viyeshile kuwagwelela gamandia, vivija kawagwelela kikasi yolonga, “Kikasi kino kicho lagano da isambi dili mmulopa wangu, ukwitika sama yenu.<verse eid="LUK 22:20"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="LUK 22:21"/>“Ila lola! Mkono wa munhu yondayanihonze wa bahano na nie hameza! <verse eid="LUK 22:21"/><verse number="22" style="v" sid="LUK 22:22"/>Nie, Mwana wa Munhu, nodanganhika kamba vayalamule Mulungu, ila kogaya ng'hani munhu ija yondayanihonze!”<verse eid="LUK 22:22"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="LUK 22:23"/>Avo wasonga kuiuza wenyego kwa wenyego yalihi mmwanza wao yondayazitende mbuli zija.<verse eid="LUK 22:23"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Wanahina Woibamilila Ukulu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="LUK 22:24"/>Bamila dizuka mwa wanahina, kamba yalihi mmwanza wao yogelegezwa kuwa mkulu kubanza wayagwe. <verse eid="LUK 22:24"/><verse number="25" style="v" sid="LUK 22:25"/>Yesu kawalongela, “Wandewa wa Wamhazi wowatawala wanhu zao na mhiko, na watawala wolonda kukemigwa, ‘Wambwiga za Wanhu.’ <verse eid="LUK 22:25"/><verse number="26" style="v" sid="LUK 22:26"/>Ila vino sio vumulondigwa mweye muwe. Ila yali mkulu kubanza wose mmwanza wenu kolondigwa kuwa kamba mdodo kubanza wose, na ayo yali kilangizi kolondigwa kuwa kamba mtumigwa. <verse eid="LUK 22:26"/><verse number="27" style="v" sid="LUK 22:27"/>Yalihi yali mkulu, ija yokala hasi kuja ama ija imtumigwa? Nokwagiza ija yokala hasi kuja. Ila nie na mmwanza wenu kamba mtumigwa.<verse eid="LUK 22:27"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="LUK 22:28"/>“Mweye mkala na nie kipigiti chose kinikalile nigazigwa, <verse eid="LUK 22:28"/><verse number="29" style="v" sid="LUK 22:29"/>na kamba Tataangu viyangwelele nie Undewa, vivija na nie nowagwelela mweye Undewa. <verse eid="LUK 22:29"/><verse number="30" style="v" sid="LUK 22:30"/>Moja na kung'wa hameza yangu Muundewa wangu, na mokala muna ivigoda va undewa, muitagusa mitala longo dimwe na mibili ya Islaeli.<verse eid="LUK 22:30"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Yesu Kolonga Avija Petulo Vondayam'bele</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 26:31-35">Mat. 26:31-35</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 14:27-31">Mlk. 14:27-31</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 13:36-38">Yoh. 13:36-38</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="LUK 22:31"/>“Simoni, Simoni! Tegeleza! Mwenembago kampula Mulungu giladi yeze kuwageza mweye, yone kamba nhamanila yenu yogendelela. <verse eid="LUK 22:31"/><verse number="32" style="v" sid="LUK 22:32"/>Ila nikutambikila gweye, Simoni, nhamanila yako sambiihunguke. Na uhabwela kumwangu, uwagangamaze wandugu zako.”<verse eid="LUK 22:32"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="LUK 22:33"/>Ila Petulo kalonga, “Mndewa, nie nitogola kugeligwa mkifungo hamoja nagwe ama kudanganhika hamoja nagwe!”<verse eid="LUK 22:33"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="LUK 22:34"/>Yesu kamulongela, “Nokulongela, Petulo, kilo cha lelo nzogolo hanakwika, konibela mianza midatu kamba hunimanyile.”<verse eid="LUK 22:34"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Mkwiji, Mkoba, na Zele</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="LUK 22:35"/>Abaho, Yesu kawauza wanahina zake yolonga, “Viniwatumile kipigiti kija bila mkwiji wa hela na bila mkoba na bila vilatu viyagwe, mkala muhungukilwe na kinhu?”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="LUK 22:35">Wamulongela, “Hatuhungukilwe na kinhu.”<verse eid="LUK 22:35"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" sid="LUK 22:36"/>Yesu kawalongela, “Ila kipigiti kino yoyose yali na mkwiji wa hela ama mkoba, nayavisole, na munhu yalibule zele yaguze koti jake yakagule zele. <verse eid="LUK 22:36"/><verse number="37" style="v" sid="LUK 22:37"/>Avo, nowalongela, Nyandiko Zing'alile zolonga, ‘Kapetigwa hamoja na watenda gehile,’ Zolondigwa zivikile kumwangu, kwavija ugima wangu wokwenhuka kuisota.”<verse eid="LUK 22:37"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="38" style="v" sid="LUK 22:38"/>Wanahina zake walonga, “Lola, Mndewa! Hano hana mizele mibili!”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="LUK 22:38">Na heyo kalonga, “Yotosha.”<verse eid="LUK 22:38"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Yesu Kotambika Hakigongo cha Mizaituni</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 26:36-46">Mat. 26:36-46</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 14:32-42">Mlk. 14:32-42</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" sid="LUK 22:39"/>Yesu kasegela haja hakiwambo kachola Hakigongo cha Mizaituni na wanahina zake kamba vayatendaga. <verse eid="LUK 22:39"/><verse number="40" style="v" sid="LUK 22:40"/>Viwavikile haja hakigongo, kawalongela wanahina zake, “Tambikeni, giladi sambimwingile muna ivitega.”<verse eid="LUK 22:40"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="41" style="v" sid="LUK 22:41"/>Abaho, kachola hamwande mwanza wa kwasa dibwe, kafugama mavindi, katambika, <verse eid="LUK 22:41"/><verse number="42" style="v" sid="LUK 22:42"/>kalonga, “Tata, kamba vihakunogela, nisegezele kikasi kino cha mgayo. Ila sio kamba vinilonda nie, ila kamba vuulonda gweye.” <verse eid="LUK 22:42"/><verse number="43" style="v" sid="LUK 22:43"/>Msenga wa Mulungu wa kuulanga kamulawilila na kumgangamaza. <verse eid="LUK 22:43"/><verse number="44" style="v" sid="LUK 22:44"/>Muusungu mkulu kaiyoha kutambika, mhome yake ikala kamba madwendwe ga mulopa godwendweka hasi.<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">22:44 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Nyandiko ziyagwe za umwaka zabule mnhongo wa 43 na 44.</char></note><verse eid="LUK 22:44"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="45" style="v" sid="LUK 22:45"/>Viyamambukize kutambika, kema, kabweleganya ha wanahina zake, kawavika wawasile kwavija wakala na giogio. <verse eid="LUK 22:45"/><verse number="46" style="v" sid="LUK 22:46"/>Kawalongela, “Habali mweye muwasa? Lamukeni mtambike, giladi sambimwingile muna ivitega.”<verse eid="LUK 22:46"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Yesu Kogogigwa</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 26:47-56">Mat. 26:47-56</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 14:43-50">Mlk. 14:43-50</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 18:3-11">Yoh. 18:3-11</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="47" style="v" sid="LUK 22:47"/>Yesu viyakalile yang'hali yolonga, dale da wanhu divika dilongozwa na Yuda yakalile mmwanza wa wanahina zake longo dimwe na wabili. Kamkwenhukila Yesu na kumnonela. <verse eid="LUK 22:47"/><verse number="48" style="v" sid="LUK 22:48"/>Ila Yesu kamulongela, “Yuda, konihonza nie, Mwana wa Munhu, mkuninonela?”<verse eid="LUK 22:48"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="49" style="v" sid="LUK 22:49"/>Wanahina wakalile na Yesu viwagawene gaja galondile kulawila, wamuuza, “Mndewa, tuwakanhe na mizele yetu?” <verse eid="LUK 22:49"/><verse number="50" style="v" sid="LUK 22:50"/>Mwanahina imwe kadikanha gwiti da ukulume da nyakadala wa Mkulu wa Wakulu wose wa Nhambiko.<verse eid="LUK 22:50"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="51" style="v" sid="LUK 22:51"/>Ila Yesu kalonga, “Lekeni.” Kadikwasa gwiti da ija imunhu na kumuhonya.<verse eid="LUK 22:51"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="52" style="v" sid="LUK 22:52"/>Abaho, Yesu kawalongela wakulu wa wakulu wa nhambiko na waja wemilizi wa Ing'anda ya Mulungu na wakulu wa ikitala wezile haja kumgoga, “Munizila na mizele na mimbwego kamba vija nie na m'bavi? <verse eid="LUK 22:52"/><verse number="53" style="v" sid="LUK 22:53"/>Nikala na mweye Kung'anda ya Mulungu mazua gose, hamunigogile. Ila kino kicho kipigiti chenu cha kutenda gano, kipigiti cha mhiko za ziza zotawala.”<verse eid="LUK 22:53"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Petulo Kom'bela Yesu</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 26:57-58">Mat. 26:57-58</ref>, <ref loc="MAT 26:69-75">69-75</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 14:53-54">Mlk. 14:53-54</ref>, <ref loc="MRK 14:66-72">66-72</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 18:12-18">Yoh. 18:12-18</ref>, <ref loc="JHN 18:25-27">25-27</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="54" style="v" sid="LUK 22:54"/>Wamgoga Yesu, wamsola wamgala kung'anda ya Mkulu wa Wakulu wose wa Nhambiko, na Petulo kakala yowakoleleza kutalitali. <verse eid="LUK 22:54"/><verse number="55" style="v" sid="LUK 22:55"/>Ubwinhigwa moto hagatigati ya idikonhi da ing'anda, wakala hamoja wokota moto, na Petulo kakala hamoja nawo. <verse eid="LUK 22:55"/><verse number="56" style="v" sid="LUK 22:56"/>Nyakadala imwe wa kitwanzi viyamonile yakalile haja hamoto, kamulola ng'hani, kalonga, “Munhu ino vivija kakala na Yesu!”<verse eid="LUK 22:56"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="57" style="v" sid="LUK 22:57"/>Petulo kabela, kalonga, “Gweye mtwanzi, simtangile munhu hiyo!”<verse eid="LUK 22:57"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="58" style="v" sid="LUK 22:58"/>Mkipigiti kiguhi, munhu imwe kamona, kalonga, “Vivija na gweye kwa mmwanza wao!”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="LUK 22:58">Petulo kalonga, “Gweye munhu, sio nie!”<verse eid="LUK 22:58"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="59" style="v" sid="LUK 22:59"/>Na kipigiti cha kamba saa dimwe, munhu iyagwe kagong'ondeza, yolonga, “Kabisa! Munhu ino kakala na Yesu kwavija heyo nayo kolawa Galilaya!”<verse eid="LUK 22:59"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="60" style="v" sid="LUK 22:60"/>Petulo kalonga, “Gweye munhu, sikitanga chuulonga.”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="LUK 22:60">Bahaja viyakalile hanamambukiza kulonga, nzogolo keka. <verse eid="LUK 22:60"/><verse number="61" style="v" sid="LUK 22:61"/>Mndewa kahinduka kamulola Petulo, na Petulo kakumbukila kamba Mndewa kakala yamulongele kamba, “Kipigiti nzogolo hanakwika kilo ya lelo, kom'bela mianza midatu.” <verse eid="LUK 22:61"/><verse number="62" style="v" sid="LUK 22:62"/>Abaho, Petulo kalawa hanze, kalila ng'hani.<verse eid="LUK 22:62"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Yesu Kotoigwa na Kutendelwa Mzihaka</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 26:67-68">Mat. 26:67-68</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 14:65">Mlk. 14:65</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="63" style="v" sid="LUK 22:63"/>Wanhu wakalile womwimiliza Yesu wasonga kumtendela mzihaka na kumtoa. <verse eid="LUK 22:63"/><verse number="64" style="v" sid="LUK 22:64"/>Wamfunga na kitambala mmeso, abaho, wamuuza, “Zuza! Yalihi yakutoile?” <verse eid="LUK 22:64"/><verse number="65" style="v" sid="LUK 22:65"/>Na wamulongela vinhu viyagwe bwando va maligo.<verse eid="LUK 22:65"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Yesu Kogaligwa Kuna Ikitala Kikulu cha Isi ya Wayahudi</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 26:59-66">Mat. 26:59-66</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 14:55-64">Mlk. 14:55-64</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 18:19-24">Yoh. 18:19-24</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="66" style="v" sid="LUK 22:66"/>Vuuchile, wavyele na wakulu wa wakulu wa nhambiko na wafundiza Malagizo ga Musa waiting'hanila hamoja, na Yesu kagaligwa haulongozi wa Ikitala Kikulu cha Isi ya Wayahudi. <verse eid="LUK 22:66"/><verse number="67" style="v" sid="LUK 22:67"/>Walonga, “Tulongele, gweye iyo Kilisto Mkombola?”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="LUK 22:67">Kawalongela, “Kamba nihawalongela, hamunitogola, <verse eid="LUK 22:67"/><verse number="68" style="v" sid="LUK 22:68"/>na kamba nihawauza mbuli, hamwidika. <verse eid="LUK 22:68"/><verse number="69" style="v" sid="LUK 22:69"/>Ila songela kipigiti kino, nie, Mwana wa Munhu, nokala kumkono wa ukulume wa Mulungu Mkulu.”<verse eid="LUK 22:69"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="70" style="v" sid="LUK 22:70"/>Wose walonga, “Avo gweye iyo Mwana wa Mulungu?”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="LUK 22:70">Kawalongela, “Mweye iwo mulonga nie iyo nene.”<verse eid="LUK 22:70"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="71" style="v" sid="LUK 22:71"/>Walonga, “Hatulonda usindila uyagwe! Tweye wenyego tuhulika kulawa mmulomo wake mwenyego!”<verse eid="LUK 22:71"/></para>
  <chapter eid="LUK 22"/>
  <chapter number="23" style="c" sid="LUK 23"/>
  <para style="s1">Yesu Kogaligwa ha Pilato</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 27:1-2">Mat. 27:1-2</ref>, <ref loc="MAT 27:11-14">11-14</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 15:1-5">Mlk. 15:1-5</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 18:28-38">Yoh. 18:28-38</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="LUK 23:1"/>Dale jose dinuka, wamsola Yesu wamgala ha Pilato. <verse eid="LUK 23:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="LUK 23:2"/>Wasonga kumtagusa wolonga, “Tum'vika munhu ino yowagiza wanhu zetu, yowagomesa sambiwamulihe kodi Kaisali,<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">23:2 </char><char style="fk" closed="false">Kaisali </char><char style="ft" closed="false">nhegulo yake </char><char style="fqa" closed="false">Mndewa wa Loma.</char></note> na mwenyego koikema kamba heyo iyo Kilisto, Mndewa.”<verse eid="LUK 23:2"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="LUK 23:3"/>Pilato kamuuza, “Gweye iyo mndewa wa Wayahudi?”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="LUK 23:3">Yesu kamwidika, “Gweye iyo ulonga avo.”<verse eid="LUK 23:3"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="LUK 23:4"/>Abaho, Pilato kawalongela wakulu wa wakulu wa nhambiko na dija didale da wanhu, “Siyona mbuli ya kumtagusila munhu ino.”<verse eid="LUK 23:4"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="LUK 23:5"/>Ila hewo wananahila ng'hani wolonga, “Mafundo gake genula mzahimzahi mwa wanhu wose wa Yudea, kasonga Galilaya na sambi kahano.”<verse eid="LUK 23:5"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Yesu Kogaligwa ha Helode</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="LUK 23:6"/>Pilato viyahulike gano, kawauza, “Munhu ino kolawa Galilaya?” <verse eid="LUK 23:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="LUK 23:7"/>Viyavitangile goya kamba Yesu kokala yolawa isi yootawala Helode Antipa, kamgala ha Helode, yakalile Yelusalemu kipigiti kija. <verse eid="LUK 23:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="LUK 23:8"/>Helode kadeng'helela ng'hani viyamuwene Yesu, kwavija kakala yohulika mbuli zake, avo kipigiti kitali kakala yolonda kumona. Kakala yotamanila kumona Yesu viyotenda mzonza. <verse eid="LUK 23:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="LUK 23:9"/>Avo Helode kamuuza Yesu mbuli bwando, ila Yesu kamnyamalila. <verse eid="LUK 23:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="LUK 23:10"/>Wakulu wa wakulu wa nhambiko na wafundiza Malagizo ga Musa wakwenhuka, wamtagusa Yesu na lusango. <verse eid="LUK 23:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="LUK 23:11"/>Helode na asikali zake wamtendela mzihaka Yesu na kumgela kinyala, abaho, wam'vaza guo da undewa, ikwisha wam'bweza kabili ha Pilato. <verse eid="LUK 23:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="LUK 23:12"/>Pilato na Helode wakala waihile, ila songela zua dija wakala wambwiga.<verse eid="LUK 23:12"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Yesu Kotagusigwa Kudanganhika</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 27:15-26">Mat. 27:15-26</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 15:6-15">Mlk. 15:6-15</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 18:39-19:16">Yoh. 18:39—19:16</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="LUK 23:13"/>Pilato kawakema hamoja wakulu wa wakulu wa nhambiko, wakulu wa isi, na wanhu. <verse eid="LUK 23:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="LUK 23:14"/>Kawalongela, “Mumgala munhu ino kumwangu mulonga kowagiza wanhu. Avo nimpelemba hano hameso genu, sonile mbuli yoyose ihile imumtagusila. <verse eid="LUK 23:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="LUK 23:15"/>Helode na heyo honile mbuli ihile, kileka mana yam'bwezile kumwetu. Haduhu kinhu chochose kihile chayatendile munhu ino kilumbile munhu ino kudanganhika. <verse eid="LUK 23:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="LUK 23:16"/>Avo nolagiza yalanhigwe, abaho, nomuleka yagende na zake.” <verse eid="LUK 23:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="LUK 23:17"/>Kila kipigiti cha Lusona lwa Pasaka Pilato kawafungulilaga mfungigwa imwe.<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">23:17 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Nyandiko ziyagwe za umwaka zabule mnhongo wa 17.</char></note><verse eid="LUK 23:17"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="LUK 23:18"/>Dale jose diguta nyangi walonga, “Mkome hiyo! Tufungulile Balaba!” <verse eid="LUK 23:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="LUK 23:19"/>Balaba kakala yafungigwe sama ya mzahimzahi wa kuilema silikali ulawilile mdiwambo na kukoma.<verse eid="LUK 23:19"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="LUK 23:20"/>Pilato kalonda kumfungula Yesu, avo kalawilila kabili haulongozi wa ididale da wanhu. <verse eid="LUK 23:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="LUK 23:21"/>Ila wagendelela kutoa nyangi, wolonga, “Yawambigwe mumsalaba, yawambigwe mumsalaba!”<verse eid="LUK 23:21"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="LUK 23:22"/>Pilato kawalongela mwanza wa ikadatu, yolonga, “Mbuli ilihi ihile yaatendile? Nie siyona mbuli yoyose ihile yaatendile ilumbile heyo kudanganhika! Kolanhigwa, abaho, kolekesigwa.”<verse eid="LUK 23:22"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="LUK 23:23"/>Ila wagendelela kutoa nyangi ng'hani wolonga Yesu kolondigwa yawambigwe mumsalaba. Hakimambukizo, nyangi zao zihuma. <verse eid="LUK 23:23"/><verse number="24" style="v" sid="LUK 23:24"/>Avo Pilato kawatogolela waja iwanhu vija vowokala womulonda Yesu. <verse eid="LUK 23:24"/><verse number="25" style="v" sid="LUK 23:25"/>Avo kawafungulila Balaba iwamulondile, munhu yakalile mkifungo sama ya kugala mzahimzahi wa kuilema silikali na kukoma, na kumgela Yesu mmakono ga asikali, wamtende kamba vowolonda Wayahudi.<verse eid="LUK 23:25"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Yesu Kowambigwa Mumsalaba</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 27:32-44">Mat. 27:32-44</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 15:21-32">Mlk. 15:21-32</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 19:17-27">Yoh. 19:17-27</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="LUK 23:26"/>Viwakalile womgala, wamgoga munhu imwe yokemigwa Simoni, munhu wa isi ya Kilene, yakalile yokwingila mdiwambo yolawa kumgunda. Wamdikwa msalaba, kaupapa hachugu cha Yesu.<verse eid="LUK 23:26"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="LUK 23:27"/>Dale kulu da wanhu dimkweleleza, mmwanza wao kukala na watwanzi wokala womulilila na kumuyalalila. <verse eid="LUK 23:27"/><verse number="28" style="v" sid="LUK 23:28"/>Yesu kawahindukila kawalongela, “Mweye watwanzi wa Yelusalemu! Sambimunililile nie, ila ililileni wenyego na wanenu, <verse eid="LUK 23:28"/><verse number="29" style="v" sid="LUK 23:29"/>kwavija mazua gokwiza wanhu wokwiza kulonga, ‘Wana mhome watwanzi walibule wana, na waja hawalelile na waja hawakong'heze.’ <verse eid="LUK 23:29"/><verse number="30" style="v" sid="LUK 23:30"/>Kipigiti hicho wanhu wosonga kuilongela migongo, ‘Tulagalile!’ Na vigongo, ‘Tufise!’ <verse eid="LUK 23:30"/><verse number="31" style="v" sid="LUK 23:31"/>Kwavija kamba vinhu kamba vino votendeka mum'biki mbisi, vowaze mum'biki unyalile?”<verse eid="LUK 23:31"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="LUK 23:32"/>Wanhu wayagwe wabili, wakalile watendaga gehile, vivija na hewo walongozwa wachola kukomigwa hamoja na Yesu. <verse eid="LUK 23:32"/><verse number="33" style="v" sid="LUK 23:33"/>Viwavikile hanhu hokemigwa, “Fulu da Pala,” wamuwamba Yesu mumsalaba hamoja na watenda gehile wabili, imwe kumkono wake wa ukulume na iyagwe kumkono wake wa ukumoso. <verse eid="LUK 23:33"/><verse number="34" style="v" sid="LUK 23:34"/>Yesu kalonga, “Tata, wagele kumgongo kwavija hawagatangile gaja gowotenda.”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="LUK 23:34">Waigolela vivalo vake mkutoa kula. <verse eid="LUK 23:34"/><verse number="35" style="v" sid="LUK 23:35"/>Wanhu wema haja wolola kipigiti wakulu wa Wayahudi viwakalile womtendela uponela, wolonga, “Kawakombola wayagwe, na yaikombole mwenyego kamba heyo iyo Kilisto yasaguligwe na Mulungu.” <figure style="fig" alt="Crucifixion" file="WA03926b.jpg" size="col" loc="Luke 23:32-37" copy="Graham Wade © United Bible Societies, 1989." ref="Luk. 23:35">Yesu kowambigwa mumsalaba.</figure><verse eid="LUK 23:35"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" sid="LUK 23:36"/>Asikali vivija wamtendela uponela, wamkwenhukila wamgwelela divai ya ugwadu, <verse eid="LUK 23:36"/><verse number="37" style="v" sid="LUK 23:37"/>wolonga, “Kamba gweye iyo Mndewa wa Wayahudi, ikombole mwenyego!”<verse eid="LUK 23:37"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="38" style="v" sid="LUK 23:38"/>Hachana ya umsalaba wake wandika vino, <char style="sc">“ino iyo mndewa wa wayahudi.”</char><verse eid="LUK 23:38"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" sid="LUK 23:39"/>Mtenda gehile imwe yatungikigwe haja kamuliga Yesu yolonga, “Kamba gweye iyo Kilisto, ikombole mwenyego, abaho, utukombole na tweye.”<verse eid="LUK 23:39"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="40" style="v" sid="LUK 23:40"/>Ila ija mtenda gehile iyagwe kamkomhokela miyage yolonga, “Gweye humdumba Mulungu? Gweye kwa mumgayo kamba heyo. <verse eid="LUK 23:40"/><verse number="41" style="v" sid="LUK 23:41"/>Kumwetu tweye vilumba kwavija tugweleligwa gaja galumbile na gaja gatutendile, ila ino hatendile mbuli yoyose ihile.” <verse eid="LUK 23:41"/><verse number="42" style="v" sid="LUK 23:42"/>Abaho, kamulongela Yesu, “Yesu, ung'humbuke vondawize Muundewa wako.”<verse eid="LUK 23:42"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="43" style="v" sid="LUK 23:43"/>Yesu kamulongela, “Nokulongela ikweli, lelo kowa hamoja na nie Paladiso.”<verse eid="LUK 23:43"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Yesu Kodanganhika</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 27:45-56">Mat. 27:45-56</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 15:33-41">Mlk. 15:33-41</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 19:28-30">Yoh. 19:28-30</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="44" style="v" sid="LUK 23:44"/>Viivikile kamba saa sita, ziza diigubika isi yose mbaka saa tisa <verse eid="LUK 23:44"/><verse number="45" style="v" sid="LUK 23:45"/>kwavija zua diziziwala, na idiguo ditungikwe Muing'anda ya Mulungu didegeka vidanga vibili. <verse eid="LUK 23:45"/><verse number="46" style="v" sid="LUK 23:46"/>Yesu kenula dizwi, kalila yolonga, “Tata, mmakono gako noika loho yangu!” Viyeshile kulonga vino, kadanganhika.<verse eid="LUK 23:46"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="47" style="v" sid="LUK 23:47"/>Ija imkulu wa iwaasikali mia wa Loma kagona gaja galawilile, kamuyenzi Mulungu yolonga, “Kweli, munhu ino kakala mwende!”<verse eid="LUK 23:47"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="48" style="v" sid="LUK 23:48"/>Wanhu wakalile waiting'hane haja kulola mbuli ija wagona gaja galawilile, wose wabwela ukae yao wokiitoatoa zimhambaga wokiiyalala ng'hani. <verse eid="LUK 23:48"/><verse number="49" style="v" sid="LUK 23:49"/>Wose wakalile wambwiga zake Yesu, hamoja na watwanzi wakalile womkweleleza kulawa Galilaya, wema hatalitali wolola.<verse eid="LUK 23:49"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Lukuli lwa Yesu Lokwikigwa Mdipanga</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 27:57-61">Mat. 27:57-61</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 15:42-47">Mlk. 15:42-47</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 19:38-42">Yoh. 19:38-42</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="50" style="v" sid="LUK 23:50"/>Kukala na munhu imwe yokemigwa Usufu, yakalile imwe wa wanhu wa Ikitala Kikulu cha Isi ya Wayahudi, kakala mwende wa Mulungu, <verse eid="LUK 23:50"/><verse number="51" style="v" sid="LUK 23:51"/>na hatogole gaja gawalamule. Kakala yolawa kukiwambo cha Wayahudi kikemigwa Alimataya, na kakala youbeta Undewa wa Mulungu. <verse eid="LUK 23:51"/><verse number="52" style="v" sid="LUK 23:52"/>Munhu hiyo kachola ha Pilato kulupula lukuli lwa Yesu. <verse eid="LUK 23:52"/><verse number="53" style="v" sid="LUK 23:53"/>Abaho, kaluhumulusa hasi ulukuli, kaluvaza sanda, abaho, kalugela mdipanga dipukigwe mdibwe, dikalile hadinazikilwa munhu yoyose. <verse eid="LUK 23:53"/><verse number="54" style="v" sid="LUK 23:54"/>Dikala zua da kuisasala na Zua da Mhumulo kwavija Zua da Mhumulo dikala behi kusonga.<verse eid="LUK 23:54"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="55" style="v" sid="LUK 23:55"/>Waja iwatwanzi, wakalile womkweleleza Yesu kulawa Galilaya, wamkweleleza Usufu. Avo wajona dipanga na avija lukuli lwa Yesu vulwikigwe. <verse eid="LUK 23:55"/><verse number="56" style="v" sid="LUK 23:56"/>Abaho, wabwela mkae zao kusasala vinung'hanung'ha na mavuta ga kunung'hila ga kulubaka lukuli lwa Yesu.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="LUK 23:56">Muna Idizua da Mhumulo, wahumula kamba ndagizi vuzilagize.<verse eid="LUK 23:56"/></para>
  <chapter eid="LUK 23"/>
  <chapter number="24" style="c" sid="LUK 24"/>
  <para style="s1">Yesu Kozuka</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 28:1-10">Mat. 28:1-10</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 16:1-8">Mlk. 16:1-8</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 20:1-10">Yoh. 20:1-10</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="LUK 24:1"/>Zua da mwanduso wa wiki,<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">24:1 </char><char style="fk" closed="false">Zua da mwanduso wa wiki </char><char style="ft" closed="false">nhegulo yake </char><char style="fqa" closed="false">jumapili.</char></note> imitondo ng'hani, watwanzi wachola kuna dipanga wapapile vinung'hanung'ha vawatendile. <verse eid="LUK 24:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="LUK 24:2"/>Wadivika dibwe dikigwe hamulomo wa idipanga dibimbiliswe dikigwe hamgwazo, <verse eid="LUK 24:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="LUK 24:3"/>ila viwengile mdipanga, hawaluvikile lukuli lwa Mndewa Yesu.<figure style="fig" alt="The empty tomb" file="NT-16 Tomb.jpg" size="col" loc="Luke 22:2-7" copy="Jonathan McDaniel" ref="Luk. 24:2-3">Yesu kazuka.</figure> <verse eid="LUK 24:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="LUK 24:4"/>Viwakalile wang'hali wokanganya mbuli ija, bahaja walawilila wanhu wabili wavalile mikanzu inang'hazika, wema behi nao. <verse eid="LUK 24:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="LUK 24:5"/>Waja iwatwanzi wafugama mavindi wokona bwembwe ng'hani, ila waja wanhu wawalongela, “Habali mumzahila munhu mgima mwa wanhu wadanganhike? <verse eid="LUK 24:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="LUK 24:6"/>Kahaduhu hano, kazuka. Kumbukileni chayawalongele vayakalile yang'hali Galilaya. <verse eid="LUK 24:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="LUK 24:7"/>‘Mwana wa Munhu kolondigwa yageligwe mmakono ga wanhu wene vilozo, na womuwamba mumsalaba, na zua da ikadatu kozuka.’ ”<verse eid="LUK 24:7"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="LUK 24:8"/>Aho waja iwatwanzi wakumbukila mbuli zake, <verse eid="LUK 24:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="LUK 24:9"/>wabwela kulawa kudipanga, na kuzilonga mbuli zija zose mwa wanahina longo dimwe na imwe na mwa wanhu wose wasigale. <verse eid="LUK 24:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="LUK 24:10"/>Watwanzi waja wakala Maliamu kulawa kiwambo cha Magidala, Yoana, na Maliamu mamaake Yakobo. Wao hamoja na watwanzi wayagwe wazilonga mbuli zino mwa watumigwa wa Kilisto. <verse eid="LUK 24:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="LUK 24:11"/>Ila watumigwa wa Kilisto wagiza gaja gawalongile waja iwatwanzi ukala uponela, avo hawawategeleze. <verse eid="LUK 24:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="LUK 24:12"/>Ila Petulo kenuka kakimbila kachola kudipanga, kainamila kasungulila, kona isanda iiyeka. Abaho, kasegela haja hana dipanga kabwela ukae, kuno yokanganya gaja galawilile.<verse eid="LUK 24:12"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Kuchola Emau</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 16:12-13">Mlk. 16:12-13</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="LUK 24:13"/>Zua didija wanahina zake Yesu wabili wakala wochola kukiwambo kimwe kikemigwa Emau mwanza wa masaa mabili kulawa Yelusalemu, <verse eid="LUK 24:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="LUK 24:14"/>wakala wolongelela, wogalonga gaja gose galawilile. <verse eid="LUK 24:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="LUK 24:15"/>Viwakalile wolongelela kuno wokiiuzagiza, Yesu mwenyego kawakwenhukila kailongoza nao. <verse eid="LUK 24:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="LUK 24:16"/>Wamona, ila meso gao gazuilwa sambiwamtange. <verse eid="LUK 24:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="LUK 24:17"/>Yesu kawauza, “Mbuli zaki hizo zimuisimulila mnzila?”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="LUK 24:17">Wema wanyamala tulu. Kuno vihanga visifukile. <verse eid="LUK 24:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="LUK 24:18"/>Munhu imwe mmwanza wao yokemigwa Kileopa kamuuza, “Gweye wiyeka iyo muhenza huzitangile mbuli zija zilawilile haja Yelusalemu mazua madodo gabitile?”<verse eid="LUK 24:18"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="LUK 24:19"/>Kawauza, “Mbuli zaki?”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="LUK 24:19">Na hewo wamulongela, “Mbuli zimulawilile Yesu wa Nazaleti. Heyo kakala muhokozi mwene mhiko mmbuli ziyalongile na zija ziyatendile hameso ga Mulungu na hameso ga wanhu. <verse eid="LUK 24:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="LUK 24:20"/>Wakulu wa wakulu wa nhambiko na wakulu zetu wa isi wamgela mnhaguso ya ifa, avo kawambigwa mumsalaba. <verse eid="LUK 24:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="LUK 24:21"/>Ila tweye tutamanila kamba heyo iyo yondayaikombole isi ya Islaeli! Tuhagaleka higo gose, lelo zua da ikadatu songela vigalawilile gano. <verse eid="LUK 24:21"/><verse number="22" style="v" sid="LUK 24:22"/>Vivija watwanzi wayagwe wa mdidale jetu watusinhusa, waidamuka wachola kudipanga, <verse eid="LUK 24:22"/><verse number="23" style="v" sid="LUK 24:23"/>ila hawaluvikile lukuli lwake. Wabwela walonga wawona wasenga wa Mulungu wa kuulanga, wawalongela kamba Yesu mgima. <verse eid="LUK 24:23"/><verse number="24" style="v" sid="LUK 24:24"/>Wanhu wayagwe wakalile mdale jetu wachola kudipanga wavika vivija kamba viwalongile watwanzi waja, ila hawamonile.”<verse eid="LUK 24:24"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="LUK 24:25"/>Abaho, Yesu kawalongela, “Habali muli wabozi kamba avo, na habali muli na mioyo izalame kuzitogola mbuli zose zawalongile wahokozi? <verse eid="LUK 24:25"/><verse number="26" style="v" sid="LUK 24:26"/>Vino Kilisto Mkombola halondigwa yagaye m'vinhu kamba avo, abaho, yengile muyenzi yake?” <verse eid="LUK 24:26"/><verse number="27" style="v" sid="LUK 24:27"/>Avo Yesu kawasimulila mbuli zimulonga heyo mwenyego muna Zinyandiko Zing'alile, songela vitabu va Musa na Nyandiko Zing'alile za wahokozi wose wa Mulungu.<verse eid="LUK 24:27"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="LUK 24:28"/>Viwakwenhukile ikiwambo chawakalile wochola, Yesu kaitenda kamba vija kogendelela na mwanza, <verse eid="LUK 24:28"/><verse number="29" style="v" sid="LUK 24:29"/>ila wamuyalalila ng'hani, wolonga, “Kala hano na tweye, kwavija zua diswa na ziza dingila.” Avo kengila mng'anda kakala na hewo. <verse eid="LUK 24:29"/><verse number="30" style="v" sid="LUK 24:30"/>Kakala hasi yaje nao mandia, kasola mkate, kamuheweza Mulungu, abaho, kaumogola kawagwelela. <verse eid="LUK 24:30"/><verse number="31" style="v" sid="LUK 24:31"/>Baho meso gao gagubuka, wamtanga, ila heyo kayangayuka havihanga vao. <verse eid="LUK 24:31"/><verse number="32" style="v" sid="LUK 24:32"/>Wakiilongela, “Mioyo yetu haiding'huke ng'hani na ndeng'helelo, kipigiti viyakalile yolonga na tweye mnzila na kutugubulila Zinyandiko Zing'alile?”<verse eid="LUK 24:32"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="LUK 24:33"/>Bahaja wenuka wabweleganya Yelusalemu, wawavika waja wanahina longo dimwe na imwe waiting'hana hamoja na wanhu wayagwe, <verse eid="LUK 24:33"/><verse number="34" style="v" sid="LUK 24:34"/>na kulonga, “Kweli Mndewa kazuka na kamulawilila Simoni!”<verse eid="LUK 24:34"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="LUK 24:35"/>Baho waja wanhu wabili wasimulila gaja gawalawilile mnzila na avija viwamtambule Mndewa kipigiti viyakalile youmogola umkate.<verse eid="LUK 24:35"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Yesu Kowalawilila Wanahina Zake</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 28:16-20">Mat. 28:16-20</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 16:14-18">Mlk. 16:14-18</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 20:19-23">Yoh. 20:19-23</ref>; <ref loc="ACT 1:6-8">Sang'h. 1:6-8</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" sid="LUK 24:36"/>Kipigiti waja iwanahina wabili hawanamambukiza kuwapetela gano, bahaja Mndewa mwenyego kema mdidale jao, kawalongela, “Tindiwalo diwe hamoja namwe.”<verse eid="LUK 24:36"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" sid="LUK 24:37"/>Wasinhuka na kona bwembwe wagiza wakala wokona mzimu. <verse eid="LUK 24:37"/><verse number="38" style="v" sid="LUK 24:38"/>Ila heyo kawauza, “Habali mkona bwembwe? Habali mdungwadungwa mmioyo yenu? <verse eid="LUK 24:38"/><verse number="39" style="v" sid="LUK 24:39"/>Loleni makono gangu na magulu gangu. Mwone kamba iyo nene. Nibabaseni mwone kamba nie sio mzimu, kwavija mzimu wabule lukuli na mizege kamba vumnyona nie vinili.”<verse eid="LUK 24:39"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="40" style="v" sid="LUK 24:40"/>Kagalonga gano na kuno yowalagusila makono na magulu gake. <verse eid="LUK 24:40"/><verse number="41" style="v" sid="LUK 24:41"/>Wakala wamemile ndeng'helelo ng'hulu ng'hani na mkanganyo kuno wang'hali hawanatogola kamba iyo heyo, avo kawauza, “Mna kinhu chochose hano cha kuja?” <verse eid="LUK 24:41"/><verse number="42" style="v" sid="LUK 24:42"/>Wamgwelela kidanga cha somba kibanikigwe, <verse eid="LUK 24:42"/><verse number="43" style="v" sid="LUK 24:43"/>kakisola kakija hameso gao.<verse eid="LUK 24:43"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="44" style="v" sid="LUK 24:44"/>Abaho, kawalongela, “Iyo inhegulo ya zimbuli ziniwalongele kipigiti vinikalile ning'hali na mweye, ilondigwa gatendeke gose ganyandikiligwe muna Gamalagizo ga Musa na muna ivitabu va wahokozi na muna ikitabu cha Zabuli.”<verse eid="LUK 24:44"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="45" style="v" sid="LUK 24:45"/>Abaho, kawavugula zinzonzi zao wazimanye Zinyandiko Zing'alile, <verse eid="LUK 24:45"/><verse number="46" style="v" sid="LUK 24:46"/>kawalongela, “Yandikigwa vino, Kilisto kolondigwa yagazigwe, abaho, yadanganhike na mdizua da ikadatu yazuke, <verse eid="LUK 24:46"/><verse number="47" style="v" sid="LUK 24:47"/>na mtwaga jake, usenga wa kuwazuma wanhu waleke vilozo na kugeligwa kumgongo vilozo vao wopetigwa muisi zose kusongela Yelusalemu. <verse eid="LUK 24:47"/><verse number="48" style="v" sid="LUK 24:48"/>Mweye iwo wasindila wa mbuli zino. <verse eid="LUK 24:48"/><verse number="49" style="v" sid="LUK 24:49"/>Na nie mwenyego nowalagizila gaja gamuilagane na Tataangu. Ila kaleni himo mdiwambo mbaka vondamgweleligwe mhiko kulawa kuulanga.”<verse eid="LUK 24:49"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Yesu Kosoligwa Uchana Kuulanga</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 16:19-20">Mlk. 16:19-20</ref>; <ref loc="ACT 1:9-11">Sang'h. 1:9-11</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="50" style="v" sid="LUK 24:50"/>Abaho, kawalongoza kawagala hanze ya idiwambo mbaka Betania, aho kenula makono gake kawamoteza. <verse eid="LUK 24:50"/><verse number="51" style="v" sid="LUK 24:51"/>Viyakalile yowamoteza, kainega na hewo, abaho, kasoligwa kachola kuulanga. <verse eid="LUK 24:51"/><verse number="52" style="v" sid="LUK 24:52"/>Wamfugamila mavindi wamtambikila, abaho, wabweleganya Yelusalemu, kuno wodeng'helela ng'hani, <verse eid="LUK 24:52"/><verse number="53" style="v" sid="LUK 24:53"/>na kipigiti chose wakala Kuing'anda ya Mulungu womuheweza Mulungu.<verse eid="LUK 24:53"/></para>
  <chapter eid="LUK 24"/>
</usx>
